<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Luqqaasixxaa Wengeele</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luqqaasi Borreesseexxa Gootta No'oke Yessuusi Kirstoosixxaa Wongeele</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luqqaasixxaa Wengeele</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luq.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luqqaasi Borreesseexxa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Gootta No'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosixxa Wongeele</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Luqqaasixxi Wengeele Yessuusii'i shiqishaak edise dagaani hiyyemeexxi wabeekote'n isixxee kulendemmak Kiristoosi Isira'eelikenna manjiinxe sanne duuchchike anjirallo asse leellishatiten. Luqqaasi Yessuusii'i «Isi Hiyyeeyyeetee Wengeele lallabo'a» Ifike anninaa'n ergemeeke kadeexxanna tinni Wengeelenna manni afeexxe gargar gargar hexxeexxa rakko tikatika ora affeexxa haassotaan. Luqqaasixxe Wengeele giddo gidii'nini Yessuusixxe daggaxxee haaso'aake ediseeke hafuura adhdhuwwa'ninna iittanni langaxxa Yessuusixxe iimi'a me'atixxa kulaake muuxamiinke hafuura adhdhuwwa'n duudheendeexxi kulendeek gammashshotixxeeten. Yessuusixxe iimi'a aaggo uduma kiristoositotixxi amana higgeeni hitta ba'laatteexxa kuldaaxxa jirte Ergameeyyetike Maxaafi giddo kunninni borreessanji borreesse kule'eni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Erganna faarsiteexxa faaro, Yessuusi ileeme wodda allalisano isoo uuddeexxa kuldaaxxi jirte, Yessuusi oosummati wodda galmiinbaa me'eexxa, mararallo Samirichchiinxanna ba'eexxi afemeemmake beltixxa jirte Luqqaasixxe Wengeele'ni calla'n afendaani. Wengeeleti giddo ke'itokenaa'ni muuxamii qico'ni lumooxxi bakka uwwendeeki soodachchotixxee, Woyyichchi Hafuurixxee, melaalle Yessuusixxe erigatensha giddo affe'eemmaka boonchonna Magen cubbo gattowwaali hiyyatixxeeteni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqallo Yohaanisixxanna Yessuusixxa ileensha <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqallo Yohaannisixxa ergateensha <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yessuusixxa xammaqemanna hega uudensha <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yessuusi ergatensha Galiila safeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilii'ni Iyyerussaalemi'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxamiinxa torba Iyyerussaalemi'ninna Iyyerussaalemike qarqara'ni <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Goottiinxa leellanna iimi'a aaggo isixxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />No'oxxe oddo'n kaddeexxa yaane leellishshaaxxa jirte heddi manni dande'ee qico borreesseedheen. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Tennee yaane sireendenaa'n ille ifixxe'n uudeekiirinna ookkone hiyyichchike erganjuwwa kadeemmaakiir no'aa sa'isseexxen. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Koo ulfaatteetteke Tewofiloosii, aninna ani darree'n duuchchiinxa yaane ke'itokenaa'n kadda'n daggemmake ori qicinni xexxe'achchoti hubatenneechchi uduma hexxeeshshanni ati'a borreessa ane'n eloxxe labbee leellite. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Tenneenna assenneechchi iitti baratteettaxxi yaane dhugaate kaddeexxa egendotaa'ten.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqallo Yohaanisixxi Ileensha Edisse Kulendeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Heerodisi Yihudake boga'n moyanjoke kadeemma wodda Abiya hiyyendaaxxe qeesummatixxe ergatensha giddii'n Zakkaariyaas hiyyemaake manjo hedhemman; are isixxi Elsabeexinna Aaroonike gosati minixxe manjomman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Odo. 24:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Insa'ne lamiing Goottiinka ajajuwwanna seeruwwa duuchcha heqqedhati mitte ci'ma belo Mageni edo qullummati he'naamman. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Yaane kinni Elsabeexi ila gophpheemmaxxe'e oose anfe'emmabaan; insa'ne lamiingi woggati lumme'neemman.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Barra mitte Zekkaariyaas qeesummatixxa ergatensha, ifixxe bado baro Mageni edo qeesummati ergatema'ammaxxa yanna <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />qeesummatixxe aadashsha Goottiinke Galmi giddo hixaana mare gubatee hixik fileme. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Hixaani gubema'ammaxxe yanna ardi duuchchi gadho hedheexxi soodata'emman.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Goottiink iimik erganjinna tolchimalchokenaa'n middi darre'ni uurreexxi iso'ni leelle. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakkaariyaasinna konnee iimika erganjo afee wodda sodaate alayye'e henkekki hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Iimik erganjinna iso'o hiyyee qici: «Koo Zakkaariyaas mee sodaat; soodachcho atixxi laqende'een. Are atixxi Elsabeexi labba belto ati'a ildaan; atinna summa isika Yohaannisi hitee fulchitatton. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Isixxi ilema ati'a gammashshotenna ilillisatee kaddaan; heddi manninna isixxe ilensha'a gammadaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Isi Gootti edo lumoke kadaan; woyinetixxa bookanna machchossaaka ha'wo ha'wabaan. Isinna ama ifixike godobi giddo hedhee'naa Woyyichchi Hafuuri iso'ni wo'ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Lak. 6:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Isinna Isira'eelike ardi giddii'n heddo manna Gootta insa'neke Magenibaa wirri asse hiisaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Isinna annuwwiinxa qalbe insa'nexxe oosebaa, ajajema gophammakaaranna qulliyyetike beekkumiibaa hiisan; qixxeeffateeka arda Goottakee qixxeessatee Eelyaasike Hafuurninna hunnanni Gootti edo me'aan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Mil. 4:5-6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakkaariyaasinna ookkone iimika erganjo, «Tenne hitta ege'nanno? Ani cimeennen are anxinna lumooxxe woggaxxen.»<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Iikk iimik erganjinna hiisseexxi hiyye haaso'ee qici: «Ani Magen edo uurrannoke Gebiri'eelin. Tenne ate'ni kulonnaanna tennee eloxxa odo ati'a idagonnaa ergeme'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:18">Dan. 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kunnise yanna geltaa wodda uwwendeexxe'n muuxemaaka anka hiyyichcho amana gophpheettaxxe'e tinni yaane kaddaa qioco'ni afo'o duuddatton; dandeettenna haasoottaboxxon.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Eettene yanna ardi Zakkaariyaasii'i Woyyichchi Galmi giddii'n fulebaang tureemmaxxe'e mambe'a hiyya'n iso'o gadho heqqa'emman. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Zekkaariyaasi fuleechchi uduma mannik welti haaso'a dande'ebaan; beessiski malee'e insa'ne'n haaso'a dande'a gophpheemmaxxee Galmi giddo waleella afeexxa egenne. Isinna afo'o duudeeshshanni ture.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Zakkaariyaasinna ergatemammaxxi yanna muuxendeechchi uduma ifike minibaa illee iima hige. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ookkonneechchi uduma are isixxi Elsabeexi sila'wite; onde agenjo ifi shoxxe. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Isenna «Gootti salphine anka ardiinxe oddonaa'ni fugusso'a uudeexxi elle ifixxenni tenne ani'a asseedheen» hite.<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusixxi Ilensha Edisse Kulendeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Jiyak agenjo'n Magen ifika iimika erganjo Gebiri'eelii'i Geliila giddo hedheeke Naazireetike qachchibaa erge. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Ergemeebinna Daawwitxxe sanneke kade'eeke Yooseefi hiyyemaake manjo'n heerundo'a uwwendeexxe dubarchobaatemman. Dubarchotik summinna Maaramitemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat. 1:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Iikk iimik erganjinna isebaa dageexxi ise'e, «Tee lumoshsha eeyyendeettexxee nage'i ati'a kadowwaal; Gootti atinni hedheen; ati melaalle giddii'n eebbisendeettexxen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ati melaaleti giddii'n eebisendetexxen. Hiyyak hiyyichchi edike mirqisanjo maxafuwwa'n afamabaan</char></note>» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maariyaminna konne Iimike erganjik haaso'inni lumoshsha alalteexxi, «Kunni hittatta hedheeke nage'ixxe aadhaa?» hita'ni saadde. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Iikki iimik Erganjinna Maaramii hiyyee qici, «Maaramii mee sodaat! Magenokenaa'n elle alfite'eetten. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kunnise siila'witatton, labbaka beltonna ildatton; summa isikanna Yessuus hite'e fulchitatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat. 1:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Isinna lumoke kadaan; Lumoke Goottik Beltonna hiyyemaan. Gootti Mageninna isike annixxa Daawwitixxa mootenna isi'a uwwaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Isinna Ya'iqoobixxe sanne'n duuchchi woddi'a moyaan; mootumma isixxinna muuxama affaba'a.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maaraminna ookkone iimika erganjo, «Ani heeruma gopheennaxxee tinni hitta kada dandeetta?» hita'n qorte? <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Iimmik erganjinna hiyya'n ise'n hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Woyyichchi Hafuur ate'n hana dagaan; Lumoke Magenixxi hunna ate'n daggaan; tennexxee ilemaak woyyichchi beltinna Mageniinke Belto hiyyemaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kunnise firi atik Elsabeexi ildabaaxxen hiyyenda'n turteexxi cimo giddo labbaka siila'witeexxenni kunni jiyake agenjon. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Magenokee dandeessissabaaxxi yaane hexxebaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Dada. 18:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maaraminna, «Kunnise ani Mageniinxe garibbitten; hitetteshshanni ani'a kaddaqqata!» hite. Iimik erganjinna ise birii'n me'e.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maariyami Elsaabeexi'i Uuddo'a Me'iteexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Eettene yanna Maarami rakke kexxeexxi Yihudake koobati bogike mitte qachchibaa me'ite. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Zakkaariyaasike mine'ninna e'yiteexxi Elsabeexii'i nage'a aaxxe. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elsabeexinna Maaramika nage'a aadhatika haaso'a laqqee wodda anno isexxi godobi giddo uttaalde; Elsaabeexinna Woyyichchi Hafuurinni wo'mite. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Hafuurakanna gikki asiteexxi hitee qici, «Ati melaalle giddii'n eebbisende'ettexxen; ati ildattok beltinna eebbiseme'eeken. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Anke Goottixxi ama anibaa daga ani'a hitta hedheeke lumo ulfinna? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kunnise atike nage'ika haaso'a laqenneshshanni anno godobi anki giddo gammashshoti uttaaldeen. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Gootti kaddaan hiyye ise'n kuleexxa amandeexxi ise eebbisendeexxen.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maariyaamixxa Galatiinxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maaraminna hitee qico,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Lubbo anxi Gootta jajja;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam. 2:1-10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Hedho anxinna Mageno anke anjirallo'n gammadda;<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Isi anee heenooxxe isixxe garbitteka salphinne uudedheeken.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Telchinni edi'a ila duuchcha ane'e eebbisendeettexxe hitaan;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam. 1:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Lumoke kade'ek Magen isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">ane'n lumoxxe yaane asse'eeken; summi isikinna woyyichchake.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Gattowwaali isixxinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">isoo sodaataakeeri'a ilatenaa'n ilati qico'n hexxaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Hirre ifixxenni jabaxxe yaane asse'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">ifi giddo ifi dukammaka duuchchaara yaada insa'neengeninni xeere'een.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Galchalluwwa mootetenaa'n finqilche'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">tuffatemeeka manna kinni lummise'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Iyo. 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Solo'weekaara eloxxe yaanenni goddise'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">dureeyye kinni duwwixxe anganni me'itaashsha asse.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Gattowwaal ifixxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">erganjo ifika Isira'eeli'i gargaare'een;<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Tinninna annuwwa no'oke'n haaso'emmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Abirihaami'aanna horte isixxee'e hiyyemmaxxa duuchchi woddi'a heqqo'aaten.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Dada. 17:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maaraminna sase agenjii qico Elsaabeexxiba turteechchi uduma ifike miniba'a illeema higge.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqallo Yohaansixxa Ileensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Elsabeexixxi ilatixxi yanna geltee wodda labba belto ilde. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Olla'uwwi isekinna firuwwi isek Gootti lumooxxa mararte ise'a asseexxa lanqeexxi isenni welti gammande.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Saddeetixxe barra'n anno jila ofo'linsho'aa dange; annoteenna anniinke summinni Zakkaariyaasi hine fulchaatee hende.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Yaane kinni ama isixxi «Waawwo, summ isik Yohaannisi hiyyemuun» hite.<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Insa'nenna kinni ise'ee, «Atike firi giddii'n konne summinni ye'emeek ayyinna hedhebaan» hine.<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ookkoneechchi uduma annakanna belti atiki ayyete hiyyemee ye'emo'aa hassaate? Hine beessisk isoo qorre. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakkaariyaasinna hana borreessaaka bidiro iso'n uunaashsha laqeexxi, «Annotika summa Yohaannisi» hiyye borreesse; duuchchiing tenne jaje. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ookkonne hirba'ni Zakkaariyaasi arrabi tikeme; afo'ikinna banemee'na haaso'a dande'e; isinna Mageno galateeffata safe. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Olla'a duuchcha'ninna soda'aa galde; tinni yaane duuchcha Yihudake koobatike bogaa duuchcha'n haaso'ende. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Tennee laqeek duuchchi, «Tinni anno maa kaddaaxxixxe?» hiyya'n tennee yaane godoba galchedhe; tinni duuchchi kaddeechchi Goottiinxi hunna isinni welti hexxemmaxxeetemman.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakkaariyaasixxa Ragiinxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Eettene annok anni Zakkaariyaasi'n, Woyyichchi Hafuur wo'mee'naa raaga hiyya'n haaso'ee qici,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Arda ifika wodeemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Gootti Isira'eelik Magen saademowwaal.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Erganjo ifike Daawwitixxe hortenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">hunnaameessa anjirallo ke'isseekken.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Tinninna olma ifixxe qulliyye raagolyetike afo'o'ni haaso'emmashshanni,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />No'oo naapha no'okenaa'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">no'oo gibammakeerixxe anganaa'n anjireedheen.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Tenneenna asseechchi gattowwaal ifixxa annuwwa no'okee leellisho'anna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">woyyitte ifixxa kako qalli hiyyatee,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Anna no'oke Abirihaami'a kakateexxa kako hedatee<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Naapha no'okenaa'n no'o'o gatiseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">soda'a belo isi'a ergantonna'a,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />baro no'oka duuchcha isi edo woyyummatinna qullummati no'o uurrisaashshaten.»<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />«Iittanni tee annoo ati Lumoke Mageniinke wabeeka hiyyendatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Goottiinka ora qixxeessate isi edo me'itatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Goottikinna cubbo insa'nexxa gattowwaal hiyyat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">anjiratixxa ege'na arda ifike uwwaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Mageno no'okixxe o'watixxe gattowwaalinaa'n kexxeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">anjirenshatik ifi iimi'ni no'aa ifaashsha assa.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Tinninna dukkana giddo hedhaakeeri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">reyotike gaaddisi hundanna hedheekeeri'a xabo'anna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">Me'a no'oxxa nage'iinke oribaa akeeko'aten.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Anno iittinna nophphiteexxi hedumik jabaatte; Isira'eelike arda'ninna leelle ege'nemaa qico'n qiilla gammoojje giddo ofo'le.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Ileensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ookkone barro'n Roomixxe galcha hunda hedheek ardi duuchchi laakko'emaashsha Awugixoosi Qeesaari ajaja fulche. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kunni Qerenewoosi Sooriyake galchallo kademma wodda assemeeke siretike ardiinke laakkoossan. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Tennexxe mitti mitting manji borresemo'a ifi ifke qachchibaa me'e.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yooseefinna Daawwitixxe horteke manjo kademmaxxee'e Geliila giddo hedheek Naazireetike qachchinaa'n ke'eexxi Yihudake boga'n hedheeke Daawwitike qachcha hiyyemaake Beeteliheemike qachchibaa me'e. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Borreessemo'aa ookko'a me'eemmak ila shiqe'emmaxxe isi'a uwwendemmaxxe Maaraminni weltitemman. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ookkoonna he'nee'naa ildaaxxi yanna gelte. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Angafa beltonna ildeexxi seemmati bukki assite; keessumma galdammaba gallaaxxi bakka gonphendeemmaxxee'e annottanna hori oke'aa itammaxxe bakka'n diiphphisse.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allalisanotanna Erganna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ookkone loola'n hashsha hore heqqexxa'n gadho galdaammaxxe allalisano hexxemman. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Goottiink iimik erganjinna insa'ne bira dageexxi uurre; Goottiink ulfinninna qarqara insa'neeke'n xabe; insa'nenna lumoshsha sodaante. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Iikki iimik erganjinna insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Mee sodaatte, ardi duuchchi'a kaddaaxxa gammashshotixxa eloxxa odo ha'no'n kulonnaa dage'ennen. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Telcho Daawwitike qachcha'n anjiralli ha'no'aa ilemeedheen; isinna Gootta Kiristoositen. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ha'no'aa beessisake kadaachchinna anno seemmati bukki assendeexxi hori oke'a itammaxxe bakka'n diiphphee'naa affinaan.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Dedhange'n iimik sannachchi ookkone iimike erganjinni welti leelle; Magenokanna hinna'n galateeffantaamma qici,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Ale iima ulfinni Magenokee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">buttate'ninna isi eeyyaake manni'a nage'i kadowwaal.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ergannatinna insa'nenaa'n gargar higgeexxi iimi'a me'itee wodda allalisanonna weli'aanni wel, «Ke'we Beeteliheemi marrennexxi Gootti no'o'n leellisheexxa tennee yaane uundo» hite.<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Allalisanotinna rakke marteexxi Maaraminna Yooseefi'i affe; eettene annonna hori oke'a itammaxxe bakka'n diiphphe'naa affe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Eettene annonna anfe ke'neexxi isixxee insa'ne'n kulendemmaxxa yaane duuchcha oddeessite. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Tennee laqeek duuchchi allalisano kuldeemmaxxa yaane saade. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Maaraminna kinni tennee yaane duuchcha qalbete'n galchexxeexxi kassi hita'n hedda'emman. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Allalisanotinna duuchchiinxi yaane insa'ne'n kulendeemmashsha kaddee'naa uuddeexxeenna laqqeexxee Mageno saadda'ninna galateeffata'n ille iima higge.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anno Yessuusii Woyyichchi Galma'n Iyyemareme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Jila offo'lo'a saddeetixxi barra geltee wodda siila'wemebaa edi darre iimik erganji isi'a fulcheemmake summinni «Yessuusi» hiyyeme ye'eme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luq. 1:31</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Muuseke seerishsha luqqi hiyyatixxi yanna muuxendee wodda Yooseefinna Maariyaami eettene anno Goottakee uuno'a Iyyerusaalemi iyyemarre.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lew. 12:6-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Tinninna Goottiinke seera'n, «Labbake kadeek angafi duuchchi Goottakee foyemeeke kadaan» hiyyende borreessendemmaxxeenna<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Fula. 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12">12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />iittanni Goottiinke seera'n, «Lame guugenjo yookaan lame guugenjotixxa beltanna shiqishsha hasissaan» hiyyaake ajaja hedhemman.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Eettene yanna qullichchi Mageno sodaataak Simi'ooni hiyyemaake manjichchi Iyyerusaalemi hedha'emman. Isinna Isira'eelixxa dayya'a heqedha'emmake manjon; woyyichchi Hafuurinna iso'n hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Isinna Goottiinka Kiristoosi uudebaak reyabaaxxa Woyyichchi Hafuuri iso'n leellishe'emman. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Eettene barra Woyyichchi Hafuuri akekee'na'a Woyyichchi galmibaa mare. Annuyyotik hadi Muuseke Seerishsha hasissaaxxa isi'a assatee'e annuyyo Yessuusii'i Woyyich galmi giddo iyyedangee wodda <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simooninna eettene aadhe luu'medheexxi hiyya'n Mageno galateefatee qici,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Anke Goottaa, ani'a uutettexxe addachchiisashsha muuxende;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ta'a anee erganjo atika nage'ik adhdhi.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ille anxi manni duuchchi edo qophpheessitettexxa<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />atixxa anjira uudde'een.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Kunninna Mageno ege'nebaake gosa gosake ardi'a Mageno leellishaake ifan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">Isira'eelike ardi'aanna ulfinnaken.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Eettene annoki anninna ama tenne annoxxe kulendeexxa yaane saanda'emman. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simi'ooninna insa'nee eebbiseechchi uduma eettene annoxxa ama Maarami'i hiyyee qici, «Tinni anno Isira'eeli giddo heddi mannixxe anjirenshaxxeenna ba'nexxee buutote kaddo'a murende'een; fuggoxxa assaakeeri'aanna beessisa kaddaan; <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />heddi mannik qalbetik yaadi ege'nemo'a atixxa qalbe kinni yaaddotik wolaantichchi woxxaan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Aseerixxe gosatike mininaa'n Faanu'eelixxi belto Haanna hiyyendaaxxi wabeetto hexxemman. Isenna lumooshsha cindeemman; dubarrummati heerunde'eemmak aro'inni welt torbaane wogga turte'eemman. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Sadddeeta tommenna shoole wogga kaddaa qico'n Woyyichchi Galmi giddii'n qootebaangi hashsha barra sooddachchotinna agabo goddot ergagatenda'emmaxxe hiyyeettemman. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Eettene yanna'n isenna daggeexxi Mageno galateeffatte, Iyyerusaalemixxa wodensha heqqedha'neek duuchchi'ninna eettene annoxxee haasootte.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yooseefinna Maariyam Muusek seer ajajammaxxa duuchcha assineechchi uduma Geliilake looli giddo hedheeke Naazireetii'i ifike qachchibaa ille iima hinge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat. 2:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Anno iittinna nophphite jabaatte; beekkumikinna ise'n wo'me; Mageniink badhaadhi iso'n hedhemman.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Tommenna Lame Wogga'n Woyyichchi Galmi Giddi'a Mareexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Sa'atike Ayyaani'a hadi isik wogga wogga'ninni Iyyerusaalemi'a me'a'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Fula. 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:1-8">Lew. 16:1-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yessuusinna tommenna lame woggake kadee wodda baratendemmashanni ayyaanakee me'ine. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ayyaaniinxi barruwwa muddeechchi uduma ifike miniba'a ille iima hinga wodda belti Yessuusi Iyyerusaalemi gate; Yooseefinna ama isixxi kinni isixxa gata egenneemmabaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Insa'nen welt hedheechcho labbee'naa mitte barraka ora me'ine. Ookkoneechchi uduma ifike firuwwibanna egeneeke mannibaa isoo hasito ke'ne. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Isoo afa gonpheechchi uduma isoo hansa'n Iyyerusaalemi'a ille iima hinge. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Sakkaxxe barra uduma woyyichcha galmi giddo Muuseke seerixxe barsiisalluwwiinxe oddo'n offo'leexxi hinaaxxa caqasa'n qortumuwwakanna insa'nee qoraa'naa anfe. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Isi hiyyaaxxa laqeek duuchchi qalbeefachcho isixxe'ninna hiissichcho isika saada'emman. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Hadi isikinna isoo afee wodda mambe'a hiyye; ama isixxinna isoo, «Koo, anke belto, mayee no'o'n tennee assitette? Aninna atik anniqqa atee wixixxi hinee hansa'nennan.»<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yessuusinna «Mayee anee hassine? Anke Annike mine'n afema anee hasissaaxxa egendinebaa?» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Yaane kinni isi insa'ne'n haaso'eexxa qalbeeffanteba'a.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ookkonechchchi uduma insa'nen welt adadde Naazireeti'a me'e; insa'ne'anna ajajema'nemman. Ama isixxi tennee yaane duuuchcha qalbe ifixxi giddo uggudhita'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yessuusinna Magen edonna manji edo beekkumik, ejjumikinna elleti nophpha'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam. 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Mam. 3:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Xammaqallo Yohaanisika Lallaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Xibariyoosi Qeesaar moyeexxe tommenna ondixxe wogga'n Phanxiyoosi Philaaxoosi Yihudaa galchamma wodda, Heeroodisi Geliilaxxe sholgaxxe kutake galchallomman, iittanni dayyi isik Filiphphoosi Ixuriyaasikenna Xirakondoosixxe sholgaxxe kutake galchallo, Lisaaniyoosinna Abileenixxe sholgaxxe kutake galchallo kade'emma wodda, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Haannanna Qeyyaafa umo qeese kandeexxi he'nee'naa Mageniink hiyyichchi qiilla gammoojje giddo Zakkaariyaasika belto Yohaannisi'n dage. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohaanisinna ke'eexxi Yordanoosike qarqarike boguwwi duuchchibaa mara'n, cubbotixxe gattowwaali'a aadde aagatixxa xamaqa lallabe. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Tinninna wabeeki Issaayaasi ifike Maxaafa'n hiyya'n borreeseema qici</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Kunse qiilla gamoojje giddo raaraamake manjichchik hafuur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Goottakee ora qixxeesse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">ookkonee hodhdhichchanna isi'a toggi asse.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Dhooqa duuchchinna wo'mitowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Koobatinna tullichchi duuchchinna dirree kadowwaal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Midaamiddichchi oruwwi toggi hiyyowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">bobboqichchi hodhdhichchuwwinna ca'a hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Manjiinxi sanne duuchchinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">anjira Mageniinxa uuddaan.› »<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa. 40:3-5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohaannisinna xammaqemo'a isibaa dagaammakaara, «Ha'no dhudhdhuufiinxi oose, dagga'neexxe mufenaa'n baajjino'a ayyete ha'noo xexxe'achchiise?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Yoona, aadde aggaa leellishshaaxxa huje hujje malee ha'noo ifi'a ‹Abirihaami anna no'oka anfeennen› hiyyate'n kexxinoqqe'e, tennee kinonaa'n Magen Abirihaami'a oose ke'issa dande'aaxxa ha'no'n kulaannen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoh. 8:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ta'a qoce haqichchuwwii hunda hexxeen; eloxxa gumma gummisabaak haqichchi duuchchinna woxemeexxi giirate'n hunemaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat. 7:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ardikinna «No'ota maachcho assinanno?» hiyye isoo qore. <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Isinna insa'ne'n, «Lame seemma afeek, afebaakee qoodowwaal; itaachcho afeekinna afebaake iittanni assowwaal» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Qaraxa bukkassammakiirinna xammaqemo'a isibaa dageexxi, «Barachchiisallo no'ota maachcho assinanno?» hiyye isoo qore.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luq. 7:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Isinna insa'ne'n, «Ajajendineemma qicinaa'n lebbine qaraxxinoqqe'e» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Loliink manninna, «No'ota maachcho assinanno? Hiyyeexxi isoo qore. Isinna ayyika maallaqanna hunnat adhdhitinoqqe'e; dharikinna manjo ku'ltinoqe'e; ha'noonge rundinninni hedhdhe.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ardi duuchchi halchati heqqedha'n, «Kunni dedha Kiristoosite kaduu?» hiyya'n Yohaannisixxee qalbe giddo heda'emman. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohaannisinna hiisseexxi insa'ne'n hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Ani ha'noo woddi'ik xammaqaanen; yaane kinni anenaa'n sa'aak dagaak isi ani isixxe kopheka usurra midde tikatee geyabe'noken. Isi ha'noo Woyyichchi Hafuurinninna giirat xammaqaan. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Isi ifixxe aldumme'n midha huurakenaa'n qulleesso'a ifika qulleessatika mi'a anga afe'een; huura kinni xoxxabaaxxe giira'n gubaan.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yohaannisinna wele heddo gorsiinke haaso'inni arda gorsa'n eloxxa odo insa'ne'n lallabe.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Yaane kinni sholgaxxe kutak galchalli, Galiilak Heeroodisi ifike dayyixxa are, Heerodiyaadaxxeenna wele hujemmaxxe elobaaxxe hujexxee Yohaannisi isoo xixee wodda, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Heroodis tennee wele duuchcha'n lebeexxi Yohaannisii'i usurriinke mine'n usursiise.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:17-18">Mat. 6:17-18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussixxxa Xammaqensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ardi duuchchi xammaqemeechchi uduma Yessuusinna cuupheme. Soodata'nenge'n iima bannendee'naa: <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Woyyichchi Hafuuri guugenjotixxe fakkenni isi hana dirre; Iimi'ninna «Eeyyaanneki anki belt ateten; ate'n Ani gammadeenne» hiyaak hafuuri laqeme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Dada. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Far. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luq. 9:35</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusixxe Ilenshaka Daalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yessuusi barsiisa safaa wodda isixxi wogga sase tommeba'atemma. Ardakee Yessuusi Yooseefike belto labe'emman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yooseefinna Eelike <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eeli Maatike, Maatii Leewwike, Leewwii Milkike, Milkii Yoonake, Yoonaa Yooseefike,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yooseefii Maataatiyuke, Maataatiyuu Amootsike, Amootsii Nahoomike, Nahoomii Esiliimike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esiliimi Naaggeke, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Naaggee Ma'aatike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Ma'aatii Maataatiyuke, Maataatiyuu Semeyike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeyii Yooseefike, Yooseefii Yoodake,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoodaa Yoonaanike, Yoonaanii Reesike</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Reesii Zerubaabeelike Zerbubaabeelii Selatiyaalike, Selatiyaalii Neerike, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neerii Milkike, Milkii Haadike, Haadii Qoosaamike, Qoosaamii Elmodaamike, Elmodaamii Eerike<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eerii Yoosee'ike, Yoosee'ii Eli'ezaarike, Eli'ezaarii Yoraamike, Yoraamii Maaxaatike, Maaxaatii Leewwike,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewwi Simi'oonike, Simi'ooni Yihudake, Yihuda Yooseefike, Yooseefi Yonaanike, Yonaani Eliyaqeemike,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Elyaqeemi Meliyake, Meliyaa Mayinaanike, Mayinaanii Maxaatike, Maxaatii Naataanike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Naataanii Daawwitike, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daawwitii Isseyike, Isseyii Iyyobeedike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Iyyobeedii Bo'eezike, Bo'eezii Selmoonike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Selmoonii Na'asoonike,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Na'asoonii Aminadaabike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadaabii Raamike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Raamii Aariinike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aariinii Hetseroonike, Hetseroonii Faaresike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Faaresii Yihudake.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yihuda Ya'iqoobike Ya'iqoobi Yisaaqike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yisaaqi Abirihaamike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abirihaami Taarake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Taaraa Naakoorike,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naakoorii Seeruugike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Seeruugii Raagaawuke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Raagaawu Faaleeqike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Faaleeqii Ebeerike, Ebeerii Sheelaahike,<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sheelaahii Qayinike Qayinii Arfakisiidike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Arfakisiidii Semike, Semii Nohike, Nohii Laamehike;<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Laameehii Matusaalake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Matusaalaa Henookike Henook Yareedike Yareedii Melali'eelike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Melali'eelii Qayinaanike, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Qayinaani Henoosike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Henoosii Seetike, Seetii Addaamike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Addaami Mageniinke.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Hega Uudensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yessuus'n Woyyichchi Hafuurn wo'me'na'a Yordanoosinaa'n ille iima hige; Hafuurikinna akeekema'n qiilla gammoojjebaa me'e. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ookkonna shoole tomme barra durriis isoo hega uude. Eettene barruwwa duuchcha isi mittechchonna iteemmabaan; ookkonechchi udumanna solo'we.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Durriisikinna isoo, «Ati Mageniinke Belto kaddo'ottole kunni kinji budeenaake kaddo'a ajaji» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yessuusinna, « ‹Manji ita callinni hedhabaan› hiyyende borreessende'en» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:3">Lew. 8:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ookkonechchi uduma durriis Yessuusi'i kooba qabachchiiseexxi iikki woddi buttatixxa mootummuwwa duuchcha iso'n leellishe. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Durriisikinna iso'n hiyyee qici, «Tenne mootummuwwa duuchchik baalloominna ulfinni ani'a uwweme'emmaxxe aninna isoo eeyyenneke uwwa dande'annon. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Tennexxe ane'ni sagadottole kunnichchi duuchchi atike kadaan.»<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yessuusinna, « ‹Gootta atike Mageni'a sagadi, iso callanna magenooffat› hiyyende borreessendeen» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:13">Lew. 6:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyerusaalemi iso'o iyyemare Woyyichcha galmixxe guuto'ni iso'o uurriseexxi hiyyee qici, «Mageniinke Belto kaddo'ottole kabaa'n butti'a ifi darb. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Tinninna kaddo'a hiyyende borreessendeemma qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">« ‹Ate'e heqqito'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">ergana ifixxa isi atixxe ajajaan;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Far. 91:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Ergannatinna lekka atixxi guggufatabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">anga ifixxenni ate'e iimi'a kiphphe abidaan hiyyende borreessende'en.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:12">Far. 91:12</ref>. </char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yessuusinna, « ‹Gootta atika Mageno hega uuddoxxe› hiyyende borreessende'en» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:16">Lew. 6:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Durriisikinna hega uushsho duuchcha bireechchi uduma yannatee isonaa'n gargar hige.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Naazireet Gibemeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yessuusinna Hafuuriinxe hunnanni Geliila'a ille iima hige; gurri isikinna ookkone loola'n hedheeke boga duuchcha'n laqeme. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Insa'nenna insa'nenge Ayihudiinke magenooffachchotike mine'n barsiisa'na'a duuchching iso'o saada'nemman.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi'i Nazireetik Manni Gareereexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Ookoneechchi uduma nophphemmaba Naazireeti dage; edo assammashshanni edike sanbatixxa barranna Ayihudiinke magenooffachchotike mini giddi'a e'ye. Haaseesso'anna iima ke'eexxi uurre. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Wabeek Issayaasik Maxaafinna iso'n uwweme; Maxaafakanna farr assee wodda itti bakka hitta'emma qici:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Goottink Hafuur ane'n hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">hiyyeeyyetee eloxxa edo lallabonna'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">isi ane'e baallonse'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Usuremeekiiri'a tikeensha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">balla'uwwakee uushsho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Miicememmakeeri'anna leexa fulchchona'a anee ergee'eni.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Eettene Goottake'n elle alfiteexxa wogga lallabonna'a ane'e ergedheen.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa. 61:1-2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ookkonechchi uduma Maxaafa mirqeexxi ergatemammake'n illeema hiisse ofo'le; ookkone Ayihudootiinke magenooffachchotike mine'n hedhemmak duuchchi iso'o hubate uuda'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Isinna insa'ne'n, «Kunni haaseessema'na'a laqqineek Woyyichchi maxaafik hiyyichchi telcho muuxeme» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Isixxee duuchchiing eloka haaso'a haaso'emman; isike afo'onaa'n fula'neeke badhaadhike haaso'anaa'n kexxeexxa saanda'n, «Isi Yooseefinge beltobaata?» hine.<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Ha'no ane'e ‹Koo ci'leessichchi; ati ifinni fayyis! Qifirnahoomi'n assita'naa lanqennexxa yaane duuchcha kaba atike qachcha'ninna assi› » hiyyammaka mammaassa ani'a mammaakinaaxxi kokaken hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yessuusinna lebeexxi «Dhugaate ha'no'n haaso'annen» tininnna, «wabeek boga ifike'n ulfaataba'a<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoh. 4:44</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Yaane kinni dhugaate ha'no'n haaso'annen, iima cufendee'naa sase wogganna jaane agenjo ookkone boga duuchcha'n jabak solo'i kade'emmake Eelyaasike baro'n Isira'eeli giddo heddo aro'o shi'witeemmaxxe melaalle hexxemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Moy. 17:8-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Eelyaasi tenneeribaa ergemeba'a; Yaane kinni Sidoonake boga'n Seraapita qachchi giddo hexxemmaxxe aro'o shi'witeexxe manjoba'a ergeme. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Wabeeka Elsayike baro'ninna Isira'eelike boga'n heddo mundi manna hedhemman; yaane kinni Sooriyichcho Ni'imaanii'i malee'e konneeri giddii'n mittikinna fayyeba'a.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Moy. 5:1-14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ayihudiinke magenooffachchotike mine'n hedhemmak manni duuchchi tenne laqqee wodda lumoo qico aarre. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Offoleebaa'ninna ke'neexxi Yessuusi'i butti'a darbino'a iikki insa'neek qachchi hana ijaaremeeke tullichchiinke irga'n Yessuusi iyyemarre. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Yaane kinni isi oddo insa'neexxenaa'n sa'e me'e.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Fuggichcha Hafuura Fulcheexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi Geliila giddo heddeeke Qifirnahoomike qachchiba'a adadde mare; ookkonna edisanbatiinxa bara arda barsiisa safe. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Haaso'emmak baalloomiinke haaso'a kaddemmaxxe barsiisa isixxa ardi saade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat. 7:28-29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ookkone Ayihudootiinke magenooffachchotike mi'ne'n fuggichchi hafuuri hedheek mitti manjichchi hedhemma'a. Isinna hafuura gikki asse raara'n, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Koo Naazireetike Yessuusi! No'o'n maa afe'eette? No'o'o balleessitotta'a daggette? Ati ayyete kaddeetteexxa ege'neennen; ati Mageniinke Woyyichchan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yessuusinna, «Sammite isonaa'n fuli» hiyye iso'o xixe; fuggichchi hafuurinna ookkone manjichcho manni duuchchi edo ibiseexxi mitte miidhenshanna iso'n geessisebaangi isonaa'n fule.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Manni duuchchi saadeexxi weli'anni weli, «Isi kunni maa hiyyichchi hiyyichcho? Baalloomikinna hunnati fuggichcha hafuuruwwa ajajee'na'a fula'neen» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Yessuusik gurrinna loolake'n hedheeke bogi giddo duuchcha'n geye.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Heddo Manna Fayyiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi Ayihudootiinke magenooffachchotike minenaa'n fuleexxi Simi'oonike minibaa me'e. Simoonixxi ballonna jabake eebinjiini elagophphe'emma'a; ise fayyiso'anna iso'o kadhante. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yessuusinna ise bira uurreexxi eebiinjo ookkone'e xixe; eebinjikinna waale; isenna hirbaange'n kexxeexxi insa'ne keessunsite.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Arishsho aaggamma wodda manni gargar gargar hexxeexxe dhibeka manna duuchcha Yessuusiba iyyedage; isinna mitte mittenge'n anga hana uggureexxi duuchchiinga fayyise. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Iikki Fuggichchi hafuuruwwinna raara'n, «Ati Mageniinke Belton» hiyya'n heddo mannanaa'n fule; Isi Kiristoosite kadeexxa iikki fuggichchi hafuuruwwi haaso'o'a eeti uwwebaan.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Galiilike Boncho'n Barsiiseexxa</para>
  <para style="s1">(Mat. 4:23-25, Mar. 1:35-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bogi soodaa wodda Yessuusi manji hedhebaaxxe mitte bakkabaa'a me'e; ardikinna isoo hasa'n, isi hedheeba dageexxi insa'nenaa'n gagar hige me'abaashsha isoo hoyyatee wo'laane. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Isi kinni, «Mageniinxe mootummaxxa wengeele wele qachchuwwa'ninna lallaba ani'a hassisaan; ergeme'ennechchinna tennexxeeten» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yihuda giddike Ayihudootiinke magenooffachchotike mi'nuwwa'ninna lallaba safe.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusii Siretixxa Hordofeeyye Ye'eexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ardikinna dowwe isixxe'n weli dhiiba'n isi barsiisaammaka Mageniinka hiyyichcho laqaama wodda Yessuusi Geensareexxixxe abbaayya bira uurreemman. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Eettene yanna lame hobolo abbaayyati qarqara uurrite'na'a afe; qulxu'me abidammak manni hobolo giddii'n fuleexxi marabe anshedha'emman. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yessuusi eettene hoboluwwa giddii'n Simi'oonixxe hobolo kaddeexxi giddi'a e'ye; Simi'ooniinna, koo Simi'ooni! Tenne Hobolo shiixxo qico buttinakenaa'n abaayyatiba'a shikki assaashsha laqe. Ookkonneechchi uduma eettene hobolo giddo ofo'leexxxi arda barsiisa safe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mat. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mar. 3:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Haaso'a bireechchi uduma Simi'oonii'i, «Hobolo atixxa dhi'mote'n shikki assi; marabe ha'nooxxanna qulxu'me abidino'a darbe» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simi'ooninna «Barachchiisalloo, hashsha duuchcha eloonna'n gallennexxi mittelchonna abindebe'noni. Yaane kinni ati hitettexxe'e marabe darbina'ennen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yoh. 21:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Marabe darbinee wodda marabe insa'neexxi qurubbi qurubbi hutaa qico'n hara bira saxxeexxa qulxu'me abinde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yoh. 21:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Tennexxe wele hobolo'n hedheeki insa'neeki jaaluwwi dangeexxi insa'ne gargarro'a qinphe ye'ne; insa'nenna dangeexxi iitti lame hoboluwwa lixxa shiqa qico'n qulxumuwwa itti wonshine. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna tennee uude wodda Yessuusi edo guluffateexxi, «Goottaa! Ani cubbaleessa manjo kadeennaxxe'e ani birii'n me'i» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Tenne hiyyeechchi isinna isinni welti hedhemmak isiki jaaluwwi abindeexxe qulxu'mexxe bira sa'ne'n saandeemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Simi'oonike jaaluwwa kadde'exxi Zebidewoosixxi labbaxxi oose, Ya'iqoobinna Yohaannisi iittanni saande'emma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Yessuusinna Simooni'i, «Mee sodaati; konneechchi edi'a manjo bukki assitattoke kaddaton» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Insa'nenna hoboluwwa ifi ifixxa woddi'i qarqari'a shikki assineechchi uduma duuchchingechcho waalleexxi Yessuusi'i hordonfe.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Soomi Abideeka Manjichcho Fayyise.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Mitte barra Yessuusi qachcha mitte'n hedhe'naa soomi biso isika duuchcha bire'eek manjichchi Yessuusiba dage; isinna Yessuusi uudeexxi albik gonbisemeexxi, «Goottaa! Fedhi atixxe kaddoole anee fayyisa dandeettatton» hiyye isoo kadhate. <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yessuusinna anga ifixxa diriirseexxi ookkonee manjichcho qaqqabeexxi, «Eeyyannen fayyi!» hiyye; hirbange'n manjichchokenaa'n soomi ba'e. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi ookkone manjichcho, «Tenne yaane mitte manjo'ninna kuldoxxe; yaane kinni martettexxi ifi qeesichchoke'n leellish; insa'ne'anna dhugaate kaddo'a atixxe fayya'a Muuse ajajemmashsha tolcha shiqishe.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew. 14:1-32</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Yaane kinni Yessuusixxe'e haaso'endeexxi odo caala boga duuchcha'n laqende. Heddi ardinna isonaa'n laqo'anna dhibo ifixxenaa'n fayyate'e isibaa daga'nemmani. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Yaane kinni isi yanna yanna'n qofibaa me'eexxi soodata'nemman.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Gogeeka Manjichcho Fayyiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Mitte barra Yessuusi barissiisa'neeke'n mitti mitti Feerisitotinna Muuseke seerik barachchiisalluwwi isi bira ofolleemman; insa'nenna Geliilakenna Yihudake qachcha duuchchanaa'n iittanni Iyyerusaalemike qachchanaa'n dageeke mannamman. Yessuusi dhibemeeka manna fayyisaashsha Goottiinxi hunna isinni welti hexxemman. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Eettene yanna manni gogeeka manjichcho rarete'n dukeexxi Yessuusi hedheeke mine'n iyyemareexxi iso'o isi edo ugo'a wo'laane. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Yaane kinni Manniinxe bira sa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa ookkonee gogeeka manjichcho mini'a e'yisha insa'nee rakkisse; tennexxe isoo heellichchoti iima iyyemareexxi heellichcho maanqeexxi rareendinn dirrinseexxi mannixxe oddo'n Yessuusi edo uggine. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yessuusinna amana insa'neexxa uudeexxi ookkone gogeemmaka manjichcho «Koo manjichcho! Cubbo atixxi gattowwaali hiyyende'een» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Feerisitotinna Muuseke seerik barsisalluwwi, «Isi kunni iitta hedheeka yowwichchiinka afo'o fulchedha'neek aate? Cubbotee gattowaali uwwa dande'aak Mageno malee weli aate?» hina'n hedate'n ke'ne. <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yessuusinna heduma insa'neeka ege'neexxi insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Mayee qalbe ha'nooxxe'n tenne hedina? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />‹Cubbo atixxi gattowwaali hiyyende'en› hiyyatenaa'inna, ‹Kexxettexxi me'i!› hiyyatenaa'n heente shollexxa? Hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Yaane kinni Manjiinki Belti buttate'n cubbotee gattowwaal uwwatika baallooma afeexxa ege'na ha'no hassisaan» hiyya'n ookkone gogeemmaka manjichcho, «Koo manjichcho, rare atixxa dulkite atike miniba'a me'i!» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Iikki goge'emmak manjichchinna hirbange'n insa'ne edo ke'e uurreexxi itti hana diipheemmaxxa rare dulke, Mageno galateeffata'n ifike miniba'a me'e. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Duuchchiingi lumo qico masoten hiyyati sodaateexxi, «Telcho mambe'a yaane uundenne!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Maatewoos Hiyyemaaka Leewwichcho Ye'eexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ookkoneechchin uduma Yessuusi ookko'n fuleexxi me'a wodda Leewwi hiyyemaak qaraxa bukki assammak manjichchi qaraxi bukki assemammaxxe baka'n ofo'lee'naa'a afeexxi iso'o, «Ane'e hordof» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Leewwinna ke'eexxi duuchchiingechcho waaleexxi Yessuusi'i hordofe.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Leewwinna mine ifike'n Yessuusi'a lumoxxa jila jile; insa'nen weli heddi qaraxxa bukkassammak manninna wel heddi manni eettene jilaxxa ita itate'n ofo'leemman. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Feerisitotinna insa'neek Muuseke seerik barachchiisalluwwi, «Ha'noo qaraxa bukki assammakeerinninna cubbaaleeyyeti itine ha'witinaachchi mayeete?» hina'n Yessuusixxa hordofeeyye aallante.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luq. 15:1-2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'ni hiisseexxi hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Ela gopheekeeri'aate malee fayyakeeri'a ci'leessi hasisabaani. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ani dageennechchi cubbaaleeyye aadde aaggotee ye'ete malee qulliyye ye'onna'atebaan.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Agabo Goddotixxee Qoreme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Insa'nenna Yessuusii'i «Yohaannisixxi hordofeeyye ita ha'wabelo hossa'n soodattaan; Feerisitotinna iittanni assitaan; atixxi hordofeeyye kinni duuchchi wodda itta'n ha'witaachchi mayeete» hine qorre. <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yessuusinna hiisseexxi hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Waajubichchi insa'nen welti hedhe'na'a jaaluwwi isik agabo goddo hedhaashsha assa dandeessisaa? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Yaane kinni waajubichchi insa'nenaa'n adhdhemaaxxe yanna daggaan; ookkone wodda insa'ne agabo goddo honsaan.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yessuusinna lebeexxi mitte mammaassa insa'ne'n hiyya'n mammaakee qici, «Ayyinna haarooxxa seemma dareexxi dullatte seemma'n erbaak hedhebaa; iitta asseexxe kaddoole kinni isi haarooxxa seemma dara hassissa; haarroxxi erbenna dullatete seemmanni welt me'itabaan. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Itani ayyinna dullatte qalqallo'n reefixxa woyinetixxa booka uggaak hedhebaan; uggeexxe kaddoole kinn reefixxi woyinetixxi booka qalqallo eettene dartaan; iitti woyinetixxi bookanna dunendaan; qalqallotinna la'o belo gatta. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Reefixxa woyinetixxa booka kinni haarooxxe qalqallo'n uggemiyyo hassissa. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Turteexxa woyinetixxa booka ha'weechchi uduma reefixxa ha'wo'a hasaaki ayyinna hedheba'a; tinninna kaddaachchi ‹Turteexxa woyinetixxa booka woyyani› hiyyemmaxxeeten.»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Edike Sanbatika Gootta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Edike Sanbatixxa barra Yessuusi dinneetike fichchi giddi'n sa'a'nemman; hordofeeyye isixxinna dinneetike tishshika umo kukkutteexxi angate'n qushshexxa'n itta'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Feerisitotenaa'n mitti mitti manni, «Edike Sanbatixxa barra'n assendo'a eeti uwwendebaaxxa yaane mayee assina'ne?» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yessuusinna insa'nen hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Isinna isinni welt hedhemmak manni solo'wee wodda Daawwiti asseexxa haranga haasoossa gophphine'eta? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Isi Mageniinke mine'n e'yeexxi qeesole malee'e weli mittikinna itabaashsha seerik hoyyemeeka tolchaiinka buddeena aadheexxi ite; isinni hedhemmake manni'anna uwwe» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yessuussinna lebeexxi, «Manjiink Belti Edike Sanbatike Goottan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Anga Naafa Manjichcho Fayyiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar. 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Wele Edike Sanbatixxa barra'n Yessuussi Ayihudinke magenofachchotike mini giddo e'yeexxi barsiisa'nemman; ookkoonna middixxi anga isixxi goge'eek mitti manjichchi hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Feerisitotinna Muuseke seerik barachchiisalluwwi Yessuussi ku'latee buuto haseexxi, isi Edike Sanbatixxe barra'n fayyisaaxxa afatee iso'o heqina'emman. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yessuussi kinni yaada insa'neeka ege'neexxi ookkone anga naafa manjichcho, «Kexxeteexxi oddo giddo uurri» hiyye. Manjichchikinna ke'e uurre.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Eetene yanna Yessuusinna insa'nee, «Ani ha'no'o qoro, Edike Sanbatixxe barra'n eeti uwwendeexxi eloxxa assateemoo? Yookaan elobaaxxa hujateete? Yookaan lubbo fayyisate mo'o yookaan lubbo shiyateete?» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yessuussinna dowwe ifixxe duuchcha'n hedheeka manna uudeechchi uduma ookkone anga naafa manjichcho, «Anga atixxa diriirsi» hiyye. Manjichchikinna anga ifixxa hiyyendeemmashshanni asse; anga isixxinna haranga fayyaxxe kadde. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Insa'ne kinni lumooshsha mufanteexxi Yessuusi'n maa assinaaxxa welt mari'aante.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tommenna Lamiinxe Ergameeyeexxa Ye'ensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Eettene barruwwa giddii'n mitte barra Yessuussi soodachchotee kooba qabate; hashsha duuchchanna Mageno soodata'n gale. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bogi soode woddanna hordofeeyye ifixxa ifibaa ye'e; insa'ne giddii'n tommenna lame file; insa'neenna «Hordofeeyye» hiyye suumma fulche <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Insa'nenna Pheexiroosite hiyye summa fulcheeke Simi'ooni, dayyi isik Indiryaasi, Ya'iqoobi, Yohaannisi, Filiphphoosi, Bertelomewoosi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Maatoosi, Toomaasi, Ilfiyoosik belti Ya'iqoobinna, «Hinaatichchake» hiyyeme ye'emeeke Simi'ooni, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Ya'iqoobik beti Yihudanna Yessuusii sa'isse uwweeke Asiqorootuke Yihuda.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eebatixxanna Daabbachchotixxa Lallaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yessuusi koobatenaa'ni dirreexxi heddo ifixxe ergameeyyen welti diidake'n uurre; isixxe hordofeeyye giddii'n heddi manni ookko hedhemman; iittanni weli heddi ardinna ookko hedhemman; insa'nenna dangeek Yihudake boginaa'n, Iyyerusaalemike qachchanaa'n, abbaayyati qarqara hedheeke Xiroosikenna Sidoonake qachchuwwi giddii'n dageeke lumoshsha heddi manni ookko hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Insa'nenna dangeek hiyyaaxxa lanqo'anna ififixxe dhibenaa'n fayino'atemman; fuggichchi haafuuruwwinni rakkatammakriinna dageexxi faya'neman. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Hunna isonaa'n fulda'n duuchchinga fayyissaammaxxe'e ardi duuchchi isoo kiso'a halcha'emman.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gammashshotixxanna Yaaddotixxa Buutuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat. 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yessuusinna ifixxe hordofeeyyebaa uuda'n hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">«Mageniinxi mootummanna ha'nooxxe kaddemmaxxe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Ha'no hiyyeeyye eebbisendineeken.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Ha'noo ta'a solo'w'tina'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">uduma godditinammaxxee eebbisendine'eeken</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Ha'noo ta'a ooxxina'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">uduma oso'litinammaxxee eebbisendine'eeken<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Manni ha'noo Manjiinke Beltixxee hiyyeexxi jibbaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ha'noo fooya woddanna ha'noo'n gacifata wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ha'noo gibeexxi fuggoka summanna ha'no'a uwwa wodda, ha'noo eebbisendineeken.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />«Kunse hiri ha'nook iimate'n lumooke kadeemmaxxe eettene barra gammadde; fananaqqe; ha'nooka edika annuwwa'ninna wabeeko'n iitta hexxeenxe fuggo assine'emman.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />«Ha'noo kinni dureeyye ta'a danqasha galdinaachcho alfitineemmaxxe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">ha'no'aa aanne'e.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ha'noo ta'aa goditineeke dokko solo'witinammaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ha'no'aa aanne'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ha'noo ta'aa osoldina'neek dokko yaaddinammaxxeenna ooxxinammaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ha'no'aa aanne.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Manni duuchchi ha'nooxxee elle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">haaso'aa wodda ha'no'aa aanne'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ha'nook edik annuwwinna dhariyye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">wabeekoxxee iittanni eloxxa haaso'emman.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naaphpha Eeyya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat. 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat. 7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Yaane kinni ha'noo anenaa'n laqina'neekeri'a: naapha ha'nooka eeyye; ha'noo gibaake elooxxa asse. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Ha'noo badinaakaara eebbisse; ha'noo miidhaakeeri'anna soodatte. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Atixxa mitte boqo dhabanaasakee langaxxaa boqonna isi'a wirri assi. Dudda atika adhdhaake gonfa atikanna isi'a lebbe uwwi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Kadhataake duuchchi'a uwwi; karra atixxa adhdhaak ati'a hiisso'aa mee isoo laqi. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Manji ha'no'aa asso'aa hassinaaxxa duuchcha ha'nonna iittanni welekee asse.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />«Ha'noo eeyyaakaara eetinoole maa hira affine? Cubbaaleeyyetinna midde insa'ne eeyyaange eettaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ha'no'aa eloxxa asseekiiri'a eloxxa assitinoole maa hira affina? Cubbaaleeyyetinna midde tennende assitaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Liqa no'aa hiissinaan hitine heddinaake manni'aa liqeessitnoole maa hira affinaa? Ookkone liqeessiteemanga wirri assinee adhdhatee cubbaleeyye midde cubbaaleyyetee liqeessitaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ha'noo kinni naaphaa ha'nooka eeyye; elloxxanna insa'ne'aa asse; no'aa hiissaan hitine addattinebaang liqeesse; tennee assitinoole hiri ha'nook iimate'n lumoke kadaan; Lumoke Magenixxe oosenna hiyyendinaan; tinninna kaddaachchi isi galata afebaakeeri'anna fuggaaleeyyetee arjake kadeemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Ha'nook Anni mararalloke kademmashshanni ha'noonna marartinaake kadde.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Weleke'n Mura Hasissabaaxxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat. 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Murtinoqqe; ha'noo'n murendabaan; wele mannanna tuffatinoqqe ha'noonna tuffatendinabaan; welekee gattowwaali hiyye; ha'no'aanna gattowwaal hiyyendinaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Uwwe ha'no'aa uwwendaan; safartinaake saffaranjo'n iittanni ha'no'aa saffarendaan. Iittanni eloke saffaranjo'ni ranbe sonqee'naa dunemaa qico'ni tullubemeeke eloke saffaranjo'ni ha'no'aa uwwendaan.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Higgeene Yessuussi konne mammaassa hiyya'n insa'ne'n kulee qici, «Balla'i balla'a akeeka dande'aata? Lamiing weli adhdhe balete'n e'yabaata? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Baratalli barachchiisallokenaa'n sa'abaa; yaane kinni geltaa qico barateek ifinge barachchiisallishsha kada.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />«Atike dayyixxe illee'n hedheeka huura mayee uuddatota? Atixxe ille'n hedheeka jirma mayee uudda gophphato? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Atixxe ille'n hedheeka jirma affeboxxok atika dayyo ‹Anke dayyoo atixxe ille'n hedheeke huriinxa buko hitta ati'a fulcho?› hiyya dandeettatto? Koo ati ifi uggudhalli edissettexxi illee atixxenaa'ni jirma fulchedhi; ookkonneechchi uduma atike dayyixxe ille'n hexxeexxa huuriinxa buko ca'a asitee afa dandeettatton.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haqichchokanna Gumma Isixxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat. 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Elok haqichchi elobaaxxa gumma gummisaba'a; ittani elobaaki haqichchinna eloxxa gumma gummisaba'a. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Haqichchi duuchchi gumma ifixxenni ege'nemaan. Qosorrotenaa'n odi'iinxa gumma qoncaba'a; iittanni hokokkot haqichonaa'ninna woyyinetixxa gumma qoncabaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Elok manji qalbe ifixxe'n wo'miteexxe eloxxe yaanenaa'n fulchedhaan; elobaak manjinna qalbe ifixxe'n womiteexxe fuggoxxe yaanenaa'n fulchedhaan. Manji qalbe ifixxe'n wo'mite danbalaateexxe yaane afo'o ifikenni haaso'aan.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miniinke Ijaarsallika Lame Hujaluwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Ani hiyya'ennexxa assitina'nebaan, mayyeeta ane'e ‹Gootta anke Gootta anke› hitina? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Aniba'a dagaakinna hiyyichcho anka laqeexxi assaak ayyee fakkaataaxxa ha'no'n leellishaannen. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Isi mine ijaaro'aa giisse'e butti'a umeexxi hundixxe jabaxxe rassa hana miniinxa booso ijaaraake manjichcho fakaataan. Lola'ikinna dageexxi mine ookonne'e dhibee; yaane kinni jabaxxe booso hana ijaarememmaxxe iso'o lele'misa dande'ebaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Yaane kinni hiyyichcho anka laqeexxi iso'ni ajajemabaak buttina duwwike'ni hana keffi asseexxi mine ijaareke manjo fakaataan; ookko'ni lola'ikinna dageexxi mine ookkone'e dhiibe hirbange'ni mittenba fottoqeexxi ibe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Dhibba Ajajallika Erganjo Fayyise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yessuussi tennee yaane duuchcha ardake'n haaso'e bireechchi uduma Qifirnahoomi'a me'e. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ookkoonna mitte dhibbiink ajajalli hedhemmaan; yo'oshsha eeyyaak isik erganjinna dhibemeexxi reyo shiqe'emmaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Iikki dhibbiink ajajallinna odo Yessuusixxa laqeexxi erganjo ifika isi'aa dagee fayyiso'aa isoo kadhato'aa mitte mitte Ayihudiinxa geedhe Yessuusibaa erge. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Insa'nenna Yessuusibaa marreexxi «Konne majichchi'a tennee assiyyo hasissaake manjon; <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />isi arda no'oka eeyyaaken; magenoonfachchotika minenna no'o'a ijaareedheen» hina'ne jabaa qicinni isoo kadhante.<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yessuusinna ke'eexxi insa'nenni welti me'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Isike minibaa shiqee wodda iikki dhibbiink ajajallinna ifika erganjuwwa Yessuusi'ni hiyya'ni ergee qici, «Anke Gootta ati anke mine'ni e'yatee ani geyennekebaan mee elo'i. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Aninna umo aningenninni atibaa dagiyyote'e geyeenneke manjobaan. Yaane kinn mitte hiyyichcho calla hiyyi, erganji anki fayyaan. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Aninna umo angeninni baalloomik ani'a iima hedheekee ajajemaanneke manjon. Aninna ani'a hunda ajajemaake loliinke manna afeenne; mitte ‹Me'i› hiyyonnole me'a; welekanna ‹Amo› hiyyonnole daga; anka erganjonna ‹Tenne huji› hiyyonnole huja.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yessuusinna tenne laqeexxi saade; udumi'anna wirri hiyyeexxi iso hordofammake arda'ni, «Iitta hexxeexxa lumooxxa amanna Isira'eeli giddo midde hara afe ege'nebe'non» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ergeme'emmak manninna ookkone dhibbiinke ajajallibaa illee iima hige dagee wodda erganji iikki fayyeena anfe.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Aro'i reyeexxe manjichchoxxa Belto Reyotenaa'n Ke'isse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi Nayin hiyyemaake qachchibaa mare; hordofeeyye isixxinna heddi ardinna isinni welti me'e. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Yessuusinna ookkone qachchixxe hula bira geyaa wodda manni reyeeke manjika rensha dukeexxi qachchi giddii'n fula'emma; iikki reyeek manjinna amatee mitte beltomman; ama isixxinna aro'o shiwiteexxe hiyyeettemmaa; isenninna welti heddi manninna hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Goottikinna ise'e uude wodda ise'a marareexxi ise'e «Mee oodh!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yessuusinna shiqeexxi eettene renshiixxa rare angati tuqe; rare dukeemmak manninna uurre; Yessuusinna, «Koo dargaggeessa atee ke'i hiyya'ennen» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Reyemmaakinna qophphiyye ke'e ofo'leexxi haaso'atte'ni ke'e; Yessuusinna ama isixxe'ni isoo uwwe.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Duuchchiing alayyik wexeqemmeexxi Mageno saada'ni, «Lumok wabeek no'oxxe oddo'n ke'edheeni; Magenikinna arda ifika gargaaro'a dage'en» hine. <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Yessuusixxi odonna Yihudake boga duuchcha'ninna qarqarake'ni hedheeke boga duuchcha'ni gelte.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusiinna Xammaqallo Yohaanisi'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat. 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Yohaanisixxe hordofeeyye tennee kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha Yohaannisi'n kulle; Yohaanisinna insa'ne giddii'n lame ifibaa ye'eexxi, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />«Iikki daga'neen hiyyenda'attak atetemo yookaan weleke heqe'nanno?» hitineexxi iso'o qorre hiyya'n Gootta Yessuusibaa erge.<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Iikki manninna Yessuusibaa mareexxi, « ‹Iikki dagaan hiyyendaattak atetemo yookaan wele heqe'nanno?› hitineexxi iso'o qorre hiyya'n atiba Yohaannisi no'oo ergeen» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Eettene yanna'ninni Yessuusi heddo manna gargar gargar hedheek dhukkubanaa'ni, dhibonaa'ninna fuggichchi hafuuruwwinaa'n fayyise; heddo ballauwwixxa illenna baqqi asse. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yessuusinna ookkone ergemeexxi dagemmake manna'ni hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Martineexxi laqqineexxanna uuddineexxa Yohaannisi'n, ballaa'i afaan, naafuwwikinna me'aa'ni, soomuwwi fayye ca'a hiyyaan, mansha duudeekiir laqaan, reyeekirinna ke'aan; hiyyeeyyeeteenna wengeele lallabendaa'ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ane'ninna guggufatabaak isi eebbisemeeken.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Yohaanis ergemmak manni me'eechchi uduma Yessuusi Yohaannisixxee ardake'ni hiyya'ni haaso'ee qici: «Maa uuddino'a qiilla gammoojje giddi'a martine? Diidallo lelle'misaake shonbooqo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Yookaan maa uuddino'a martine? Dancha seemma odo'weeka manjo uuddino'aan? Dancha seemma oddo'waakiirinna danqashaa galaakiir mootomatike mi'ne'nten hedheek. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Maachchota uuddino'a martine? Wabeeka? Eetti, ani ha'no'n kulo, wabeeka sa'aaka uudateeten. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Tinni isixxee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">« ‹Kunse ati edo me'aani ora ati'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">qixxeessaaka anka eranjo ergannon› hiyyende borreesendeek isoten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ani ha'no'n kulo melaalletenaa'n ilemeekeerinaa'n Yohaannisii'i sa'aak ayyinna hedhebaa; yaane kinni Mageniinxe mootumma'n duuchchiingenaa'n heeno'maak isinaa'n sa'aan.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Qaraxa bukki assammaakiir midde gatebaak koonne Yessuusika haaso'a laqeek ardi duuchchi Yohaannisixxe anga'n xammaqemat Mageniinxa dhugaalessumma kokeesse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat. 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luq. 3:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Feerisitotinna Muuseke seerixxi beettuwwa kinni Yohaanisixxe anga'n xammaqema gophat Mageni insa'ne'a afeeka yaada ginbe.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />«Yoona, konne barika manna mayik fakkeessanno? Insa'neta maachcho fakkaanta? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Dikko giddo ofoldeexxi weli yexxa'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">« ‹Suusu'le ha'no'a ufuunfennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ha'no kinni sirbitineba'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Wi'lishsha ha'no'a wi'lishinenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ha'no kinni ooxxineba'a› hitaaxxe oose fakkaantaan.<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Iittani xammaqalli Yohaannisi itebaakinna woyinetixxa booka ha'webaak dagee wodda, ‹Iso'n duriisake hedheen› hitine. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Manjiink Belti kinni ita'n ha'wa'n dagee woddi isoo, ‹Itallokenna ha'walloke; qaraxa bukki assamake mannikenna «cubbaaleeyyetike» jaalon› hitineen. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Yaane kinni beekkumiinxi dhugaaleessumma oose ifixxe'ni kokeessende.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manjichcho Mitte Yessuusi'n Shitto Issiteexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Feerisitotenaa'n mitti isinni welti ita ito'a Yessuusii'i ye'e. Yessuusinna ookkone Feersichchi mine'n e'yeexxi ito'a ofo'le. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ookkone qachcha'n mitte cubbaaleette manjichcho hexxemman; isenna Yessuusi Feerisichchiinke mine'n ita ito'a offo'leexxa laqqee wodda Albasixxiroosixxe bilqaaxxe'n wo'ma shitto aaxxe dagge.<verse eid="LUK 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Yessuusi udumi darreenna lekka isixxi bira uurrite ooxxa'n lekka isixxa indiiddot shanshita'n, ifike umike oridichchinninna fiyate'n kexxe; lekka isixxanna sunqexxa'n shittotanna itti issite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat. 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh. 12:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Yessuusii'i ye'emmak iikki Feerisichchi tennee uudee wodda ifike godobi iddo, «Kunni manjichchi wabeekake kade'eele tinni manjichcho ayyete kaddeexxanna hitta hexxeexxe cubbaalleette kaddeexxa ege'namman» hiyya'n hede. <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yessuusinna iso'n hiyye hisse haaso'ee qici, «Koo Simi'ooni ate'n kulaannechcho hedheeni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:40">Isinna «Barachchiisallo ane'n kuldaata» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />«Mitte liqeessallonaa'n liqe'effate'emmak lami manni hedhemman. Mitteke'n onde dhibba dinaare, mitteke'ninna onde tomme dinaare hexxemman. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Liqeeffateek lamiing manni liqa hissa gonphee wodda liqeessalli insa'nee lamiingee waale. Yoona konne lamenaa'n ookkone liqeessallo caala eeyyaak honte?»<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simi'ooninna, «Ani'a jirak liqi isi'a waalemeeke laba» hiyya'n hiisse haaso'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yessuusinna Simoonii'i «Hissitette qici dhugaate» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yessuusinna eettene manjichchobaa wirri hiyyeexxi Simi'oonii'i, «Tennee manjichcho uudda'inn hexxebexxo? Ani mine atike'n e'yennen; ati lekka anxee midde wode'e uutebexxo; ise kinni lekka anxa indiddo ifixxen shanshita'n ifike umike ordichchinni filte. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ati anee sunqexxebexxo; ise kinni e'yennexxe yannanaa'n lekka anxa sunqecca uurrisseba'a. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ati umo anke'n zayite issitebexxo; ise kinni shitto lekka anxe'n issite. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Tennexxee, ani ate'n kulo ise lumoo qica eettemmaxxee isexxe heddo cubbo ise'a gattowwaal hiyyende'een. Cubbo isixxe shiixxo qica gattowwaal hiyyendeek kinni eeyyaak shiixo qicon» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yessuusinna eettene manjichcho, «Cubbo atixxi gatowwaal hiyyende'een» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Isinni welt ito'a ofo'lemmak manni duuchchinna, «Cubbo midde gattowwaal hiyyaak isi kunni ayyete?» hiyya'n qalbe giddo hedate'n ke'e. <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yessuusinna eettene manjichcho, «Amana atixxi atee anjirte'een, nage'ik me'i» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusii'i Hordoffemaxxa Melaalle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ookkoneechchci uduma Yessuusi qachchuwwake'ninna ola'uwwake'ni Mageniinxe mootummaxxa eloxxa odo lalaba'ninna kula'n marema'nemman. Iikk tommenna lami manninna isinni welti hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Iittani fuggichcha hafuuranaa'ninna wele dhukkubanaa'n fayyitemmaxxi mitte mitte melaalle isinni welt hexxemmani. Insa'nenna Yessuusi torbaane fuggichcha hafuura isenaa'n fulchemmaxxi Megidelixxi Maarami, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Heeroodisike minike ajajallo kade'eemmake Kuuzaxxi are Yohaana, Soosiinanna wele heddo melaalle hexxemman. Tinni melaalle Yessuusinna isixxa hordofeeyye ifi'a horateechchinni gargaarta'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mat. 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-44">Mar. 15:40-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luq. 23:49</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wiisalliinka Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Heddi ardi mitteba bukki hiyee woddanna qachcha qachchanaa'n isibaa dagee wodda konneechchi butta hedheeka mammaassa hiyye insa'ne'n mammaakee qici.<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Mitti wiisalli sanne rolko'a fule; rolkaa woddanna mitte orrii qarqara ibbeexxi hirbeessende; ci'atinna daggeexxi isee qoce. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Weletinna carete'n ibbeexxi latte wodda ookkone boga'n shamini hedha gopheemmaxxee bagge. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Wele sannenna utetixxe oddo'ni ibbe. Utetinna welti nophphiteexxi isee huuteexxi abidde. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Wele sanne kinni eloke buttina'n ibbe; lattenna nophphiteexxi mitte mittind dhibba anga gummisse.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yessuusinna tennee haaso'e ke'eexxi, «Laqqaaxxa mansha afeek laqowwaal!» hiyya'n hafuura gikk asse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Mammaassik Haaso'eexxe Buutoxxe'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar. 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Isixxi Hordofeeyyeerinna «Konne mammaassixxi tika maachcho» hine Yessuusi qore. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yessuusinna hiyyee qici, «Ha'no'a Mageniinxe mootummaxxi buqo yaane ege'na uwwende'een; Welekeeri'a kinni mammasik haaso'aannen; tinninna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">« ‹Uunda'ninni anfabaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">lanqa'ninni qalbeeffantabaashsha yaane duuchcha insa'ne'n mammaassiki haaso'anno.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 6:9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wiisaliinke Mammaassixxa Tika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat. 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar. 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Ookkone mammaassixxi tikanna konneechchi butta hexxe; Iitti sanne Mageniinke hiyyichcho; <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Oriin qarqara ibbeexxi sanne hiyyichcho Mageniinka laqaake mannan; yaane kinni insa'nee amanneexxi anjiremmabaashsha duurriisi dageexxi ookkonee hiyyichcho qalbe insa'nexxenaa'n adhdhaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Carete'n ibbeexxinna hiyyichcho laqaa wodda gammashshoti laqqaakeeran; yaane kinni insa'ne yannateete amane malee'e hidda afa gonphemaxxee hega uushsho daggaa wodda waakataake mannan. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Utetixxe oddo'n ibbeexxi sanne hiyyichcho laqaake mannan; yaane kinni tennee buttak yaadinna danqasha galatixxi halcha insa'nee huuteexxi gumma belo gatissaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Eloke buttina'n ibbeexxi sanne ookkone hiyyichcho qajeeltonna eloxxe qalbenni laqeexxi heqqedhaakeeran; insa'ne hiyyichcho lanqeexxi ossati gumma gummisaakeeran.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xassimalchi Hana Hedheeka Xassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar. 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Lebeexxi Yessuusi xassa xasseexxi manji mini'a e'yaak ifa ookkone uuda'n e'yaashsha xassimalchi hanna uggaa malee gaane giddo yookaan taqeti hunda uggaak ayyinna hedheba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luq. 11:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Iittann leellitabaaxxi sho'ondeexxi yookaan buqendeexxi ifiniibaa fuldabaaxxi yaane hexxeba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luq. 12:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Tennexxee hitta laqqinaaxxa xexxe'atte; afeekee'e lebendee uwwendan; afeechchi hedhabaake kinni iikki isi afenne hiyye hedammachchi midde isonaa'n adhdheman.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Amanna Isika Dayyuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Yessuusixxi amanna isik dayyuwwi isi hedheebaa dange; kaddo malee manniinxe bira sa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa isoo afa dandenneeba'a. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Eettene yanna iso'n, «Ama atixxinna dayyuwwi atiki atee uudatee hanseexxi gadho uurrine'een» hina'n kulle.<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Isinna insa'ne'n, «Ama anxinna dayyuwwi anki Mageniinka hiyyichcho laqeexxi hujete'n hosisaakeeran» hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Danbala'a Sammi asseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Barra mitte Yessuusi hordofeeyye ifixxenni hobolote'n e'yeexxi insa'ne'e, «Ke'we widi'a foonfo!» hiyye'naa ke'ne me'ine. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Me'ate'n he'nee'naanni Yessuusi diiphe; eettene yanna abbaayyati hana jabbaxxi hobonbalte kexxe; wodi'ikinna hobolote'n wo'ma'n dagemmaxxee rakko lumooxxi giddo e'yine.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Hordofeeyye isixxinna isibaa shikki hiteexxi, «Goottaa, koo Gootta mundenna» hina'n isoo ke'issite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yessuusinna ke'eexxi eettenee diidallotanna wodi'iinka danbala'a xixe; diidallonna danbala'i iikki woddi sammi hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi ifixxa hordofeeyye, «Amana ha'nooxxi haba heaxxe?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Yaane kinni insa'ne lumoshsha sodaante mambe'a hiyyat weli weli, «Diidallotanna danbala'a ajajee'naa isi'a diidallotinna danbala'i ajaajema'neek isi kunni ayyete» hine.<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fuggichchi Hafuuri Abideemmake Manjichchixxa Fayya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Geliilaxxe Abbaayya wido Gergeesenoon hiyyemaake bogibaa hoboloti foonfe. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yessuusinna hobolotenaa'n dirree wodda fuggichchi hafuuri abideek mitti manjichchi qachakenaa'n fula'n isinni afeme. Kunni manjichchi heddo yanna seemma oddo'wa'nebaang hirreessi giddo malee mine hedhaammabaaken. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Isinna Yessuusii'i uude wodda isi edo ibe hafuura gikki asseexxi, «Lumoke Mageniike Belto Yessuusii ane'n maa affeette? Anee rakkisabexxoshsha atee kadhataannen» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Iikki fuggichchi hafuurinna tennee hiyyeechchi manjichchokenaa'n fulaashsha Yessuusii isoo ajajeemmaxxeeten. Ookkoneechchi edi darre iikki fuggichchi hafuuri yanna yanna'n isoo abida'emmaxxee iikki manjichchi haachchabikinna lekkatike sibljinni usurema'n heqqema'eemman; kaddo malee ookkone usureememmaka haachchaba enqa'n qiilla gamoojje giddi'a isoo gugachchiisa'n adhdhee me'a'neemman.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yessuusinna «Suummi atiki ayyete?» hiyye isoo qore; isinna heddi fuggichchi hafuuruwwi isoo abideemmaxxee, «Suummi ank Leegoonite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Legoon hiyya sannachake hiyyaten. </char></note>» hiyye hiisse haaso'e. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Iikki fuggichchi hafuuruwwinna Yessuusii'i «Maganeten dhi'mo bale'n me'inannoshsha no'oo ajaajjoxxe» hiyya'n isoo kadhate. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ookkone loola'n koobati qarqara anso dheeddammaxxi heddo booyye hexxemman; iikki fuggichchi hafuuruwwinna «Eettene booyye'n e'yinnonna'a eettii no'aa uwwi» hiyya'n Yessuusii'i kadhate. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Iikki fuggichchi hafuuruwwinna manjichchokenaa'ni fuleexxi booyyete'n e'ye; booyyetinna bowwa'iinke irganaa'n adadde abbaayyate'n diddeexxi liqiinsende.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Eettenne booyyeexxi allalisanonna tennee kaddeexxa yaane uuddee wodda baajje me'iteexxi tennee ookkone qachcha'ninna hadi giddo odeessite. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ardikinna tennee kaddeexxa yaane uudatee hedhe hedheemabaa'n Yessuusibaa dage. Iikki fuggichchi hafuuruwwi isonaa'n fulleemmak manjichchinna seemma odo'we'e, kiidonna isi'a higge'naa Yessuussixxe lekka hunda ofo'le'naa anfee wodda sodaante. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Fuggichchi hafuuruwwinni abidemeemmak iikki manjichchi fayyee wodda uudemmaaki manni manjichchi hitta fayyeexxa ookkone arda'n haaso'e. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ookoneechchi uduma Gergeesenoonike loolik manni duuchchi lumoo qico sodaateemmaxxe Yessuusi insa'neebaa'n me'aashsha kadhate. Yessuusinna hobolote'n e'yeexxi dagemmaba'a ille iima hige me'e. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Fuggichchi hafuuri isonaa'n fuleemmaaki manjichchi isinn hedho'a haseexxi Yessuusii'i, «Atinni welti me'o!» hiyya'n kadhdhate; Yessuusi kinni hiyya'n isoo me'aashsha assee qici, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Mine atibaa ille iima higgettexxi Mageni ati'a asseexxa lumoxxa yaane haaso'i!» Manjichchikinna Yessuusi isi'a asseexxa lumoxxa yaane ookkone qachchi giddo duuchcha'n haaso'a'ni me'e.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rerteexxe Beltonna Ela Gophpheexxe Manjichcho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ardi duuchchi isixxa daga heqedhaammaxxee, Yessuusi ille iima hige dagee wodda gammashshoti isoo adhdhe. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ookkone wodda Iyya'iroosi hiyyemaak Ayihudootiinke magenofachchotike minik sooreessi dage'e Yessuusixxe lekka hunda ibeexxi «Maganneten mine aniba amo» hiyye isoo kadhate. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Iittanna hiyyeechchi ilendeexxenni tommenna lame wogga kaddaaxxi ifixxi belto dhibendeexxi reyo shiqqeemmaxxeeten. Ookko'anna me'ate'n hedheenge'n isoo hordofa'emmak ardi isoo rabat lumooshsha rakkisa'nemman.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Tommenna lame wogga duuchcha munde dunendaammaxxi mitte manjichcho hexxemman; isenna affeechcho duuchcha ci'leeyyetee birtee'naa ise fayyisa dande'eek ayyinna hedhemmaba'a. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Isenna Yessuusibaa daggeexxi isi udumii'n isixxe seemmaka kasa tuqqe; dundaammaxxi isexxi mundenna ikki woddi uurrite. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yessuusinna «Anee tuqeeki ayyete?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Duuchchiing isoo kiseexxa waakkatee wodda Pheexiroosi, «Goottaa ardi duuchchi atee buqe rabe rakkisa'neexxa uudda'n anee tuqeeki ayyete hitattota?» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yessuusi kinni, «Hunna ane'naa'n fuldeemmaxxee anee tuqeeke mitti manji hedheen» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Iitti manjichchonna ege'nendebaak gattebaaxxa affeexxi culphissa'n daggeexxi lekka isixxi hunda ibbe; mayee iso tuqqeexxanna hitta iikki woddi fayyiteexxa ardi duuchchi edo haasootte. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yessuusinna isee, «Anxe beltoo amana atixxi atee fayyisse'een, nage'iki me'i!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yessuusi haaso'a afo'okenaa'n birebaang mitti manjichchi Ayihudiinke magenaafachchotike minike sooreessa kade'eeke Iyya'iroosike minenaa'n dageexxi, «Belto atixxi rerte'eeni; ta'a yoona barachchiissallo mee rakkisi!» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yessuusi tennee laqeexxi Iyya'iroosii'i, «Amani malee Mee sodaat; belto atixxi fayyitaan» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yessuusinna Iya'iroosike mine e'yaa wodda Pheexiroosi, Yohaannisinna Ya'iqoobi, iittanni eettene beltoke annanna ama gadhi darre ayyinna isinni welt e'yo'a haseba'a. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Eettene yanna manni duuchchi ise'a woo, woo hiyya'n oodha'nemman; Yessuusi kinni insa'ne, «Mee oodhdhe; ise diiphphe'ee malee rerte'eebaan» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Insa'nenna reyo isexxa egenneemmaxxee duuchching isoo oso'le. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yessuusi kinni anga isexxa abideexxi isee, «Anxe beltoo ke'i» hiyye <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Beltichchoitik hafuurinna hige; isenna iikki woddi kexxeexxi ofolde; Yessuusinna ittaaxxi yaane ise'a uwwendaashsha insa'ne ajaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Beltichchotik hadinna lumoshsha mambe hiyye; isi kinni ayye'ninna tennee yaane haasoonnabaashsha insa'nee ajaje.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Tommenna Lamiinxe Ergameeyyexxa Ergema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Tommenna lamiinxa ergameeyye mitteba ye'eexxi fuggichcha hafuura duuchcha fulchino'a dhukkuba duuchchanna fayyinso'a hunnatanna baallooma insa'ne'a uwwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Mageniinxa mootummaxxa lallanbo'aanna dhukkulliyye fayyinso'a insa'ne erge. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Insa'nenna hiyyee qici, «Ora me'itinaa wodda siqqichchote kaddo'o, subbake kado'o, gala'ate kaddo'o, maallaqake kado'o, jijjiidhatixxe seemmanna midde kaddo'o iyyedha ha'noo hasissabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luq. 10:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Erga. Huj. 13:51</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ookkone qachchinaa'n fuldineexxi me'itnaa qici'a e'yitinemmange siretike hoone mi'ne'ninni ofo'le. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Manni ha'noo adhdha gophoole ookkone qachchinaa'n fuldineexxi me'itinaa wodda insa'ne'n dhuga kulate kaddo'a ha'noxxe lekkaxxa buko ganga'nitineexxi fulle.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Tennexxee ergameeyye ookkoo'n fuldeexxi wenegele lallabba'ninna dhukkulliyye fayyissa'n olla'i duuchchi giddo marenda'nemman.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Mitti mitti manni xammaqalli Yohaannisi reyotenaa'n ke'eedheen hiyyaammaxxa odo sholgaxxe kutakak galchalli Heeroodisi Yessuusi asseexxa duuchcha laqemmaxxee mekki hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Iittanni mitti mitti Wabeekichchi Eelyaasi ille iima hige dage'een hiyyaa wodda wel iittanni edixxe wabeekonaa'n mitti reyotenaa'n ke'edheen hiyya'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar. 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luq. 9:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Heeroodisinna ifi darree'n «Xammaqallo Yohaannisii'i anendemman gooba isika kutiseennak; eega ta'a tenne yaane duuchcha assa'neen hiyyemma'n odeessema'neek kunni manjichchi aate?» hiyye. Isoonna uudo'a yoraamani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar. 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luq. 9:7-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Onde Kuma Manna Itiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Ergameeyyetinna ergendeemmak boonchinaa'ni illee iima higgeexxi assiteexxa duuchcha Yessuusi'ni kulde; isinna Beete Sayida hiyyendaaxxe qiilla gammoojje giddi'a qofinni insa'ne aadhe me'e. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ardikinna Yessuusi habaa me'eexxa ege'nee wodda isoo hordofe; isinna insa'ne adhdheexxi Mageniinxe mootummaxxa insa'ne'n barsiise; dhukkubakenaa'n fayya hasseexxi daggemmaxxa dhukkulliyye duuchcha insa'ne fayyise. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Bogi hashshee wodda tommenna lame ergameeyye Yessuusibaa daggeexxi iso'o, «Kunni he'nee boonchi qiilla gammoojje'ni; tennexxe manni loolake'n hedheeke qachchuwwibaanna qarqarake'n hedheeke olla'uwwiba'anna hadi giddi'a me'eexxi itaachchonna galaaba halso'a me'aashsha assi» hite.<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yessuusi kinni insa'ne, «Ha'noo so'iinxa kebbonna insa'ne'a uwwe» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Insa'enna iso'n, «No'o'o anfennek onde buddeenanna lame qulxu'me callan; tennexxe marrennexxi ita hiragonphonnole konne ardi duuchchi'a geyabaan» hine. <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Ookkone mannik laakkoosinna onde kuma qicikemman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yessuusinna hordofeeyye ifixxa, «Manni onde tomme kanda'ni bakka abixxe ofo'laashsha asse» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Hordofeeyyetinna isi insa'ne ajajemmashsha manni offo'laashsha assine. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yessuusinna ookkone onde so'iinxa kebbonna eettene lame qulxu'me aadheexxi iimi'a qokki hiyye uudeexxi Mgeno galateeffate; kukkuteexxenna mannakee qooddo'a hordofeeyyete'n uwwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Duuchchiing so'iinxa kebbo iteexxi godde; hordofeeyyetinna ardakenaa'n gatteexxa hamba tommenna lame qiricco wo'ma ke'issite.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Hariiremeeke Kadeexxa Pheexiroosi Haaso'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Barra mitte Yessuusi qofinni soodachote'n hedhee'naa hordofeeyye isixxinna isiba dagge; isinna insa'ne, «Manni anee'e aate hiyyaa'ne» hiyye qore. <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Insa'nenna isoo, «Mitti mitti xammaqallo Yohaannisiten, wele manni Eelyaasite hiyya'neen; iittanni weli edixxe wabeeko giddii'n mitti reyotenaa'n ke'eedheen hiyyaakera hedheen» hineexxi hiissine haasoone.<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Ha'noonata, «Anee aate hitina'ne?» hiyyeexxi insa'ne qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Pheexiroosinna, «Ati Kiristoosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hariirendeteke</char></note> Mageniinke» hiyyeexxi iso'n hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yessuusinna tennee ayye'ninna haaso'abaashsha iso'o duudhe xexxe'achchiise.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosi Hordofa Laqaaka Hira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:38-39">Mat. 10:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">16:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-38">Mar. 8:34-38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:25-27">Luq. 14:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Lebeexxi Yessuusi hordofeeyye, «Manjiink Belti heddo rakko adhdha hasissaan; geedhete'n umo qeesole'ninna Muuseke seerike barsiisalluwwa'n tuffatemmaan; kaddomalee kinni isi reyotenaa'n sakka baro ke'aan.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ookkonneechchi uduma insa'ne duuchchiinge'n, «Anee'e hordofo'a hasa'neeki hedheexxe kaddoole ifi waakkatowwaal; barra barra'ninna fanno ifixxa dulkeexxi ane'e hordofowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luq. 14:27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ayyinna ani irra lubbo ifixxa anjidhdho'a hasaak hedheexxe kaddoole isee balleessa; anxee kinni hedho ifixxa sa'isseexxi uwwaak isi isee anjidhdha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luq. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Manji butta duuchcha alfeexxi lubbo ifixxa kinni gophoole maa la'o tinni isi'a maa la'o uutta? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ane'ninna anke hiyyichcho'n shokaak duuchchi Manji Belti ifike ulfinninna ifike annike ulfinninni, iittanni qulliyye ergannake ulfinninni dagaaxxa yanna iso'n shookaan. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ani dhugaate ha'no'n haaso'aannen, ta'a kaba hedheekiirnaa'n Mageniinxi mootumma daggaa'naa uudaa qico'ni reyabaake mitte mitte manna hedheen.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxe Dhaggaxxa Jijjiirensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Yessuusi tennee haaso'eexxe saddeetta barra uduma Pheexiroosii'i, Yohaannisiinna Ya'iqoobii'i adhdheexxi soodachchotee mitte kooba hana qabate. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Isi soodata'neege'ni bifa isixxi jijjiirende; seemma isixxinna calacalate golalooxxe kadde. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Kunnise dedhange'n lami manni dageexxi isinni welti haaso'amman; kunninni manninna Muusenna Eelyaasitemman. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Insa'nenna ulfinnikinna leellineexxi Yessuusi Iyyerusaalemi asso'a hexxeexxe yaanexxeenna isixxe tenne buttatenaa'n gargar higatixxe haasona'emman. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Yaane kinni Pheexiroosinna isinni welti hedhemmakeera'n diiphi ha'ure'emman; dammanqee wodda kinni isika gaachchanna isinni welt hedhemmaka lame manna anfe. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Iikki lami manni insa'nenaa'n gargar higeexxi me'e wodda Pheexiroosi Yessuusi'i, «Barsiisallo kaba'a hedha no'o'a eloxxe kaddemmaxxe mitte ati'a mitte Muuse'anna mitte Eelyaasi'a kadaaka sase qoorcho jaarro; Pheexiroosi tenne haaso'a wodda hiyyaneenxa ege'ne'emmabaan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Isi tennee haaso'ande'n hedhee'na'a duumanchi dageexxi insa'ne'e golle; duumanchi giddi'anna e'yina'ninni he'ne sodaante. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Duumanchi giddii'ninna «Fi'le'ennek belti ank konneten; isi hiyyaaxxa laqqe» hiyyaak hafuuri dage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luq. 3:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Kunni hafuur dageechchi uduma insa'ne Yessuusi'i qofinni hedhee'na'a anfe. Hordofeeyyetinna affeexxa yaane eettene yanna'n ayye'ninna haasonebaang sammine.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fuggichchi Hafuuri Abideeke Beltixxa Fayya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Langa baro koobate'naa'n dirre dagaa wodda heddi manni dageexxi isinni afeme. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Eettene yanna ardi giddii'n mitti manjichchi hafuura gikkasseexxi «Barsiisallo afeenneke belti mitte iso calla kadeemmaxxe anka belto ani'a uuddotta'a ate'e kadhata'ennen. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Fuggichchi hafuuri iso'o abidaa wodda dedhange'n raaraan; afo'okena'inna honbisiisa'nee gangalchiisaan; biso'o isikanna maddoossisa'n hittadheeke abari uduma iso'o waalaan. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Hordofeeyye atixxinna isinaa'n fulchito'a insa'ne kadhatenne yaane kinni dandeenneba'a.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yessuusinna, «Ha'no amana affinebaak dabaaleeyye manni haaniqico ani ha'nonni welt hedhanno? Haaniqici'ata ha'no dande'anno? Belto atika kaba'a idagi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Beltikinna daga'nde'n hedhee'na'a iikki fuggichchi hafuuri iso'o butta ibiseexxi gangalchiise. Yessuusi kinni ookkone fuggichcha hafuura xixeexxi beltichcho fayyiseexxi anna isike'ninna uwwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ardi duuchchinna Mageniinxa lumoxxa hunna uudeexxi saade.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yessuusi Ifixxe Reyoxxee Langaxxa Haaso'eexxa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Manni duuchchi isi asseexxa yaane duuchcha saadande'n hedhee'naa Yessuusi ifixxa hordofeeyye hiyyeeqic, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Ha'noo'n kulaannexxa tenne yaane qalbeeffattine laqqe; kunnise Manjink Belti manniinxe anga'n sa'issemee uwwemaan.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Insa'ne'n kinni tinni hiyya aaggeba'a; qalbeeffantabaashshanna yaane insa'ne buqoxxe kadde'emman; isoonna qora sodaante.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchiingenaa'n Sa'aak Aate?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Insa'nenaa'n ayyi sa'aaxxa hordofeeyye giddo welmoronshate kadde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luq. 22:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yessuusinna insa'nexxe qalbeka yaada ege'neexxi mitte annuyyo aadhe ifi bira uurriseexxi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />insa'ne'e hiyyeeqic, «Ayyinna tenne anno summa ankenni adhdhaak ane'e adhdha; anee adhdhaak duuchchinna anee ergeeka adhdha; ha'no giddii'n duuchchiingenaa'n heeno'maak isi duuchchiingenaa'n sa'aake kadaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luq. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohaannisinna Yessuusii'i, «Barachchiissalloo, mitti manjichchi summa atikenni fuggichcha hafuura fulchaa'n anfenne; yaane kinni isi no'onaa'nite kadagophemmaxxe isoo hoyyinenne» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yessuusinna «Ha'no gareerabaak duuchchi ha'non welt hedheeke kademmaxxe iso'o hoyyitinoqe'e» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaarak Manni Yessuusi'i Gareereexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Yessuusi iimi'a me'aaxxi yanna shiqqeexxa ege'neexxi Iyyerusaalemi'a me'atee yaadik woxedhe ke'e. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Isinna ediseexxi ookko'aa me'aaka erganjuwwa erge; insa'nenna duuchchiinxa yaane qixxeessate'e Semaariya giddo hedheeke mitte olla'i giddi'a me'ine. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Yaane kinni isi ookko'n sa'eexxi Iyyerusaalemi'a me'a'neexxa egennemmaxxe ookkone olla'ik manni isoo adhdha hasebaan. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Hordofeeyye isixxi Ya'iqoobinna Yohaannisi tennee anfeexxi, «Goottaa giira iimii'n daggeexxi konne manna itte balleessitaashsha no'o ajanjonna'a hassa'ette?» hine iso'o qorre. <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yessuusi kinni insa'neebaa wirri hiyye'e insa'ne xixeexxi (Ha'no hoone hafuurike hafuura kaddineexxa egendinebaan; Manjiink Belti dageechchi hedho manjiinxa anjiro'aate malee balleesso'atebaan)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kun yaadi edike mirqisanjo maxaafuwwa'n afemaba'a </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ookkone boonchinaa'ninna ke'neexxi wele olla'iba'a me'ine.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxe Hordofeeyye'ni Geltaaxxa Rakko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Yessuusinna hordofeeyye ifixxenni welt me'ande'n ora he'neenaa'a mitti manjichchi isoo, «Ati me'itattoba duuchcha atee'e hordofonna'a hasa'enen» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yessuusinna «Jeedal ifinxe bale afe'een, ci'atinna ifinge mine affe'een, yaane kinni Manjiink Belti umo uggaaxxa ifixxa bakka afebaan» hiyye hiisse haaso'e. <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Welenga manjichcho, «Anee hordof» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Yaane kinni manjichchi iikki iso'o «Gootta edise anna anka mare moogonna'a ani'a eetii uwwi» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yessuusinna isoo, «Reyaak manni ifika reyeeka manna mooqquun waali; ati kinni martettexxi Mageniinxa mootumma lallab» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Mitti weleng manjichchinna «Goottaa ani ate'e hordofannon, yaane kinni edise mini hado anka marennexxi nage'ik hedhe hiyyonna'a ani'a eeti uwwi» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Moy. 19:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yessuusinna «hujo'a qotto anga abixeexxi udumi'a uudaak manji Mageniinxe mootummanni me'aakebaan» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Torbaane Tommenna Lame Mannixxa Ergeensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Okkonneechchi uduma Gootti wele torbaane tommenna lame manna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Torbaane tommenna lame mittemitte edike mirqisano maxaafuwwi torbaane tomme hiyyaan</char></note> lame lamiki assa'ni isi mara'neeke qachchuwwa'ninna bonchuwwaa duuchcha'ni ediseexxi marraashsha erge. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Isinna insa'nee hiyyee qici: «Bukki assendaaxxi midha yo'oxxen yaane kinni bukki assaak hujetik manni heenooken; tennexxee midhatik anni wele hujaaka manna lebeexxi ergaashsha Mageno kadhate!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat. 9:37-38</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Yoona me'we, gedhebiinsha yayyetixxe oddo'ni ha'no'o ergaanneni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat. 10:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Subba yookaan qalqaallo, yookaan kophe iyyexxinoqqe'e; orake'ninna ayyeenna nage'a aaxxinoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luq. 9:3-5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />«Ayyika minenna e'yitna wodda edissineexxi, ‹Nage'i konne mine'ni hedhowwaali!› hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nage'iink manji ookko hedhoole, ha'nook nage'i iso'ni hedhaan; kada gophphoole ha'nook nage'i ha'noo'anni higaan. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Hujallokee rundi hasisaan; tennexxe ha'no'a shiqinshaaxxa yaane ittinaa'ninna ha'witinaa'ni ookkone mine'ninni offo'le malee mitte mininaa'n mittinbaa mammarendinoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Qor. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Xim. 5:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />«Hoone qachchibaanna e'yitinaa wodda manni ha'no'oo adhdhoole ha'no'aa shiqisheechcho itte. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Ookkone qachcha'n hexxeexxa dhukkuliyyeera fayyissina'n insa'ne, ‹Mageniinxi mootumma ha'nobaa shiqqe'een› hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Yaane kinni mitte qachchibaa martinnee'naa ha'noo adhdha gonphoole ookkone qachchike ba'lina'n fuldineexxi hitinaa qici, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Lekka no'oxxe'n abixxiteexxa ha'nooke qachchixxa buko midde ha'no'a ganga'ninanno; yaane kinni Mageniinxi mootumma shiqqeexxa tennee ege'ne›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Erga. Huj. 13:51</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ha'noo'ni kulo, ookkone qachchi irra murtettixxa barra Soodomike qachchi'a shollexxaani.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Dada. 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat. 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aadde Aaga Gopheeke Qachchuwwi'a Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Higgeen lebeexxi Yessuusi hiyyee qici: «Korraziinike qachcha aanne ati'a, Beete Sayidake qachchaa aanne ati'a; ha'no'ni hujemeek mambe'i Xiroosi'ninna Sidoonake qachcha'ni hujeme'eexxe kaddeele, ookko hedhammak manni edi woddanni yaaddotixxa seemma odo'weexxi bululokanna ifi'ni fiffilxeexxi silaati aadde aageemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-8">Isa. 23:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hiz. 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zek. 9:2-4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Yaane kinni murtettixxa barra ha'no'a irra Xiroosikinna Sidoonake qachchi'a shollexxaani. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Atinna koo Qifirnahoomike qachchaa! Iimi qico'n ifi lummisa hasseetteta? Butti'a Si'olete'ni saxxatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa. 14:13-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />«Ha'nooxxa laqaak anxanna laqaan; ha'no'o gibaak aneenna giba; aneenna gibaak ane'e ergeekanna giba» insa'ne'aa hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luq. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eetene Torbaane Tommenna Lame Hordofeeyyexxa Iillee iima Higa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Iitti torbaane tommenna lame hordofeeyye gammadda'n illeema higge daggeexxi Yessuusii'i, «Gootta! Fuggichchi hafuuri midde summa atikeni no'a hiremeen» hite.<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yessuusi insa'ne'a hiyyee qici, «Seexani banqotishsha iimi'ni ibaa'naa afenne. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Yoona bofakanna gaaddo hirbeessitinaashsha naaphphiinxe hunna duuchcha'ni ha'no'aa baallooma uwweennen; ha'noo miidhaachchi mittilchinna hedhabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Far. 91:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Kaddo malee fuggichchi hafuuruwwi ha'no'aa hiremeexxee tenne'n mee gammadde; summi ha'nooki kinni iimate'n borreessemeexxee gammaadde.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Gaammashsho Leellisheexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Eettene yanna Yessuussi woyyichchi hafuurinni gammashshoti wo'meexxi hiyyee qici, «Iimatikenna buttatike Gootta annaa! Tenne duuchcha beekkoletennaa'ninna ege'nemmakeerinaa'n shoxxetexxi annoolete'n ifisettaxxee atee galateeffata'enne; Ee annayyo! Tenne assatee eloxxe atixxe fedhi kadde'een.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />«Duuchchiinxi yaane anke anninaa'n ani'a uwwende'en; iittanni Belti ayyete kadeexxa anna malee ege'naak hedheba'a; Anni ayyete kadeexxanna Belto malee, beltikinna isi'a ifiso'a hasaake manji gadhidarre ege'naak hedheba'a.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoh. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ifixxe hordofeeyyeba'aanna wirri hiyyeexxi insa'ne'n qoffinni «ha'no uuddinaaxxa uuddaaxxi ille eebbisendeexxe. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ha'noo'n kulo, heddo wabeekonna moyanjuwwi ha'no uuddina'neexxa uudo'a haseexxi uudeba'a; laqqina'neexxanna laqatee haseexxi laqeba'a.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O'wallo Saamarichchika Fakkeenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Kunse mitte barra Muuseke seerik barachchiisalli Yessuussi hega uudo'a haseexxi, «Barachchiisalloo! Duuchchi woddixxa hedho alfonnaa ani maachcho assa hasissa?» iso'o hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat. 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yessuussinna «Seerake'ni borreessendeexxi maachcho? Haasoossita'ette qicita hittate?» hiyye iso'ni hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Manjichchi iikkinna hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, « ‹Gootta atika Mageno atixxe wo'ma qalbenni atixxe wo'ma hunnanninna atike wo'ma yaadinni eeyyi› iittanni ollalcho atika eeyyi» hiyyaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:5">Lew. 6:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yessuussinna hiissexxi iso'n, «Hiissitetteki hissichchi dhugaate; yoona atinna tenneenni assi! Hedhotinna hexxattoni» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew. 18:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Iikki barachchiissalluwwinna ifi qullichchake assa haseexxi «Egedhdhitaa, ta'a isi ollalchi anki ayyete?» hiyyeexxi Yessuusii'i qore.<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yessuusinna hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Mnji mitti Iyyerusaalemi'ni Iyyarko'a me'ammaa wodda bokkaammetixxe anga'n ibe; seemma isixxanna isinaa'n quncinse isoo ganneexxi hedhotixxenna reyotixxe oddo'n waalle me'ine. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Keekkatebaang mitti qeesichchi ora ookkone adadde me'aa'n isoo afeexxi qeefate sa'e. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Iitaani mitti Leewwichchi ookko'ni sa'nemman; isinna manjichcho ookkonee afeexxi qeefate sa'e. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Mitti Semaarichchi kinni ifinxa ookkone ora me'a'n iikki manjichchi hedheebaa ge'e; isoonna afeexxi isi'a marare. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Isiba'anna shiqeexxi maduwwa isixxe'ni zayitenna woyinetixxa booka cosseexxi isee usure; ifixxe harre hananna isoo offo'lisheexxi keessumma galdammake mine'n iyyemareexxi isoo gargaare.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Odo. 28:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Langa baro lame diinaarre maallaqa aadheexxi kessummatike mini anna'n uwweexxi, ‹Konnee manjichcho magannete'n dhibensiisi! Konne iimidarre fulchitattoka maallaqanna ani hige daganno wodda ati'a hiissannon› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />«Yoonata konne sase manninaa'n ookkone bokkaametixxe anga'n ibeeke manjichchi'a ollalichchokee kadeek hoonte ate'ni laba?»<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Iikki seerink barsiisanjinna, «Ookkone isi'a marareekentaa» hiyye hiisse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yessuusinna «Yoona atinna martettexxi iitta assi!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Maartake'ninna Maaramike Mine'n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yessuussinna hordofeeyye ifixxenni ora me'inaa'naa olla'a mittibaa gore; Maartaa hiyyendaaxxi mitte majichchonna ifike mine'ni isoo keessunsite. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Isenna Maarami hiyyendaaxxa dayyo affeemmani; Maaraminna hiyyichcho isika laqqa'ni Yessuussixxe lekka hunda ofoldeemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yoh. 11:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Maartaa kinni huje bira saxxee'na weekkende'eemmaxxee isiba marteexxi, «Gootta anxi dayyo huje anee calla'ni waaldeexxi ofoldaa wodda sammi hitatto? Anee gargaartaashsha ise'ni kuli malee» hite.<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Yessuussinna hiisse ise'ni haaso'ee qici, «Maartaa, tee Maartaa, ati heddo yaane'ni wixixxi hitaatten, weekkenda'etten, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />hasissaaxxi kinni mitte yaane callan; Maaramiqqa ise'a eldaaxxa mellexxe'een; tinninna isenaa'ni adhdhendabaan.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Barachchiisseexxa Soodachcho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Mitte yanna Yessuusi mitte booncho'n soodata'nemmani; soodachcho bireechchinni uduma hordofeeyye isixxi giddii'ni mitti iso'o, «Gootta! Yohaannisi hordofeeyye ifixxa soodachcho barachchiissemmashsha no'onna soodachcho barsiisi!» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yessuussinna insa'nee, «Soodattinaa wodda hittina'ni soodattinaa qici</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">« ‹(Iima hexxetteke no'oke anna)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iimate'n hexxeke hiyyaak hiyyichchi edike konne mirqisanjo maxaafuwwa'n afemaba'a</char></note> no'oke!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Summi atik woyyoomowwaal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Mootumma atixxi daggowwaali!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Barratixxa ita barra barra'ninni no'aa uwwi.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />No'o balleessemmakeri'a gattowwaal hinannashshan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">balleessa no'oxxa no'aa gattowwaal hiyyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Fuggoxxenaa'n no'o ba'ati malee'e;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Foggoxenaa'n no'o gatis malee hiyyaak hiyyichchci edike konne mirqisanjo maxaa'n hedhebaa </char></note> hega uudematiba'anna no'o mee e'ishi.› »<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Lebexxi Yessuussinna hordofeeyye ifixxe'e hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo giddii'ni jaalo afe'ek mitti wodhakka isiba mareexxi, ‹Koo anke jaalo! Sase buddeena ani'a liqeessi! <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Miti ank jaal orii'n ane'n dagee'na'a isi'a shiqishannoxxa mitte itanna afe'ebe'non hiyyeexxi iso'o kadhatoole.›<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />«Iikkinna mini giddii'ni iso'n, ‹Ane'e rakkissooxxe! Hula danqarende'en; oose anxinna aninni welti dhiphpheen; tennexxe'e ke'ennexxi ati'a uwwa dande'abo'non› hiyyaata? <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ha'no'ni kulo ifike jaalo kadeemmaxxeenna uwwa gophoole midde iso'o ko'wisemmaxxe calli'a hasaaxxa isi'a uwwaan.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />«Tennexxe ani ha'noo'ni hiyyanee qici: kadhate ha'no'a uwwendaani; halse, alfitinaani; hulatanna gangaanne ha'no'aa banendaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tinni kaddeechchi kadhataak duuchchi adhdhaan; halsaaki duuchchinna alfaan, hula ganganaakeenna isi'a banenda.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />«Ha'noo giddii'n annake kadeek belti ifik (Daabo kadhatoole kinjo uwwaak ayyete?)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mitte mitte mirqisanjo maxaafa'ni tinni hiyya hexxeban. </char></note> qulxu'me kadhatoole, bofa isi'a uwwaaki hedheeta? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Yookaan qulxu'me kadhatoole is'a gaaddo uwwaata? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ha'noo fuggaaleryyende kaddineen hexxineexxi oose ha'nooxxe eloxxa uwwa, uwwa egendinoole iimate'n hedheek ha'nook anni isoo kadhataakeeri'a hittatta Woyyichcha Hafuura caala bira sa'isseexxi uwwa gopha?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussinna Bi'elzebuuli'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:23-30">Mat. 12:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mar. 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Mitti barra Yessuussi afo'o duudeeka fuggichcha hafuura fulcha'nemmani; fuggichcha hafuuranna fuleechchi uduma iikki afo'o duudeemak manjichchi haaso'e; mannikinna mambe'a hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Mitti mitti manni kinni, «Fugguchchi hafuurike umo kade'eeke Bi'eelzebuulinni fuggichcha hafuura fulcha'neen» hine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Weli kinni iso'o hega uudo'a iimatenaa'n beessisa insa'ne'n leellisho'a isonaa'n hansa'emman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yessuussi kinni heduma insa'neeka ege'neexxi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Weli weli qoodendaaxxi mootuma baxxaan; iittanni mitti mini hadi wel welinaa'n gargar higoole ibaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Seexanikinna weli welinaa'n gargar higoole mootumma isixxi hitta uurritata? Ha'noo kinni anee, ‹Isi Fuggichcha hafuura Bi'eelzebuulixxe hunnan fulcha'neen› hitina'neeni. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Yoona ani fuggichcha hafuura Bi'eelzebuulixxe hunnan fulcha'ennelchinni oose ha'nooxxita ayyixxe hunnanita konnee fuggichcha hafuura fulchita'ne? Tennexxe oose ha'nonxi ha'noo'n murtaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ani kinni fuggichcha hafuura fulcha'ennek Mageniinxe hunnanni kaddeechchinni Mageniinxi mootumma ha'noobaa daggeexxa ege'ne.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«Worbi manjichchi hasisaa qico'n loliinka miya ka'le'e mine ifika heqqedhoole karra isixxi nage'ik hexxani. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Yaane kinni isi irra caala worbi manjichchi dageexxi isoo lole injifatoole isi addate'emmaka ookkoone loliinka miya isonaa'n adhdhaan; karra isixxa duuchchanna adheexxi welekee qoodaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Aninni welti hedhebaaki anee gareera; aninni welti bukki assedhabaakinna xeeraake.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fuggichchi Hafuuri Manjoke'n Illee Ima Hige E'yaaxxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat. 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Fuggichchi hafuur manjokenaa'ni fulaaxxa yanna hafuura adhdhatika hasto wodi'i hedheebaake booncho'n dowaan; hafuura adhdhaaxxa bakkanna afa gophoole kinni ‹Fulenneke anke minibaa ilee iima higannon› hiyyaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Illee iima hige dagaa wodda mini iikkinna fiyemeexxi qixxeseemmena'a afaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ookkonneechchi uduma mareexxi wele isi irra fuggataaka wele torbaane fuggichcha hafuuruwwa aadhe dagaan. Isi edo hedhemmake mine'ninna e'yineexxi ookko he'naan; ookkone majichchi'a edixxe isixxe jironaa'n udumixxi hara iso'n fuggatteexxe kaddaan.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yessuussi tennee haaso'ande'n hedhee'naan ardi giddii'ni mitte manjichcho hafuura gikki assiteexxi, «Ate'e ilde unuunsiteexxe amaxxa wodo» hite. <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yessuussi kinni hiisseexxi «Wodo, Mageniinka hiyyichcho laqeexxi ajajemmaakeerixxen» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonaasika Beessisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12:38-42</ref>)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Heddi ardi bukki hiyye wodda Yessuussi «Tinni ila fuggoxxen; beessisa uuddo'a hassaan; yaane kinni wabeeka Yoonaasike beessis gadhi darre weli isi'a uwwemaba'a. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Tinni kaddeechchinna Yoonaasi Neneweke qachchike manni'a beessisake kademmashshanni Manjiinki Beltinna tenne ila'a beessisake kadaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Yon. 3:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Bita'ixxi mootitte murtetixxa yanna tenne ilanni welti kexxeexxi insa'ne'ni murtaan; ise Solomoonika beekkuma laqatee buttatixxe gabalanaa'n daggeemmaxxee kunse Solomoonaa'ni sa'aak kaba hedheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lew. 27:30</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Neneweke qachchik manninna murtetixxe barra'ni tenne ilanni welt ke'eexxi tenne ila'ni muraan; Nenewek manni Yoonaasika lallaba laqeexxi cubbo ifixxee aadde aange'een; kunse Yoonaasinaa'n sa'aak kaba hedheen.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Ifiinka Fakkeenna Barsiiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Xassa xasseexxi sho'ondeexxe bakka'n yookaani qoreti hunda uggaak ayyinna hedhebaan; tenne irra e'yaak manni ifa uuddo'a xassemalchoke'n hana ugginaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Bisiink xassi Illeten; ille atixxi fayyaxxe kaddoole bisi atik duuchchi wa'a hiyyeeke kadaan. Ille atixxi fayya afa gophphoole bisi atik duuchchi dukkanate kadaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Tennexxe ati giddo hedheek ifi dukkanate kadabaashsha heqqedhi! <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Yoona bisi atik duuchchi wa'a hiyyeeke kadoole; dukkanate kadeek bisi atik hedha gophoole xassi wa'a hiyye ifammashsha bisi atikinna ittanni wa'a hiyye ifaan.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Ferisitootika Mannanna Muuseke Seerixxa Barsiisanuwwa Komateexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yessuussi konne haaso'a bireeshshanni Feerisichchi mitti Yessuussi'i isinni welti ita ito'a ye'e; tennexxee ke'e mareexxi ito'a ofo'le. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Yessuussinna anga anshedhebanggi itaa'naa uude wodda Feerisichchi mambe'a hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Gootti Yessuussinna Ferisichcho, «Ha'no Feerisito! Kubbaayyinkanna qoreti gadhi darre ca'a assitinaan; ha'no'n giddo kinni saamikinna fuggoxxe wo'mite'eni. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Ha'no gowwoole! Gadhidarre dadeeki Mageni gidi ddarre dadagopheeta? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Yaane kinni giddo hedheechcho hiyyeeyyete'e uwwe! Ookkonneechchi uduma duuchchin gelchi ha'no'a luqqi hiyyaan.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Feerisito ha'no'a aanne'e; bassibelotenaa'ni, sugettetenaa'ni, okoshetenaa'ninna iittanni wele shiixxaramma lataachchuwwanaa'n tommitte Magenoke'e uutinaan; kaddo malee dhugaa assanna Mageno eeyya ga'ma'mi hitinaan; yaane kinni eettene waaldinebaang tenneenna hassa ha'no hassissamman.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Feerisito ha'no'a aanne'e; Muuseka seera barantammake mine'ni ulfinnika barcuma, dikko giddonna duuchchiing anga ha'no'aa ke'iso'aa eetinaan.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />«Mann ege'nebaangi hana me'ammake mooggo fakkaattinammaxxe'e ha'no'a aanne'e!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Muuse Seerinke muxxalluwwanaa'n mitti hiisseexxi Yessuussi'i, «Baarsiisanjo! Ati tenne'e haasoosattatto wodda no'oteqa yowwita'ette!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yessuussi hiiseexxi, «Ha'no Muuseke seerik muxxalluwwi ha'no'a aanne'e! Manni ba'edha dande'abaaxxa ha'urto ba'o insa'ne'n ba'isinaan; ha'no umo ha'nooken kinni eettene ba'o qubichchi ha'nokenni midde tuqqinabaan.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />«Ha'nooki annuwwi shiyemmaxxe wabeekoka moogguwwa danchoossitnnammaxxee ha'no'aa aanne'ee! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Yoona ha'noo, ha'nooke annuwwixxa huje kokeessitinaaxxe dhugaa kullan; insa'nee wabeeko shinne; ha'nonna mooggo insa'neeka giissitina. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Tennexxee Mageniinki beekkumi hiyyee qici, ‹Wabeekonna ergameeyye insa'ne'a ergannon; insa'ne mitte mitte shinnaan; welekanna shorrinshaani› hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Tennexxe tinni ila butta dadendeexxe yannaa'n dunendemmaxxe wabeeko duuchchixxe mundexxee qorendaaxxen. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Aabeelixxe mundenaa'n saffeexxi tolchimalchiinxe oddo'ninna woyyichcha galmixxe oddo'n dunedeemmaxxe Zakkaariyaasixxe mundexxee tinni ila qorendaan.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Ha'noo Muuseke seerik muxxaluwwi ege'natixxa qulfe abixxitinemmaxxe'e ha'no'aa aanne'e; ha'noo umo ha'nookenni e'yitinaba'a; e'yammakaaranna hoyyitine'een.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yessuussi ookkoo'ni fulechi uduma Muuseke seerixxi barachchiisalluwwinna Feerisito fuggo iso'o gareerta'n heddo qortumuwwinni iso'o mekki assate'n kexxe. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Tenne assina'nemmachchinna isinge haaso'inninni iso'n yaane illo'atemman.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Xexxe'achchisatikanna Jajjabeesatika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Eettene yanna heddo kuma'n laakko'emaak manni weli dhiibaa qico'n bukki hiyyeexxi hedhe'naa Yessuussi ifixxa hordofeeyye hiyyee qici: «Feerisitotike lebelenaa'ninna tinninna insa'neexxe iffi uggudhdhanaa'n ifi heqqedhdhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar. 8:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Buqendeexxi farri hitabaang, sho'endeexxi leellitebaangi gattabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:22">Mat. 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luq. 8:17</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Tennexxe dukkanate'ni haasootinaaxxi yaane duuchcha ifake'ni laqendaani; mini giddo manshate'n hashashshineexxi gadhoo minixxe guutonaa'n lallabendaan.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyee'e Sodaata Hasissaaxxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat. 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Anke jaaluwwa! Ha'noo'ni ani kulo, maala shiyakaara ookkonneechchi uduma kinni mittelchonna assa dande'abaakaara sodaattinoqqe'e. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Yaane kinni ayee'e ha'no sodaataa hasissaaxxa ha'noo'n leellishsho; shiyeechchi uduma gaanemii'n hunatika baallooma afe'eeka iso'o sodaatte; ha'noo hiyyannen eeti isoo sodaatte. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Onde diillise lame saantime'n gurgurema gophphaata? Kaddo malee tennee diillisuwwanaa'n mittetinna midde Magenoke'ni dedhendabaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Umo ha'nookik ordichchi midde laako'eme'eken; yoona mee sodaatte ha'no heddo diillisuwwanaa'n sa'aake hira affine'een.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosixxe'e Dhugaa kula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat. 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Ha'no'aa hiyyaannen manni edo ani'a dhugaa kulaake duuchchi'a Manjiink Beltinna Mageniinxe erganna edo isi'a dhugaa kulaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Yaane kinni manni edo anee waakkataak duuchchi isinna Mageniinxe erganna edo iittanni waakkatema. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Manjiinke Belto'n salphisatika haaso'a haaso'eek duuchchi isi'a gattowwaal hiyyenda; Woyyichcha Hafuura yowwaakee kinni isi'a gattowwaal hiyyendabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat. 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar. 3:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Manni ha'no abideexxi Ayihudinke magenoofachchotike mine'n, gallchalluwwiinba'anna baalloomiinke mannibaa ha'noo iyyemaraa wodda hitta yookaan maa hissiitinaaxxa mee rakkatte. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Eettene yanna maa haaso'a hasissaaxxa Woyyichchi Hafuur ha'no'n kulaan.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gowwa Dureessika Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Ardi giddii'n mitti manjichchi Yessuussi'i, «Barachchiisallo! Dhaala ani'a qoodaashsha dayyo anke'ni kuli!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yessuussinna isoo'o, «Koo manjichcho ha'noo'n murona'a yookaan ha'no'aa qoodonna'a anee baalloonseek ayyete?» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Lebeexxi insa'ne'n, «Manjiinxi hedho karratixxe birasa'nenni welti abidendeexxe yaane kada gophphemmaxxee, heqqedhdhe; tennexxee haafematena'ni ifi heqqedhdhe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ookkonneechchi uduma insa'ne'n hiyya'n mammakee qici, «Fichchi isik yo'oshsha miseeke mitte dureessa manjichcho hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Isinna, ‹Midha anxa aassedhannoxxi bakka hedha gophphemmaxxe'e maa assanno?› hiyye hede.<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />«Ookkonneechchi uduma isinna heyyee qici, ‹Assannoxi yaaneer, afe'ennaka gootaruwwa diigennexxi wele ba'lallama gootaruwwa ijaarannon; ookkonna midha anxanna afennelcho duuchcha tuulannoni. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Lubbo anxanna, «Tee anxe lubbo heddo wogguwwa'aa geltaaxxa karra ati'a tuule'ennen. Yoona hafuura adhdhi, iti ha'wi; gammadi.» ›<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />«Mageni kinni isoo'o, ‹Koo ati bada gowwi lubbo atixxi tenne hashsha atenaa'n adhdhendo'a hasendaan; yoona ati ifi'a tuuldeeteki ayyike kada?› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />«Tennexxe ifi'a karra tuulaak Mageni edo kinni duroomebaake manjinna iittanden.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wixixxi Hiyya Hasissabaaxxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuussi hordofeeyye ifixxe'n hiyyee qici: «Tennexxe ha'no'ni kula'ennen hedho ha'nooxxe maa ittinaaxxa yookaan biso ha'nooke maa oddo'witinaaxxa wixxixxi hitinnoqe'e. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Hedho itatenaa'ni, bisikinna seemmatenaa'n sa'aan. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Amme qoodhande uudde! Rolkaba'a, haa'maba'a; bukki assaaka gootara afeba'a; Mageni kinni iso'o itisaan. Ha'noota ci'atenaa'n lumo qico saxxinabaata? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ha'noonaa'ni wixixxi hiyyeexxi hedho ifixxe'n mitte barra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hedho ifixxe'n mitte barra</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mitte mitte tika hojja ifixxe'n mitte ciqile hitaan.</char></note> lephpha dande'aak aate? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Yoonna heenooxxa yaane midde dandeetine assa gophphineexxenni wele yaanexxeeta mayee wixixxi hitina?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />«Diidi giddik hiddichchuwwi hitta daraara'neexxa amme uudde! Elo'aba'a, sulqaba'a, yaane kinni ani hanoo'ni kulo, Seloomoon midde konne ifike ulfinni duuchchinni konne daraaruwwanaa'n mittinshanna midde oddo'webaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Moy. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Odo. 9:3-6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Yoona Mageni telcho leelliteexxi soodo giirate'n hunndaaxxa gadhixxa anso iitta oddeessa'neelchinni ha'noo amana xe'yite'ekaara, ha'noofa'i hitatta caala oddeessa gophata? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Tennexxe maa ittinaaxxanna maa ha'witinaaxxa yorati qalbe ha'nooxxi wixixxi hitoqe'e. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Tenneeqqa buttate'n hedheek ardi duuchchi halsaan; anni ha'nookiqqa tinni duuchcha ha'no'aa hasissaaxxa ege'naani. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Tenne irra Mageniinxa mootumma halse, tinni duuchchi ha'no'aa lebende uwwendaan.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buttate'ni Karra Tuu'la Hasissabaaxxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat. 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Ha'noo shiixxooke hore kaddine'eek mootumma ha'no'aa uwwatee ha'noke annixxe fedhi kaddeemmaxxe'e mee sodaatte. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Afineechcho gurgurtine hiyyeeyyete'e uwwe! Moodhalshe moortabaaba, daamule itabaaba'a, dullo'abaake subba'n muddabaaxxa karra iima bukki assedhdhe. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Maallaqi ha'nooki hedheebaa qalbe ha'nooxxinna ookko hexxaan.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dammanqeexxi Heqqeccatixxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Ha'noo ka'litineexxi, xassakanna xassexxine'e heqqedhdhee!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat. 25:1-13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Gootti insa'neek aadha heerumiinxe jilanaa'n higaa qico'ni heqqedhammake isinna dageexxi hula ganganaa wodda; ikki woddi hula banate'e qophpheeffateeke manna fakkaatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar. 13:34-36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Gootti insa'nek dagaaxxa yanna dammaqe heqqedhaak erganjuwwixxa wodo; dhugaate ha'noo'ni kulaannen, gootti insa'neekeinna rake ka'leexxi indo'a insa'nee offo'lishaan; shiqeexxinna insa'ne ergataan. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Hashshixxe langaxxenna sakkaxxe kuta'n ittanni dammanqeena'a insa'ne afeeke ookkone erganjuwwixxa wodo. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Tenne kinni ege'ne; moodhalshi heene sa'aate'n dagaaxxa minik anni ege'ne'eele ifik mini qotemo'a sammi hiyye uudammabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat. 24:43-44</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ha'noonna qixxeffattine heqqedhdhe; Manjiinki belti keekkatinabaaxxe yanna'n dagaan.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qajeel Manjixxanna Fuggichchi Erganjika Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat. 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Pheexiroosinna Yessuussii'i, «Goottaa konni mammaassi no'o'atemo duuchchingeete?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Goottikinna hiisseexxi, «Yoona ita insa'ne'aa hasendeexxe yanna'n insa'ne'a uwwo'a Goottik ifike mini ha'do'n baalloonsaak xurameesikinna beeki galchalli aate? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Gootti illee iima hige dageexxi iitta assa'naa afaake erganjixxa wodo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Dhugaate ha'no'n haaso'aannen; isi isoo'o afeexxe karra duuchi hana baalloonsaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Yaane kinni iikki erganji Kunni ‹Gootti anki shiqe dagabaan turaani› hiyya'ne hedeexxi meya labbaka erganjuwwa loloole, iittanni eeyyeshsha ite ha'wate'ninna machcho'ate'n ke'oole <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />konne erganjik gootti isi hedebaaxxe yanna'ninna keekkatebaaxxe barra'n dagaan; tennexxe iso'o kochchisaan; hixa isikanna amanabaake mannin welt assaan.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />«Gootti ifikixxa halcha ege'neexxi qixxeeffatabaakanna fedhi isixxa assabaak erganji isi fuggo jadhafemaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Yaane kinni tenne goottinxa fedhii ege'na gophati xixemaaxxa yaane asseexxi afemoole heenoo qico jadhafema. Heddo uwwendeekenaa'n heddo yaane heqqenda; heddo magannenna adhdhoole isonaa'n heddo yaane heqqendaan.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchiinxa Waalle Yessuussii Hordofa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat. 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Ani daggennelchi butta'n giira wocci assonna'aten; tinni giiranna ta'anni bubbeele silaa ani hittata gammadanna'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Yaane kinni ani xammaqemanok xinqata hedheeni; muuxema qico'ninna wixixxi hiyyaannen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar. 10:38</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Buttate'n nage'a iyyedagatee dageennelcho ha'noo fakkaatta? Waawwo, ha'noo'ni kulo, ani dageenelchi gargar hiissonnaaten; <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ta'anni udumi'a mitte mini haddi giddo ondi manji hedhaan; lami saseke'n sasikinna lameke'n ke'eexxi gargar higaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Anni belto ifiken, beltikinna anna ifikeen, ama belto ifixxe'n beltotinna ama ifixxe'n, ballo beltinxe'n beltiinxinna beltiinxe ama'n kexxeena'a gargar hingaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik. 7:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baro Ege'natixxe'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Higgeeni ardake'n Yessuussi hiyyee qici: «Dhidhimidaree'n duumanchee'naa afinaaxxa yanna iikki woddi, ‹Telcho xeeni gano'aten› hitinaani; xeenikinna ganaani. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Iittanni bita'ii'n diidalleesse'naa affinaa wodda, ‹Telcho bogi arishshaan› hitina bogikinna arishshaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Ha'noo ifi uggudhdhalli iimatixxanna buttatixxa bifa gargar hiissat kaddaaxxa egendine'een; hittata tinni barra hittaxxeexxe kadeexxa ege'na ha'no dhibbe?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naaphi Ifikinni Welti Weli Aaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat. 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Mayeete ha'no dhugaatixxa yaane egendineexxi mura gophphinaachchi? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ate'e ku'le'eeke manjinni, hayyichchiiba'a me'itatto wodda oranni isinni araaremate'e wo'laan; kada gophphoole hayyichchi usuraake manjo'n ate'e sa'isse uwwani; usuraaki manjchchinna usurriinke mine'n ate'e takki assaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ate'ni kulo, maallaqa uute birtatto qico'ni ookkoo'n haranga fuladdabexxon.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Aadde Aagabaaki Duuchchi Ba'aaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Eettene yanna mitti mitti manni dageexxi, Geliilak manni tolcha shiqishaa wodda Philaaxoosi insa'ne shiyeen; munde insa'neexxanna shiqinsemmake tolchinni welt makeen hina'n Yessuussi'ni kulle. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yessuussinna insa'ne'a hiyyee qici, «Konne Galiilike manna'n tinni rakko insa'ne'ni gelteechchi wele Geliilake manni irra cubbaaleeyyete kandemmaxxeete ha'no'n labba'neeta? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Waawwo'o; ha'noo'ni kulo, aadde aaga gophphinoole duuchchiing iittanni insa'neeshshanni baxxinaan. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Iittanni Selihoomi giddo kinjiink mini fottoqee'naa reyemmake tommenna saddeeti mannixxee ha'noo maa heddina'ne? Insa'ne Iyyerusaalemi hedhemmake manni duuchchi irra balleesanjoke kandeexxe ha'noo'n fakkaataata? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Waawwo'o! Ha'noo'ni kulo; aadde aaga gophphinoole ha'no duuchchiing ittanni baxxinaan.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gummisabaake Ode'inke Haqichchika Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ookkonneechchi uduma hiyya'n wele mammasa mammaakee qici: «Mitti manjichchi mitte woyinetike fichchi giddo kaasemaaka mitte odi'iinka haqichcho afeemman; isinna isonaa'n gumma hase dageexxi iso'ni mitteelchonna afebaani. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Tennexxe'e ookkone woyinetike hiddichchika hujallo, ‹Kunse ode'iinke haqichchonaa'ni gumma alfonnaa sase wogga daga'ni mitteelchonna alfebe'non; tennexxee isoo kari; mayeeta tola boga bassa?›<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />«Isi kinni hiyye hiisee qici, ‹Koo gootta, qarqara isika kuuffisenneexxi faando itti ugganno qico'n tenne wogga calli'a isoo waal. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Dagaa sane gummissoole eloxxeni; gummisa gophoole kinni isoo woxxattoni.› »<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Hidha Xukkiteexxa Manjichcho Edi Sanbatixxe Barra'n Fayyiseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Yessuussi Edi Sanbatixxa barra mitte Ayihudiinke maganoonfachchotike mini giddo barachchiisa'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Ookkoonna tommenna saddeeta wogga'a fuggichchi hafuurn hidha xukkiteemmaxxi mitte manjichcho hexxemman. Isenna xukkatenaa'n kexxeexxa toggi hiyya haranga dandeetta'nemaba'a. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yessuusinna isee afee wodda isee ye'eexxi, «Tee manjichcho elagonphe atixxenaa'n leexxa fulde'etten» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Anga ifixxanna ise hana ugge; isenna hirba okkone'ni toggi hite uurrite; Magenokanna galateeffatte.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ookkone Muuseka seera barantammake minik akeekisanji kinni Yessuusi Edi Sanbatixxa barra fayyiseexxee mufateexxi ardake'n, «Huje hujema hasissaaxxi jaane barra hexxeeni; tennexxee eettene barruwwa'n daggina'n fayye malee'e edike Sanbatixxe barra'nitebaan!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Gootti Yessuusinna hiisseexxi isoo hiyyee qici, «Ha'no hollaammeeyye ha'noo giddii'ni ifixxa qotiyyo yookaani harre ifixxa Edi Sanbatixxa barra galdamabaa'n tikeexxi wede'e ha'wisa gophphaata? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Tinni manjichcho Abirihaamixxe sanne kadeenni hexxe'e tommenna saddeeta wogga duuchcha durriisi usuree'naa hexxa'n konne usurrinaa'n edi Sanbatixxa barra'n tikema isee hasissabaan hiyyateeta?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Tennee haaso'e wodda isoo gareerammakiir duuchchi shooke; ardi duuchchi kinni isi asseexxe maso yaane'n gammade.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shaaniinxe Gummakanna Lebeletika Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat. 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:18-21">13:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:31-33">13:31-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusinna hiyyee qici, «Mageniinxi mootumma maachcho fakkaatta? Ise maye'n herreganno? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ise mitti manjichchi aadheexxi fichchi giddo rokeexxe mitte shaaniixxe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Senaaficetike hiddichixxi gumma shaanxe guma fakkataan</char></note> gumma fakkaataan; isenna nophphite haqichcho lumoke kadde; ci'atinna isexxe damuwwa'ni mine ijaadhdhite.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Higgeena Yessuussi hiyyee qici, «Mageniinxa mootumma mayik herreganno? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Isenna mitte manjichcho sase oobo bulle aaxxeexxi bukeessiteexxe lebele fakkaattaan.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cu'maxxa Hula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21:23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi Iyyerusaalemi'a me'ate'ni hedheexxi giddii'n sa'aake qachchuwa'ninna olla'uwwa'n barisiisa'ne sa'a'neemman. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mitti manjichinna isiba shiqeexxi isoo, «Anke Goottaa! Anjiremaak heenooke manna callata?» hiyyeexxi qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yessuussinna hiyyeexxi insa'ne haaso'ee qici: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Eetten cu'maxxe hula'ni e'yatee ci'chche; ha'noo hiyyaannen, heddi manni e'yatee halchaan; yaane kinni e'ya dande'abaan. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Miniik anni ke'eexxi hula danqareechchi uduma gadho uurritineexxi, ‹Gootta! No'aa bani› hitina'n hula ganganate'ni kexxinaan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">«Isi kinni hiisseexxi, ‹Ha'noo habaa'ni daggineexxa ege'nebo'non.›<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />«Ookkonneechchi uduma isoo, ‹Atinni welti inde'ennan ha'wine'ena; atinninna weldeenna no'oxxe'ni no'oo barsiisse'ettan› hitinaan.<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />«Yaane kinn isinna hiisseexxi insa'ne, ‹Ha'noon kulo, ha'no ayyette kaddineexxanna habaa'ni daggineexxa hano'o ege'nebe'no; ha'noo fuggaaleeyye duuchchi anenaa'n bayyatte› hiyyaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Far. 6:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />«Abirihaamii'i, Yisaaqiinna Ya'iqoobii'i, wabeeko duuchchanna Mageniinxe mootumma giddo affinaa wodda, ha'noo kinni gadho hunendineexxi gattina wodda ookkone wodda oodhishshanna isso qadhdhate ha'no'aa kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Heddi ardi borotenaa'n dhidhimakenaa'n middakenaa'ninna bita'akenaa'n dageexxi Mageniinxe mootumma'ni itatee'e ofo'laan. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Kunnise udu'meemmakiirinna edisaake kadaan, ediseemmakirinna udu'maake kadaan.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi'i Iyyerussaalemixxe'e Yaadeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Eettenne yanna Feerisitot giddii'n mitti mitti manni dageexxi Yessuusii'i, «Heeroodisi atee shiyo'a yora'emmaxxee kexxettexxi kabaa'n me'i!» hine.<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yessuussi kinni insa'ne'n, «Martineexxi ookkone jeedala'n, ‹Telchonna soodo fuggichcha hafuuruwwa fulchannon; dhukkuffateekaara fayyisannon; sakka barro huje anxa birannon› hiyya'neen hitine iso'ni kulle. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kaddo malee wabeek Iyyerusaalemi gadho reya isi'a hasisaa gophphaammaxxee, techchonna soodo, o'misoodo ani Iyyerussaalemi'a me'a hasissaan.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Iyyerusaalemi, tee Iyyerusaalemi, ati wabeeko shilatoxxi, atiba ergemeekaaranna kinoti cancaqqattoxxi, lukkichcho keeli ifik hunda beltanna ifixxa bukki assexxammashsha oose atixxa bukki assonnaa me'ele atee halchenne; Ha'noo kinni macci hitinebaan. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Kunnise mini ha'nook onake kadee gataan; ha'no'a kulo, ‹Goottiinke summini dagaakixxa wodo hitinaa qico› ta'ani edi'a ane'e affinabaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Far. 118:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Erm. 22:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Mitte Feriisichchi Mine'n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mitte Edi Sanbatixxa barra Yessuusi itaa ito'aa Feerisitotike sooreessaa kadeemmake manjike mine'n e'ye wodda manni isoo'o illeti dooyya'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ookkonna bisi isik duuchchi darshe'naa ela gopheemmak manjichchi Yessuusi edi darree'n hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yessuusinna seeriinka muxxalluwwanna Feerisito, «Edik Sanbatixxa barra dhukkulliyye fayyisa seerake moo seerakebaa?» hiyye insa'nee qore. <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Insa'ne kinni hiissichcho uunebaangi sammine; Yessuussinna manjichcho ookkonee aadhe fayyiseexxi me'aashsha asse. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi insa'ne, «Ha'noo giddii'ni belti ifike yookaan qotiyyichchi ifik Edike Sanbatixxa barra bale giddo e'yoole rakeexxi fulchabaak ayyete?» hiyye insa'ne qore. <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Insa'nenna mitte hiyyichchonna tennexxee hiissa dandeennebaan.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yessuusi jilatee ye'eemeek manni ulfaateexxa bakka abixxo'a hokkokkisaa'naa afeexxi hiyya'ni insa'nexxee mammakee qici, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Mitti manji ate'e jilatee ye'oole ulfinniinxe bakka'n ofoldoxxe'e; ati irra ulfeessemmaak manji ye'emeexxe kaddo'oole, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />ha'noo lamiinga ye'emmak dageexxi, ‹Tenne bakka isi'a waali!› hiyyaan; ookkone wodda atinna shookka'n tuffatendeexxe bakkabaa me'itatton. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Yaane kinni ye'endatto wodda heennoxxa bakka uuddettexxi ofo'li; atee ye'emmakinna dageexxi atee, ‹Koo anke jaalo, ulfaatteexxe bakka'n iima saxxe ofo'li› atee hiyyaan; atinna eettene yanna atinni welti jilatee ye'ememmake manni edo ulfaattatton. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Tinni kaddaachchinna ifi lummisaak duuchchi shiixxedhaan; ifi shiixxishshaaki duuchchinna lummedhaan.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yessuusinna ookkone jilatee ye'emmaka manjichchonna «Jilatee dhiyaanna yookaani hiribaata shiqishshatto wodda insa'neenna ati'a bado hiisinabaashsha jaaluwwa atika, dayyuwwa atika, firuwwa atika olla'iinxa dureeyye yexxoxxe'e. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Yaane kinni jila qixxeessitatto wodda hiyyeeyye, hokkoluwwa, naafuwwakanna balla'uwwa ye'i! <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Atinna eebbisendatton. Insa'ne ati'a bado hiissa dande'a gonphammaxxee, qulliyye reyotenaa'n kexxaa wodda ati'a Magen hira hiissaan.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lumoxxe Jilaka Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Yessuusin welt itatee ofo'leeki giddii'n mitti tennee laqeexxi, «Mageniinxe mootumma'ni shiqqeexxe itanaa'ni itaakixxa wodo!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yessuussinna iso'n hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'eeqic, «Mitti manjichchi lumooxxa jila jileexxi heddo manna ye'e. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Eettene jilaxxi yannanna gelte wodda ye'endemmaxxa keessumma, ‹Kunse duuchchiingeechch qixxo'emmaxxe amme› hiyye ye'aashsha erganjo ifika insa'ne'n erge.<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />«Yaane kinni duuchchiing ififixxa irkifachcho shiqishate'n ke'e; taakeessok ta'a reefi ‹Boga hidhe'ennaxxe'e marennexxi iso uuda ane'e hasissaan, maganneten ani'a gattowwaal hiyyi› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />«Mittikinna, ‹Ani onde qotiyyo hidheennaxxe'e tenne qotiyyo leenjisa ane'e hasissammaxxe'e magannete'n ani'a gattowwaal hiyyi› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />«Welikinna, ‹Ani reefike waajubichcho kade'ennaxxe'e daga dande'abe'no› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />«Iikki erganjinna illee iima hige dageexxi tennee ifike gootta'n kule. Eettene yanna ookkone mini anni mufateexxi ifika erganjo ‹Rakketexxi qachchiinxe weldeennuwwabaanna qaxxaammura oruwwibaa mari; hiyyeeyye, kooko'iyye, balla'uwwakanna naafuwwa kabaa'a iyyedagi!› hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Iikki erganjinna, ‹Anke gootta! Ajajjettexxi duuchchi assende'een; ta'anna gatte'exxi bakka hexxeen› hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Goottikinna ifika erganjo hiyyeeqic, ‹Weldennuwwate'ninna hadi giddii'a me'ammake oruwwibaa mari; anki mininna wo'maashsha affetteka duuchcha aaxxe iyyedaga'n e'yishi. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ha'noo'ni kulo, ookkone ye'ememmake manni giddii'ni mittikinna midde anxe jilaxxa ita afo'ik maqabaan› hiyye.»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hordofalloke Kada Laqqaaka Hira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Heddi ardi Yessuusinni welti me'a'nenge'n udumi'a wirri hiyyeexxi insa'ne hiyyee qici; <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Anibaa dagaak duuchchi annakanna ama ifixxa, are ifixxa oose ifixxa, ifika dayyuwwanna ifixxa dayyuwwa, ifixxa hedhonna midde gattebaang giba gophoole anke hordofallo kada dande'abaan. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Umo ifikixxa fannonna ba'edheexxi anee hordofabaak anke hordofallo kada dande'abaan.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />«Ha'noo giddii'n mitti manji mine ijaaro'a hasoole, hujetixxe muuxaa'a geyaak hitteeke maallaqa kadeexxa ediseexxi ofo'le hira herregabaak aate? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ookkone minixxa booso ofo'lisheexxi muuxa isoo dhibbeexxe kaddoole iso'o uudeek duuchchi iso'n gacifataan. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Isoonna, ‹Kunni manjichchi ijaarsa safeexxi muuxa dande'ebaan› hinaan.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />«Yookaan mitti moyanji wele moyanjinni lolema hasaaxxa yanna lame tomme kuma loliinka manna adhdheexxi iso'n dagaaka moyanjo tomme kumma loliinke manninni ifinaa'n faachcheefata dande'aaxxa afo'leexxi mari'atabaak aate? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Dande'abaake kadoole kinni iikki lolo'aa daga'neeki moyanji bayaanni hedhee'naa araarake erganjuwwa iso'n ergedhaan. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Iittani ha'no giddii'n afeechcho duuchcha walabaak anke hordofallo kada dande'aba'a.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">La'o Affebaaxxa Maxine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Maxine elloolchoni; maxine xe'me ifixxa gophpheexxe kaddoole kinni hittata kadde langaxxa maxinummatixxa xe'me afa dandeettataa? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Iitta hexxeexxi maxine bogakeenna kadi fichcha shaqqishatee la'o afa gophpheemmaxxe gadho hunendaan:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">«Laqqaaxxa mansha afe'eek laqowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ba'eemmake Gedhechchika Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Mitte barra qaraxa bukki assammakiirinna cubbaaleeyye duuchcha hiyyaaxxa laqatee Yessuusike qarqara'n qoqqobe. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Feerisitonna Muuseke seerik barachchiisalluwwi, «Kunni manjichchi cubbaaleyyeti hosaan; insa'nenni weltinna itaan» hiyya'n Yessuusii aallate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luq. 5:29-30</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yessuusinna hiyya'n insa'neexxee mammaakee qici <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Ha'noo giddii'ni mitti dhibba gedhebo afee'naa konne giddii'n mitti ba'oole sallane tommenna sallane badda'ate'n waaleexxi ookkone ba'eeka afatee hasto me'abaak ayyete? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Afee woddanna gammade'e dugummote'n dulkeexxi <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ifike minibaanna illee iima higaan; jaaluwwa ifikanna olla'uwwa ifika mitteba ye'eexxi insa'ne, ‹Ba'eemmaka anka gedhechcho alfeennaxxee aninni welti gammadde!› hiyyaan. <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ha'noo'ni kulo, iittanni aadde aaga hasissabaake sallane tommenna sallane qulliyye irra aadde aagaake mitte cubbichchixxe'ee iimate'n gammashsho kaddaan.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baxxeemmaxxe Saanteka Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Tomme birre saantime affeexxe manjichchonaa'n tommetenaa'n mitte baxxeexxe kaddoole affa qici'a ifa issexxe'e mini filteexxi jaba qicinni hassabaaxxi manjichcho ise ayyete? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Isee affaa woddanna jaaluwwa ifikanna olla'uwwa ifika mitteba yexxeexxi insa'ne, ‹Anenaa'n baxxeemmaxxa saante alfe'ennaxxe aninni welti gammadde!› hitaani. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ha'noo'ni kulo, iittanni aadde aagaake mitte cubbaaleessixxe'ee Mageniinxe erganna edo gammashshote kaddaani.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba'e Afemeeke Beltixxee Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Lebeexxi Yessuusi insa'ne'n hiyyee qici; «Mitti manjichchi lame labbaxxe oose afeemmani. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Lami giddii'n maa'n belti anna, ‹Anke annaa atixxe karranaa'ni ani'a geyaaka qoobbo uwwi› hiyye. Annikinna karra ifixxa lamiinxe ifixxe oose'aa qoode.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />«Heddo barranna turebaang iikki maa'n beltichchi isoo'o geyemmaka qoobbo duuchcha bukki assedheexxi bayyi bogiba'a me'e; ookkoonna fooggaleexxi maallaqa ifika bire. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Isinna afemaachcho duuchcha bireechchi uduma ookkone bogi giddo duuchcha jabak solo'i kade; isinna rakkatate'n ke'e. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Tennexxee ookkone bogike mitte manjichchi hunda aage; manjichchikinna booyye isi'a allalaashsha ifike fichchi giddi'aa isoo erge. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Isinna booyye ittaammaxxe midhaka huura ito'aa alche'nemman; yaane kinni isoonni midde isi'a uwwa'emmak hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />«Qalbeeffachchote'n higeexxa yanna kinni hiyyee qici, ‹Me'i anke annik hujalluwwi ite gopheexxi galchedha'ne; anee kinni kaba solo'i shiyo'ate. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ke'e anke anniba marennexxi; Annayyo Mageni edonna ati edo balleessenneni. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ta'anni elqa'a atike belto hiyyeme ye'ema ani'a hasissaba'a; yaane kinni ati'a hujammake mitte erganjishsha ane'e uudi iso'o hiyyannon› hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Tennexxe ke'eexxi ifike anniba'a me'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Yaane kinni bayyann hedhee'naa anni isik iso'o afeexxi isi'a marare; isiba'anna gonga'n mareexxi isoo hanqalfe sunqedhe.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />«Beltikinna isoo, ‹Annayyoo Mageni edonna ati edo balleesseenneni; ta'anni edi'a atike belto hiyyeme ye'ema ani'a hasissaba'a› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />«Anni isik kinni ifike erganjuwwa'n hiyyee qici, ‹Rakkineexxi duuchchiinxenaa'ni caaldaaxxa seemma iyyedagine'e iso'n oddeesse; qubichcho isike'n qube, lekka isixxe'ninna kophe uggurre! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Ha'yo jibbichchanna iyyedaggine isi'a dulle; inda'ni gammando! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kunn ank belti reyeemmani; ta'a kinni hedhoke kade'eeni; ba'edhemman, afeme'eni!› ookkonneechchi udumanna gammadate'n ke'ne.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Eettene yanna isik angafi belti fichcha hedhdhemmani. Ookkoo'n illee iima higa'n mini'a shiqee wodda massinqotikanna sirbiinka hafuura laqe. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Isinna erganjuwwi giddii'n mitte ye'eexxi tinni yaane maachcho? Hiyyeexxi qore. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ergajikinna iso'ni: ‹Dayyo atike dageedheen; nage'ikinna fayya hedheexxi dagemmaxxee anni atik ha'yo jibichcha isi'a duledheen› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />«Angafi belti mufateexxi mini'anna e'ya gibe; anni isikinna mini'a e'yaashsha isoo kadhate. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Isi kinni annake'n hiisse hiyye haaso'eeqic, ‹Kunise, konne baro duuchcha garbiinsha ati'a ergateme'ennen; ajaja atikenaa'n mittekanna midde xe'ishebo'no; ati kinni jaaluwwa ankenni gammadannoshsha mitte re'etika beltanjo midde ani'aa uute egendebexxo. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Yaane kinni atik belti karra atixxa yabaabulto melaalle'n bireexxi dagee woda ha'yo jibichcha isi'a duldetten› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />«Ann isikinna isoo, ‹Anke beltoo, ati duuchchi wodda aninni welti hexxetten; anke kadeechchi duuchchi atichcho. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kunni atik dayyi kinni reyeedhemman; ta'a kinni hedhoke kade; ba'eemman, afeme'een; tennexxee jillennexxi gammada no'aa hasiissaani.› »<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Qaroontichcha Karratike Galchallixxe Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yessuusi hordofeeyye ifixxe'n hiyyee qici «Mitti dureessi manjichchi karra isixxa isi'a galchaaka mitte manjichcho afe'emman; Kunni galchalli karra atixxa faangessa'neen hineexxi isoo aallanta'n konne dureessichcho'n kulle. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Tennexxee isoo ye'iseexxi iso'n, ‹Tinni ate'n laqennexxi yaane maachcho? Ta'ani edi'a ati anxe karrake galchallo kada dande'a gophphattaxxe galchitattaxxe anxe karraka hisaaba hujjettexxi ani'a shiqishi.›<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />«Iikki karrati galchallinna ifike godobi giddo, ‹Goottii anee galchallummatenaa'n hoyyo'aten; wiilsunnaxxe hunna afebe'no; kadhatunnaxxe shoka'enne; tennexxee maassennexxa woyya? <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Galchallummatenaa'n gatennexxe kaddoole manni ane'e mini'a adhdhaashsha egedhita maa assannoxxa anende ege'neennen.›<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />«Tennexxee ifike goottika liqa afeeka mitte mittenga manna ye'e. Isi taakkeessoka manjichcho, ‹Anke goottika hitteeka liqa affe'ette?› hiyye qore.<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />« ‹Isinna dhibba waaba zayite liqi ane'n hedheen› hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">«Galchallikinna weli aaggotika atika woraqata ya, ‹Rakke ofoldettexxi itti onde tomme waaba hitettexxi borreessi› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />«Langakanna ye'eexxi, ‹Ate'nita me'eke hedhe?› hiyye iso'o qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">« ‹Isinna, dhibba kuntaala dinne liqa afeennen› hiyye hiisse haaso'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">«Galchallikinna atike liqika woraqata ya, ‹Ittinna shoole tomme kuntaala› hite borreessi hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />«Goottikinna xuurammeessake kadebaaka ookkone galchallo qarumma isixxee isoo jaje. Tenne buttak manni ifike galdumixxe ifiinke manni irra qarontichchake. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Tennexxee ha'noo'ni kulo, tenne buttak maallaqi mudaa wodda duuchchi woddike mi'ne'n qophema alfitinaashsha konne maallaqinninni jaaluwwa ifi'a giisedhe.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />«Shiixxooxxe yaane'ni xuraameessake kadeek lumoxxe'ninna xuurammeessake; hee'nooxxe yaane'n xuurammeessake kadebaak lumoxxe yaane'ninna xuurammeessakebaan. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Yoona tenne buttaxxe karra'n xuurammeessake kada gophphinoole dhugaatixxa karra'afa'i ayyete ha'noo'ni maganne uwwa? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Wele mannike maallaqa'n xuurammeessumma afa gophphinoole ha'noonxe kaddeexxa karra ayyete ha'noo'ni uwwa?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Mitte yanna'n lame gootti'a ergatema dande'aak huun erganjinna hedhabaan; mitte jibbee wele eeyyaani; yookaan mittinbaa shikki hiyyee wele tuffata; Magenokeenna maallaqakee ergatemma dandeettinaba'a.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat. 6:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seerakanna Mageniinxa Mootumma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Maallaqa eetammaxxi Feerisito tenne duuchcha laqqeexxi Yessuus'n gacifatte. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo manji edo ifi qulliyye manna assitinaan; Magen kinni qalbe ha'nooxxa ege'ne'een. Manji edo ulfateechchi Magen edo batto'eechchon.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seeriinxeenna Aadha Heerumiinxee'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«Muuseki seeriinkinna wabeekkotik maxaafi Yohaannisi qico'n lallabema'n ture'en; ookkonneechchi uduma kinni Mageniinxe mootummaxxi eloxxi odo kulende'eeni; manji duuchchinna ookko e'yatee jaba qico wo'laanaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat. 5:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Yaane kinni seerakeenaa'ni mitte beddo ibbeexxi mannii'n iimatinna butta sa'a shollexxaan.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Are ifixxa tikeexxi wele aadhaaki duuchchi yabaabula; aro'okenaa'ni tikendeexxa aadhaakinna yabaabula.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dureessa Manjichchonna Ali'aazaari'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Baddeessittenna eloxxa layino oddo'weexxi, barra barra'n danqasha gala'n gammadaammak mitte dureessa manjichcho hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Bisi isik duuchchi mada calla kade'ek Alaazaari hiyyemaake mitti hiyyeessi manjichchi konne dureessi manjixxe baxxe edo diiphaamman. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Kunni hiyyeessi ookkone dureessichchixxe qorenaa'n ibba'emmaxxa hanba midde ito'a halcha'emman; worshikinna gatebaang dageexxi mada isixxa arraaphpha'emman.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />«Kunni hiyyeessinna reye; erganatinna isoo Abirihaami biri'a iyyemarte. Dureessichchikinna reyenna moogemeen. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Si'oole giddonna abara uuda'neebaa'n qokki hiyyeexxi Abirihaaminna Abirhaami bira hedhemmaka Alaazaarii'i afe. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Isinna hafuura gikki asseexxi, ‹Anna anke Abirihaamii! Ani'a marar; kaba giiratike bube'no'n jaba qico abara uudate'n hedheennaxxee'e, Alaazaari qubichcho ifika wodeeke'n cuupheexxi arrabo anka ani'a qiidisaashsha maganneten isoo ani'a ergi› hiyya'n raare.<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />«Abirihaami kinni hiisseexxi hiyyee qici ‹Anke belto! Ati buttate'n hexxattake baro'n eloxxa yaanuwwa adhdhitettexxa, Alaazaarinna fuggoxxa yaanuwwa adhdhemmaxxa qalliyyi. Ta'a kinni isi kaba dayya'aa wodda ati abara uudate'n hexxetten. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Tenne gadhi darre kabaa'n ha'noobaa sa'a hasaak dande'abaaxxa, ookko hedheekiirinna no'obaa foofabaashsha no'oxxenna ha'nooxxe oddo'n lumok bowwa'i hedhaashsha assende'een.›<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />«Durreessi manjichchinna hiyyee qici, ‹Anke anna yoona Ala'azaari anke annike minibaa ergitattoshsha atee kadhataannen. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ani onde dayyuwwa afeennaxxe insa'nenna abara konneke boonchibaa dangabaashsha insa'ne xexxe'achchiisuun.›<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />«Abirihaami kinni, ‹Dayyuwwi atik Muusekanna wabeekotika maxaafuwwa afe'emmaxxe insa'nenaa'n laqowwaali!› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />«Dureessi manjichchinna, ‹Anke anna Abirihaamii! Iitatebaan; mitti manji reyotenaa'ni ke'eexxi insa'neba mareele yaandeexxi aadde aangaan› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />«Abirihaaminna, ‹Dayyuwwi atiki Muusekanna wabeekotika maxaaffuwwa laqa gonpha'noole mitti manji reyotenaa'n ke'eexxi insa'ne'n kuloolenna midde amannabaan›.»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Manjo Guggufachchiisatena'ni Heqqedha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yessuussi ifixxa hordofeeyye hiyyee qici, «Manna guggufachchisaaxxi yanna daga gattabaan; yaane kinni eettene guggufachchiissaxxe yaanexxe dagaa'a buutote kadaake manji'a isi'a aanne. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kunni manjichchi konne shiixxarammuwwanaa'n mitte gugufachchiseexxi mannii'n daamminka kinjo gooba isike'n usuremee'na'a abbaayya giddi'a hunemeele isi'aa woyyamman. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Tennexxe ha'no umo ha'noongee heqqedhdhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Dayyi atik atee balleessoole iso'o xixi, aadde aageexxe kaddoole isi'a gattowwaal hiyyi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat. 18:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Barrate'n atee torbaanele balleesseexxi, torbaanele ‹Atee balleesseenneni› hiyya'n atibaa dagoole» isi'a gattowwaal hiyyi.<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Ergameeyyetinna Gootta Yessuussii'i, «Amana no'oxxa no'o'a lebi!» hite. <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Gootti Yessuussinna insa'nee, «Senaaficetike gummichchi qicixxa amana affinoole konnee ode'e ‹Goshendettexxi abbaayya giddo kaasemi› hitinoole isi ha'no'aa ajajemaan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Lebeexxi Yessuussinna hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo giddii'n mitti manji wiisaallo yookaan gedhebo allalaaka erganjo afe'exxe kadoole, fichchi giddii'n dageeka ookkone ifika erganjo, ‹Amo itatee ofo'li› hiyyaata? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Tenne irra isoo, ‹Hiribaata itonnaa ani'a qixxees; ite ha'wanno qici'anna ani'a ergatem; ookkonneechchi uduma atinna ite ha'witatton› hiyyabaata? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Eeggedhita'a, iikki erganji ajajememmaxxa asseemmaxxee gootti isoo galateeffataachcho ha'noo'ni labbaata? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Iittaanni ha'noonna ajajendinemmaxxa duuchcha assitina wodda, ‹No'o woyi fullabo'noke erganjuwwan; assinennexxinna no'oo assa hasissaanxen› hiyye.».<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soomakenaa'n Luqqi hiyeeka Tomme Manna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuussi Iyyerusaalemi'a me'a'ni Semaariyaxxenna Geliilaxxe gabalabaa'n sa'a'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Mitte olla'i giddi'anna e'ya'neenge'n sooma afe'eek tommi manni isinni afeme. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Insa'ne bayyante uurrine hafuura gikki assineexxi «Gootta Yessuusii no'aa marar!» hine. <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yessuussinna insa'nee afeexxi «Martineexxi ifi qeesolete'n leellishshe!» hiyye. Insa'nenna ookko'a me'ina'ninni soomakenaa'n luqqi hine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew. 14:1-32</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Insa'ne giddii'n mitti fayyeexxa ifi uudee wodda gikkichchi hafuurinni Mageno galateeffata'n illee iima hige. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Yessuussixxe lekka'n isi edonna gonbisemeexxi isoo galateeffate; kunni manjichchinna Semaarichchokemman. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yessuusinna isoo hiyya'n qoree qici, «Soomake'naa'n luqqi hiyyeemmak tomme mannammabaata? Sallanita haba hedhe? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Konne alagi manji gadhi darre illee iima higeexxi Mageno galateeffataak hedhebaan hiyyatebaata?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuussi ookkone manjichcho, «Amana atixxi ate'e fayyisseen, kexxettexxi me'i» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniinxe Mootummaxxa Daga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Feerisito Mageniinxi mootumma haano daggaaxxa Yessuussi laqqee wodda, isinna insa'ne'n hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'ee qici, «Mageniinxi mootumma leelaake orinni daggabaani. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Mannikinna, ‹Kunse kaba hexxeen› yookaani ‹Ookko hexxeen!› hiyya dande'abaan; kunse Mageniinxi mootumma ha'noxxe oddo hexxeeni.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Lebeexxi Yessuussi ifixxa hordofeeyye hiyyee qici, «Manjiinke Beltixxe barruwwanaa'ni mitte uudatee halchitinaaxxe yanna daggaani; yaane kinni ise affinabaan. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Manni ha'noo'ni, ‹Isi ookko hedheen› yookaan ‹kaba hedheen› hiyyaan; insa'ne hordoffinenna martinoqqe. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Tinni kaddaachchinna balaqi balaqeexxi iimatike mitte kasinaa'n wel kasi qico'n ifisammashsha Manjiink Beltinna dagaaxxi barra iittanni kaddaan. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Yaane kinni tinni kaaddebaa edi darre Manjiink Belt heddo abara adhdhanna tenne ila'n tuffatema hasissaan.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />«Nohike baro'n kaddeemma qicishsha, Manjiinke Beltike baro'ninna iittanni kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:8">Dada. 6:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Nohi lumoxxe hobolo giddo e'yeexxe barra qico'n manni ite ha'wa'ni, aadha'ninna heerunsiisa'nemman; balleessammak wodi'inna dageexxi duuchchinga bire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Dada. 7:6-24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />«Looxike baro'ninna iittandemman; manni ite ha'wa'n, gurgudhdhe hidhdha'n, kaalsa'nee mine jaadhdha'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Looxi Soodomike qachchanaa'n fulleexxa barra kinni giiratinna ha'yaak kinji iimatenaa'ni ganeexxi insa'nee duuchchiinga bireeni.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />«Manjiink Belti leellaaxxa barranna iittanni kaddaan. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Eettene barra mine ifiki hana hedheek huuni manjinna ifike mini giddo hedheeka miya adhdho'a dirrooqqe! Iittani fichchi giddo hedheek mine ifikibaa higoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mat. 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mar. 13:15-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Looxixxa are qalliyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Dada. 19:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Hedho ifixxa gatlso'a hasaak duuchchi isee gopha; hedho ifixxa sa'isseexxi uwwaak kinni isee gatilsa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luq. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ha'noo'ni kulo, eettene hashsha lami manni mitte mine'ni diipha, mitti adhdhemaani; langak gataan. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Lame melaalle mitteba damma dalta mitte adhdhendaani; langaxxi gattaan.» <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Lami manni fichchi giddo mitteba huccaan; mitti adhdhemaani; langak gataan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Konne laakkosa'n hedheek yaadi edike mirqisanjo maxaafuwwa'n afemabaan. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Hordofeeyyetinna Yessuussi'i, «Goottaa manni iikki adhdhema'neek haba'ate?» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Isinna insa'ne'n, «Reyeechchi hedheeba allaatte bukki hitaan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Soodachchote'n Cichchiteexxe Aro'o Shi'witeexxe Manjichchoka Fakkeenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Ookkonneechchi uduma hordofeeyye isixxi ifi gophphebaang duuchchi wodda soodachcho insa'ne'a hasissaaxxa insa'ne'n leellisho'a Yessuussi konneechchi butta hedheeka mammaassa insa'ne''ni hiyye mammaakee qici; <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />«Mitte qachchi giddo hedhaak Mageno sodaatabaak manjokanna ulfeessabaake mitte hayyichcha hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ookkone qachchi giddo mitte aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichcho hexxemman; isenna ‹Anxenna anke naaphixxe oddo'n hexxeexxa yaane'n ani'a muri!› hita'ni hayyichchiinbaa ora fulchita'nemman.<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />«Hayyichchikinna murte ise'aa uwwebaang heddo barra ture; uduma kinni qalbe giddo, ‹Mageno sodaata gophonnolenna, manjokanna ulfeessa gophonnolenna <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />tinni aro'o shi'witeexxi manjichcho anee rakkissammaxxee ise'a murannon, kada gophphoole kinni duuchchi wodda dagga'n anee rakkissaan.› »<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Lebeexxi Gootti hiyyee qici, «Iikki Fuggichchi hayyichchi hiyyeexxa laqqe! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Magenita hashshanna barra isibaa oodhaake filemeeke ifike manni'a murabaata? Harange insa'ne'n gaga'mi hiyaata? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ha'noo'ni kulo, isi rakee insa'ne'aa muran. Yaane kinni manjiink Belt dagaa wodda buttate'n amana alfuman?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Feriisichchiinxanna Qaraxa Bukki assammakixxee Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Ifi qullichchake asse uudati ifi saadaakeerii'anna wele manna kinni tuffateeke mannixxee konne mammaassa insa'ne'a hiyya'n mammaakee qici: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Lami manni soodachchotee'e alalle galmi giddi'a me'e; mitti feerisichchoke langak qaraxa bukki assa'emmakemman. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Feerisichchikinna uurreexxi ifixxee soodata'n hiyyee qici: ‹Mageno ani wele manni duuchchishsha, bokkaame xaqartichcha, yabaabula giddii'ninni konne qaraxa bukki assaammake manjichchishsha kada gopheennaxxe'e atee galateeffatannen. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ani torbaate'ni lamele agabo goddo hosaannon; alfannochcho duuchchanaa'ninna tommitte ati'aa uwwaannon.›<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />«Iikki qaraxa bukki assammaki kinni bayyanni urreexxi, iimi'anna midde qokki hiyya haseba'a. Yaane kinni qoma ifixxa ga'na'n, ‹Mageno, anee balleessanjokee marar› hiyya'nemman.<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />«Ha'noo'ni kulo, ookkone fariisichchi irra kunni Mageni edo qullichchiinsha uudemeexxi mine ifikibaa higeen; ifi lummisaak duuchchi shiixxedhaan; ifi shiixxishaak kinni lummedhaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luq. 14:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Annoole Eebbiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Yessuussi anga ifixxa hana uggaashsha manni annoole isibaa iyyedagaamman; hordofeeyye isixxinna tenne affeexxi insa'ne xixxe. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Yessuusi kinni annoole ifibaa ye'eexxi hiyyee qici, «Mageniinxi mootumma insa'neeshsha hedheekeeri'a kaddeemmaxxe'e annoole anibaa daggo'aa waalle hoyyitinoqqe'e. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Dhugaate ha'noo'ni kulaannen, Magniinxa mootumma annooletishsha adhdhabaak duuchchi haranga ise'ni e'yabaan.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dureessa Ayihudiinka Sooressa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ayihudiinke sooresuwwi giddii'n mitti, «Mararallo barachchiisallo duuchchi woddxxa hedho alfonnaa maachcho assanno?» hiyyeexxi Yessuussii qore.<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yessuusinna iso'n: «Anee maayee marachchiisanjo hitatto?» isinna hiisexxi «mitte Mageno malee ayyinna mararaalli hedhebaan. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ajajuwwi isikinna: ‹Yabaabuldoxxe'e, shiltoxxe'e, mortoxxe'e, dhark dhugaa kuldoxxe'e, annakanna ama atixxa ulfeessi!› hiyyaka ajajuwwa egendeetteni.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Fula. 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Lan. 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Manjichchikinna: «Konneeraqqa oosummandenaa'n safee'e heqqedhennen» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yessuusi tennee laqee wodda manjichchoke'n, «Yoona mitte yaane calla ati'aa gattaan; affettelcho duuchcha gurgurte hiyyeeyyete'e uwwi! Iimate'ninna tuulendeexxe karra affatton; ookkonneechchi uduma anee dagge hordofi» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Manjichchi kinni tenne laqee wodda lumooshsha dureessake kadeemmaxxe'e yo'oshsha yaade. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yessuusinna kunni manjichchi lumooq qica yadeexxa uudeexxi isoo hiyyee qici, «Dureeyyete Mageniinxe mootumma'ni e'ya hittatta selli assitaaxxee! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Dureessi Mageniinxe mootumma'ni e'ya irra gaali miiletike qo'i giddi'ni sa'aa isi'aa shollexxaan!»<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Tenne laqeek manni, «Iittate kaddooleta ayyete anjirema dande'a?» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yessuussinna, «Manjoke'n dande'endabaaxxi Magenoke'n dandendendaan» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Pheexiroosinna Yessuussi'i, «Kunse no'o anfenelcho duuchcha waallee atee hordonfeenneeni» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yessuussinna insa'ne'aa hiyyee qici, «Dhugaate ha'noo'ni kulaannen Mageniinxe mootummaxxee hiyyeexxi ifika mine, yookaani are ifixxa, yookaan, dayyuwwa ifika yookaan hado ifika yookaan oose ifixxa waaleek <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />konne baro'ni heddo dachcha'a, dagaake barro'ninna duuchchi woddixxa hedho alfabaaki ayyinna hedhebaan.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Ifixxe Reyoxxee Sakkaxxa Yanna Haaso'eexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yessuussi tommenna lame hordofeeyye ifixxa ifibaa shikki asseexxi insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Kunse allalle Iyyerusaalemi'a me'inonnaaten; wabeeko Manjiinke Beltixxee borreessiteexxi duuchchi muuxendaan. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Isi Ayihudake kadebaake mannixxe anga'ni sa'isseme uwwemaan; insa'nenna iso'n gacifantaan, yowwinaan, iso'ninna tunfaan. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Isoo jadhanfeechchi udumanna shinnaani; isinna sakkaxxa barra reyotenaa'n ke'aan.»<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Hordofeeyye kinni tenne yaane duuchchanaa'n qalbeeffateexxi mitte yaanenna hexxeba'a; konne hiyyichchixxi tikanna insa'nenaa'n sho'ondeemmaan; Isi mayiinxe yaanexxee haaso'eexxanna egenneemmabaan.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ille Afammabaake Manjichchixxa Fayya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:45-52">Mar. 10:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yessuussi Iyyarko'a shiqee wodda mitti balla'i oriini qarqara ofo'lee kadhata'nemmani. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Iikki balla'inna ardi ookkoo'n sa'a'neexxa laqeexxi, Kunni maachcho? Hiyye qore. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Insa'nenna, «Naazireetik Yessuusi kabaa'n sa'ate'n hedheen» hine iso'ni kulle. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Isinna, «Yessuusi, Daawwitike Belto ani'a marar!» hiyya'n raare. <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Edi darree'n me'ate'n hedheemmakiiri sammi hiyyaashsha isoo xixe. Isi kinni, «Daawwitike Beltoo! Ani'a marar» hiyya'ni caala raare.<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yessuusinna uurreexxi ookkone manjichcho isibaa iyyedangaashsha ajaje. Isiba'anna dagee wodda <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Ati'a maa assonnaa hassaatte?» hiyye isoo qore. Iikki ille afammabaakinna, «Anke Gootta afonnaa hasaanne» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yessuusinna, «Afi amana atixxi atee fayyisse'eni» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Manjichchikinna hiribange'n afa dande'e; Magenokanna ulfeessa'ni Yessuussi'i hordofe. Ardi duuchchi tennee uudaa wodda Mageno galateeffate.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Qaraxa Bukki Assammaka Zekewosii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yessuussi Iyyarkoke qachchi giddo e'ye'e ookko'n sa'eexxi me'ate'ni hedhemman. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Summi isiki Zekewoosi hiyyemaak mitti manjichchinna ookko hedhemman; isinna qaraxxa bukkassammakeeri'a umokenna dureessa manjomman. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Isinna Yessuusi hiyyema'neek hoonte kadeexxa iso'o uudo'a hasa'nemman; yaane kinni isi hojja harumaake kadeemmaaxxe'e isoo afa dande'ebaan. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Yessuusi ookkone ora sa'nemmaxxee edi'a gongeexxi mitte odi'i hana da'me.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yessuusinna ookko geyee wodda qokki hiyyeexxi, «Koo Zekewoosi! Techcho ani atike mine'ni hosonna'a haseennen, rakke dirri!» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zekewoosinna rake dirreexxi gammashshoti Yessuussii mini'a adhdhe.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ookko hedhemmak manninna tenne afeexxi, «Kunni manjichchi cubbaaleessiinke mine'ni keessummummati e'yeen!» hiyya'n Yessuusi'ni gungume.<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zekewoosi kinni uurreexxi Goottaa, «Goottaa kunse ani afennexxe karra duuchchinaa'n gamisa hiyyeeyyete'e uwwannoni; ayyennaa'ninna seeribelo adhdho'onnole, shoole anga assee hiissannon.»<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yessuusinna isoo, «Kunni majichchi Abirihaamixxe sanne kadeemmaxxee telcho anjirema konne mine'ni kadde'een. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Tinni kaddaachchinna Manjiink Belti dageechchi ba'eeka haso'anna anjiro'ate kadeemmaxxeten.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mat. 18:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hujammake Tomme Mannika Fakkeenna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Ardi tenne laqande'n hedhe'naan Yessuusi mitte mammaassa insa'ne'n mammaake; Yessuussi Iyyerusaalemi'a shiqe'emmaxxee mannake'n Mageniinxi mootumma ta'anni leellita'neechcho insa'ne'n labbemmaxxeetemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Tennexxe isi hiyyee qici: «Mitti ulfeesseme'ek manjichchi moyanjummatika baallooma adhdhe higo'a bayyi boga me'e. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ifike erganjuwwi giddii'n tomme ye'eexxi mitte mittenge tomme tomme minaane uwweexxi insa'nee, ‹Illee iima hige dagannoxxee konnee maallaqinni daddalle› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />«Ookkone bogik manni kinni isoo gibe'emmaxxe'e, ‹Kunni manjichchi no'o'ni moyo'a eenabe'no› hina'n isi me'eechchi uduma erganjuwwa ergine.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />«Kaddo malee kunni manjichchi moyanjooke kadeexxi illee iima higeexxi ifike bogiba dage. Iikki ergajuwwinna isi uwweeka maallaqa daddalee me'e ibiseexxa ege'natee insa'ne ye'ise.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />«Taakkaak erganji shiqeexxi iso'ni ‹Goottaa! Ane'ni uutettaxxi minaane tomme minaane ibisse'een› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />«Iikki goottinna; ‹ati xuraameessi erganji eloxxe assitetten heenooxxe yaane'n xuurameesake kadde afendeettaxxee tomme qachchuwwa'ni ati'a baalloomi uwwemeedheen› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />«Langak ergajinna shiqeexxi ‹Gootta! Ane'n uutettaxxi minaane onde minaane ibisse'een› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />«Gootti isikinna, ‹Ateenna onde qachchuwwa'n baalloonse'ennen› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />«Weli erganjinna shiqeexxi hiyyee qici, ‹Anke Goottaa! Ane'ni uuteettaxxi atixxii minaane kunnise; iseenna hoccote'ni guduunfe masseennan. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Tennee assennechchi ati massexxebexxong adhdhitattoke rokkebexxonginna haa'mitattoke hunnaameessa manjo kaddeettaxxe'e atee sodaatennaxxeeteni.›<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />«Gootti isikinna iso'ni hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, ‹Koo ati fuggichchi erganji, afo'o atikenni haasoottettenxe ate'n murannoni. Ani massedhebe'noong adhdhannoke rokebe'nookinna haa'mannoke hunnaammeessa manjo kadeennexxa egendeetexxen, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />mayeeteta maallaqa anka daddale ibisammake manna'n uwwa gophpheettachchi? Silaati aninna dagennexxi maallaqa anka ibisemmalchinninni welti adhdhannan.›<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />«Ookkonneechchi uduma iikki goottinna ookko uure'emmake manna'n ‹Isixxa minaane isonaa'n aaxxineexxi tomme minaane afe'emmakee uwwe!› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />«Insa'nenna iso'ni, ‹Goottaa! Woldonni isiqqa tomme minaane afe'een!› hine.<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />«Gootti iikkinna hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, ‹Ha'noo'n kulo, afeenge manji'a caala uwwendaan, mitteelchonna afebaakenaa'n kinni itti afeenxi midde isinaa'n adhdhendaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:2">Mar. 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luq. 8:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Yaane kinni ani insa'ne'ni moyajoke kada anxa gibeemmaka ookkone anka naapha kabaa iyyedaggineexxi ani edo insa'nee gorra'we!› »<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yessuusi tenne haaso'echchi uduma Iyyerusaalemi'a me'ate'n insa'ne edo hedhemman.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yessuusi Lumoke Ulfinninni Iyyerussaalemi E'yeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Debire Zayiti hiyyendaaxxe kooba qarqara hedheeke Beetefaagenna Biitaaniya hiyyemmaake olla'uwwibaa shiqeexxi ifixxe hordofeeyye giddii'n lame hiyya'n ergee qici, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />«Ha'noo edo hedheeke olla'uwwibaa marree! Giddi'anna e'yitineexxi ayyinna iso'ni haranga gulufe ege'nebaaka harretiki darmichchi usuremeena'a affinaan; isoonna tikkine iyyedagge. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ayyinna ha'noo, ‹Maye'e isoo tikkina'ne?› hiyye qoroole, ‹Isi Goottake hasisammaxxeeten hitineexxi ookkone manjo'n kulle.› »<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ergememmakiirinna mareexxi Yessuusi insa'ne'n kulemmaqicishsha yaane duuchchi kaddee'na anfe. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Insa'nenna ookkone harretika darmichhco tinka'neenge'n annuwwi isiki, «Konnee harretika darmichcho tikkina'neechchi mayeete?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Insa'nenna, «Goottakee isi hasisaammaxxeeten» hine hiissine haasoonne. <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Insa'nenna ookkone harretika darmichcho Yessuusibaa iyyedangeegechchi uduma seemma ifi ifixxa ookkone darmichchike dudduri hana uggineexxi Yessuusii gulufinse. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yessuusinna me'aa wodda manni seemma ifi ifixxa orake'n fayaamman.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yessuusinna Debire Zayitexxe koobaba'a adadde me'aammake oribaa shiqee wodda isoo hordofaammak lomooshsha heddi manni ookkone uudeemmake mambe'uwwixxee gammada'n hafuura gikki asseexxi Mageno saadate'n ke'e:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />«Goottiinke summinni daga'neeke moyanjixxa wodo!»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:2">Far. 118:2</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Nage'i iimate'n, ulfinnikinna ale iimate'ni Magenoke'e kadowwaal!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ookkonneechchi uduma ardi giddii'n mitte mitte Feerisito Yessuusii'i, «Barachchiisalloo! Hordofeeyye atixxi sammi hitaashsha xixi!» hite.<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yessuussinna, «Ha'noo'ni kulo insa'ne sammi hinoole kino raartaani» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Iyyerusaalemik Qachchi'a Oodheexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yessuusi Iyyerusaalmike qachchibaa shiqeexxi ookkone qachcha uude'e hiyya'ni isi'aa oodhee qic, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />«Atike nage'i'a hasisaachchi maachcho kadeexxa silaati telcho egende'ettele hitta eloxxemmaa! Yaane kinn tinni yaane atixxe illenaa'n sho'onde'een. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Naaphi atiki atixxe dowwe'ni dalla'iinsha buqeexxi atee rakkisaaxxe barra daggaani! <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Ateenna atike dallaa'i giddo hexxeexxa atixxa oose buttinake'ni gangalchinaan. Weli hana diingeebaak waale'naa'a ati giddo gaataak mitti kinji midde hedhabaan. Tinni kaddaachchi Mageni ati'a dageexxa yanna ege'naa gophphettaxxeeten.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Woyyichchi Galmi Giddo Daddalammakaara Fulcheexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yessuusinna galmi giddi'a e'yeexxi ookko dadda'laammaka manna gadhi'aa shorra'n <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />insa'ne'ni, « ‹Mini anki soodachchotike mine hiyyemaan› hiyyende borreessende'en; ha'noo kinni ‹isoo bokkaammetixxe wolo'o assexxine'en!› » hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erm. 7:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yessuusi barra barra'nini galmi giddo barachchiisa'nemmani. Ookkone wodda qeesetiki sooreessuwwi Muuseke seeriki barachchiisalluwwinna ardiinki akeekisanjuwwi isoo shiyatee hasa'nemmani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luq. 21:37</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Yaane kinn manni duuchchi Yessuusika haaso'a laqatee qalbeti iso'n hedhemmaxxee isoo shiyatee hasa'emmak manni mitteelchonna assa dande'ebaan.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Hoone Baalloominni Huja'neexxa Qoremeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Mitte barra Yessuusi galmi giddo arda barachchiisa'ni wengeele lallaba wodda qeesetiki sooresuwwinna Muuseke seerik barachchiisalluwwi geedhet welti isiba dange. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Insa'nenna, «Amo no'o'n kuli! Tenne yaanuwwa assitaattek hoone baalloominnite? Yookaan iitta assitattoshsha ati'a baallooma uwweek ayyete?» hine Yessuusi'i qorre. <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyye hiissee qici, «Aninna ha'no mitte yaane qoro. Ani'a hiissichcho uwwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohaannisixxi xammaqa Magenokenaa'nitemma moo yookaan manjokenaa'nitemma?»<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Insa'nenna weli'aan weli mari'anteexxi hine hiissine haasoonnee qici, « ‹Magenbaa'nitemmani› hinonnole, no'oo ‹eega, mayeeta iso'n amana gophphineemma?› hiyyaan. <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Yaane kinni no'oo, ‹Manjiinbaa'nitemman› hinonnole manji duuchchi Yohaannisii'i wabeekiinsha uuda'emmaxxe no'oo kinjik cancaqaan.»<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Tennexxee, «Habaa'nite kaddeexxa egennebe'no» hine hiissine haasonne. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Aninna hoone baalloominni tenne yaanuwwa assa'ennexxa ha'no'n kulaabe'no» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyinetike Hiddichchike Wiisalluwwika Mammaassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yessuusi konneechchi butti'a hedheeka mammaassa ardake'n hiyya'n mammaakate'n ke'ee qici, «Manjichchi mitti woyinetika hiddichcho kaalse wiisalluwwake'n kira uwweexxi bayyi boga me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa. 5:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Iikki woyinetik hiddichchinna ra'ee wodda geyaaka qoobbo isika uuno'a woyinetike hiddichchiki anni erganjuwwa ifikenaa'n mitte ookkone wiisalluwwibaa erge. Yaane kinni wiisalluwwi ookkone erganjo ganeexxi duwwixxe angan me'aashsha assine. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Higgeenna lebeexxi wele erganjo erge; isoonna iittanni ganne salphinseexxi anga duwwixxen me'aashsha assine. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Sakkaxxanna wele erganjo erge; insa'nenna konnee ganne madoossineexxi fulchine gadho hunne. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ookkonneechchi uduma ookkone woyinetike hiddichchik anni, ‹Yoona maa assennexxa woyya?› ‹Eeyyannoka anka belto ergannon, akimagaada insa'ne iso'o ulfeessinaaxxe hexxeen› hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />«Yaane kinni iikki wiisalluwwi belto isika anfe wodda weli'aa weli, ‹Kunni isoo dhaalaaken› ‹amme isoo shinno; karratinna no'oxxe kaddaan› hine. <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Tennexxe belto woyinetike hiddichchi fichchi giddii'n gadhi'a fulchineexxi shinne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Yoona ookkone woyineti hiddichchik gootti ookkone wiisalluwwa maa assaa?<verse eid="LUK 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />«Weyineti hiddichchik anninnna dagaan; ookkone wiisalluwwanna shiyeexxi woyinetika hiddichchonna wele wiisalluwwi'a uwwaan.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ardikinna tenne laqee wodda, «Abbo tinni kaddoqqe'e!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yessuusi kinni insa'ne wirri hiyye uuda'n hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">« ‹Jaaralluwwi tuffateek kinji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">dhaaddotike kade› hiyyende borreessendeexxi maa leellishshata?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Far. 118:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Konne kinji hana ibaak duuchchi bullo'aan; kunni kinjinna itti hana ibaak manji duuchchi caqa caqa hiyyaan.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Muuseke seeriixxi barachchiisanuwwanna qeesetiki sooresuwwi Yessuusi konne mammaassa insa'neexxe mammaakeexxa anfeexxi eettene yanna'inni iso abishsho yorre'emman; yaane kinni arda sodaante.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irbo Uwwatixxe Yessuusi'n Shiqeeka Qortuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Tennexxe Yessuusi'i abishshotee eldaaxxa yanna heqqe'na'nemmaa; galchalliinke baallooma'ninna murtetee isoo sa'issineexxi uwwatee geesisaaka fuggoka hiyyichcho afo'o isikenaa'n ganda'emma. Tennexxe qajeela manjo lebeexxi haaso'a isingenninni isoo fonxoratee dooyyaaka manna isiba ergine. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Iikki dooyyammak manninna Yessuusibaa shiqeexxi iso hiyyeqoree qici, «Barachchiisanjo ati dhugaa barachchiisaatexxenna haasoottaatexxa egeneeneni; Mageniinka oranna dhugaati barachchiisate malee'e ayyi'aanna gamissabexxon. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Qeesaari'a irbo uunonnaa eeti no'o uwwendemo yookaan uwwendebaa?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yaane kinni Yessuusi xaqaro insa'neexxa afeexxi insa'ne, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Mitte dinaare ane'n leellishe; konne maallaqi hana hexxeexxi misilenna iitti borreessemeek summi ayyike?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Insa'nenna «Qeesaariken» hine hiissine haasoonne.<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yessuusinna insa'ne, «Yoona Qeesaarika Qeesaari'a; Mageniinkanna Magenoke uwwe!» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Insa'nenna ardi edo haaso'ake haaso'inni iso'o fonxora dandeennebaan; tennexxe hiissichcho isika janjeexxi sammi hine.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Reyotenaa'ni Ke'atixxee Yessuusi'n Shiqinsheeka Qortuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />«Reyeek manni reyotenaa'ni ke'abaan» hiyyaake Seduuqitonaa'n mitti mitti shiqeexxi Yessuusi hiyya'ni qorren.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Erga. Huj. 23:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Barachchiisanjoo! Muuse no'aa mitti manji adhdheexxi manjichotenaa'n i'lebaangi reyyexxe kadoole, dayyi isik eettene isixxa are aadheexxi dayyo ifike sanne sa'isoowwaal hiyye borreesse'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:5">Lew. 25:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ta'aa torbaane dayyuwwa he'nemman; duuchchiingik angaf aadheexxi i'lebaang reye. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Langaki isik dayyinna eetteneen manjichcho galche. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Sakkakinna iittanni isee galche; konne qicinni torbaaniing isee galcha'n isenaa'ni i'linebaang renne. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Duuchchiingenaa'n udu'miteexxi manjichchotinna iittinna rerte. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Yoona torbaaniingi ise'e bado badonni aa'ne'emmaxxee iitti manjichcho reyotenaa'n ke'atixxa barra insa'ne giddii'n ayyixxe are kadda?»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'ni hiisseexxi hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Tenne buttaki manni aadhaani, heerumaan. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Reyotenaa'n ke'eexxi dagaaka baro alfate geyaake hiyyeme laakko'emaakiir iikki manni kinni aadhaba'a; heerumaba'a. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Insa'ne ergannatishsha kandammaxxee edi'aanna rennaba'a; reyotenaa'n ke'neemmaxxee insa'ne Mageniinxe oosen. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Reyeeki manni ke'atixxee Muuse kinni eettene qosorro giddii'n haaso'eeke haaso'ixxe jirte'n isi Gootta, ‹Abirihaamike Mageno, Yisaaqike Mageno, Ya'iqoobike Mageno› hiyyati iso'o ege'nisheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Fula. 3:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Tennexxee Mageni hedhoti hedhaake mannike Mageno malee'e reyaake mannike Magenobaan; duuchchiing isi'aa hedhoti hedhaanii.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Muuseke seerike barachchiisanuwwinaa'n mitti mitti isoo'o, «Barachchiisanjo eloxxe» haasoteeten hine. <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ookkonneechchi uduma afo'o w'o'me qortuma Yessuusi qoreek mitti manjinna hedhebaan.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniink Belt Ayyete Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi insa'ne'aa hiyyee qici, «Kiristoosi Daawwitike Belto iso hina? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Tinni kaddeechchi Daawwiti umo ifingenninni faaroti maxaafa'n hiyyee qici</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">« ‹Gootti anka Gootta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">«Midda anke'ni ofo'li<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Ani naapha atika lekka atixxi hunda sa'issanno qico'ni hiyyeen hiyyaan.» ›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Far. 110:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Yoona Daawwitinni iso'o ‹Anke Gootta› hiyye ye'aa'na Kirisitoosita hitta Daawwitike belto kada dande'a?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Muuseke Seerika Akeekisanjuwwa Xexxe'achchiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ardi duuchchi isi hiyyaaxxa laqa'nenge'n Yessuusi hordofeeye ifixxe'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Qeerraramma seemmuwwa oddo'weexxi erqe kayya mammarema, dikko giddonna ulfinniinka nage'a aadha, eeyyaakeerinaa'n, Ayihudiinke magenoonfachchotike minuwwa'ninna ulfinniinka barcumuwwa, jiluwwate'ninna ulfaatteexxa bakkuwwa eeyyaake Muuseke seerike barachchiisalluwwinaa'ni ifi heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Insa'ne soodachcho qeerrisate'n irkinseexxi aro'uwwa shi'witeexxe hiyyeeye melaalleka mine mulqinaan. Tennexxee insa'ne jabaxxe murte adhdhinaan.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Aro'o Shi'witeexxe Hiyyeette Manjichchoxxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesuus toggi hiyye uuda woda dureeyye uwwa ifixxa uwwa giddo ugendamaxxe galminexxe saaxine giddo uggitaa'naa afe. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Iittanni mitte aro'o shiwiteexxi mitte manjichonna lame saantime ookko uggita'naa afeexxi <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />«Ha'noo'ni dhugaate haaso'anen, tinni hiyyeette aro'o shiwiteexxi manjichcho duuchchingenaa'n caala uggite. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Insa'ne uunki anfeexxe karranaa'ni geye gateechchon; tinni manjichcho kinni hiyyeetende kaddeeni hexxe'e mitteelchonna ifi'aa gatilsitebaang affeechcho duuchcha uute.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Woyyichchi Galminxe Diigenshaxxa Haaso'exxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Mitte mitte isixxe hordofeeyyenaa'n, «Kunni galmi hitata eloke; fiixa kinoninna Magenokee uwwendeexxe uwwarinni danchooseme'een» hina'ni haasonna'neman. <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Yessuus kinni, «Tinni uudina'neexxi kino duuchchi mitti kinji miit hana hedhemaba diigemebaak gaatabaaxxe yanna dagaan; tinni duuchinxi kino digendaan.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muuxamiinke Barka Beesisuwwanna Shorema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Insa'nenna, «Barachchiisalloo, tinni kadaaki haanote? Tinni kaddaaxxi yanna gelteexxa egenanok beesis maacho» hine iso qorre.<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yessuussinna insa'ne'n hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Sobendinabaashsha ifi heqqedhdhe heddi mann, ‹Ani Krisitoositeni; yannatinna shiqe'eni!› hiyya'n anke summini dagaani; insa'neenna hordofinoqe'e. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Bagedokanna weekensha laqinna wodda mee soddate! Tinni yaanuwwa edise kada gattabaxxen; yaane kinni muuxami iikki wodda kadabaan.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuussi insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ardi ardake'ni moottuma moottumate'n kexxani. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Jabaxxi buttiinxi lele'manna gargar gargar hedheeke booncho'n kaddaan; solo'ikinna bala kaddaan; sodaachisaxxi yaanuwwanna lumolammi beesisuwwi iimate'n kadaan.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Tinn yaanuwwa duuchcha kaddeba edi darre manni ha'noo abidaan, shorshaan; anke summixxeenna Ayihudiinke magenoonfachchotike mine'ninna usuriinke mine'n haano sa'isinee uunaan; moyanjuwwinbaanna galchaluuwwinbaa ha'noo iyyemaaraan. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Tinni ha'noo ani'a dhugaa kuldno'a eloxxe yanna kaddaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Tennexxe hiisitinaake hiissichchixxe maa hiisitinaaxxa edisineexxi heda hassissabaaxxa godoba galchedhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luq. 12:11-12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Ani naaphi ha'nook duuchchi gareeranna moroma dande'abaaka haaso'anna beekuma ha'no'aa uwwannon. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Hadi ha'nook midde, dayyuwwi ha'nookiiri firuwwi ha'nookiirinna, jaaluwwi ha'nookiiri ha'noo sa'issee uuwwaan. Insa'nenna ha'no giddii'ni mitte mitte shinnaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Duuchchiing manni anke summi'a ha'noo jibbaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Yaane kinn mitti ha'nooke umik ordichchi midde ba'abaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ossusntetinna lubboo ifixxa gatlisitinaan.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyyerusalmixxe Ba'nexxe Yessuus Ediseen Haaso'eexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat. 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar. 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Yaane kinni Iyyeerusaalemi naaphik buqendee'naa afinaa wodda, eettene yanna ba'ne isexxi shiqeexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ookonne wodda Yihudake boga'n hedheeki manni koobatibaa baajowwaali; qachcha ookkene giddonna hedheekirinna ookko giddii'n fulowwaal; qachchii gadhi darre hedheekiirinna ookkene qachchi giddii'a e'yoqqe'e. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Tenne ba'nexxee borreesemeek raagi muuxemmaashsha tinni halo fulatixxenna mura woxatixxe yannan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos. 9:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Eetene yanna sila'witeexxeri'anna ununisitaaxxeri'a insa'ne aane'e. Jabaxxi rakko buttate'n, konne arda'ninna Mageniinxi muffe daggaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Insa'nenna wolaantichchik shiyemaan; gosa gsake ardi duuchchiba'aanna bojii'emaan. Ayihudake kadebaake ardik bari muuxemaa qico'ni Iyyerusaalemi alagik hirbeesendaan.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjiink Belti Langaxxa Dagaaxxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar. 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Lebeexxi Yessuusi hiyyee qic: «Arishshote'ni, agenjoke'ninna uurijuwwate'n beesisuwwi kadaan. Buttatke gosa gosak ardi abbaayatike luuljonaa'ninna danbala'iinxe ganenshanaa'n kexxeexxa sodaantee wixxirri hinaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Iyu. 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Wal. 6:12-13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Manni buttate'n daggaaxxa yaane heqqedhatenaa'n kexxeexxa alayik wekemaan. Eetene yanna iimatixxi daduwwa duuchcha sheke sheke hitaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Eeten yanna Manjink Belti hunnatinna lumooke ulfinninna duumachchi giddo dagaa wodda isoo anfaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Wal. 1:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Tinni yaanuwwa kadatee saffaaxxa yanna ha'nooxxi wodensha shiqqeemmaxxee qokki hitineexxi iimi'a uudde.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yessuusinna hiyya'n mammaakee qici, «Odi'iinka haqichchonna wele haqqe uudde. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Shafuwwi tenne haqqekiir qacaa wodda uudineexxi boni shiqeexxa ha'noon egendinaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Konne qicinni tinni yaane duuchcha kadda'naa affinaa wodda Mageniinxi moottumma shiqqeexxa ege'ne.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />«Dhugaate ha'no'n haaso'aannen, tinni yaane duuchcha muuxendaa qico'ni tinni ila saxxabaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Iimanna butta saxxaani hiyyichchi anki kinni sa'abaan.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jabaante Heqqeeccatixxee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Lebeexxi Yessuusi hiyyee qici: «Yaane kinni itatinna ha'wiinxe bira sa'nenni machcheti, foogalatinna bultetee hediyoti wixixxi hiyyati qalbe ha'nooxxi dillootabaashshaa ifi heqqedhdhe! Kada gophphoole itti barra ha'noo fonxorotishsha deedhanga abiddaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Iitti barranna butta'ni hedhaake duuchcha'ni fonxorotishsha itti daggaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Tennexxee kaddo'aa hexxeexxe duuchchanaa'ni gatatee'e, Manjiinke Belti edonna uuratee'e dandeetinaashsha duuchchi wodda jabaatinne soodatte.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yessuusinna barra barra'ni woyyichchi galmi giddo barachchiisa'neemmani. Hashsha kinni Debire Zayite hiyyendaaxxe koobabaa alale me'eexxi gala'neemmani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luq. 19:47</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ardi duuchchinna hiyyaxxa laqo'aa bariisa galmi giddi'aa isibaa daga'neman.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Shinno'a Malleeka Mala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Sa'ate hiyyemaak Kebbotike ayyaan ulfeesenmaxxi barra shiqqeeman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Fula. 12:1-27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Qeesetiki sooresuwwinna Muusseke seerk barachchiisalluwwi arda sodaateemmaxxee iso hitta shiyyaaxxa malaaman.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Seexanni tommenna lame ergameeyenaa'n mitteke kadeeke Asiqorootuke Yihuda'n e'ye. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yihudanna qeesetiki sooresuwwibaanaa Woyyichchi galmike heqqanjuwwike ajajaluwwibaa mareexxi hitta asse isoo sa'isse uwwaaxxa insa'nenni welti mari'ate. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Insa'nenna tenne yaane'n gammande; maalaqakanna isi'aa uuno'a weli aange. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yihudanna weli aageexxi ardi hedhebaxxe bakka'n Yessuusi insa'nexxe anga'n sa'isseexxi uwwashsha eldaaxxa yanna heqqedhaaman.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Sa'atike Ayaanxa Hirbaata Ifixxe Ergameeyyen Welt Iteexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Sa'atika gedhechchi dulemaak kebbotik ayyaan shiqe. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yessuusi, «Sa'atika hirbaata indonaa no'aa martineexxi qixxeesse» hiyyeexxi Pheexiroosiinna Yohaannisii'i erge. <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Insa'nenna, «Sa'atika hirbbaata no'oo haba qixxesinonaa eetaate?» hine isoo qore.<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Qachchiinbaa e'yitinna wodda kunse waabiki wode'e dukeeki manjichchi ha'nonni afemaani; isoo hordofineexxi isi e'yaake mine'ni welti e'ye! <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Ookkone minka annanna ‹Barachchiisanji atee'e, anxe hordofeeyyenni welti sa'atixxa ita itannoxxi keesumatixxi kuta haba hexxee? Hiyya'neen› isoo hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Isinna iimixxe fooqe'n hexxeexxa fayende qixxeesendeexxa ba'laxxa kuta ha'noo'ni leelishaan; ha'noonna ookkonna qixxeesse.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Iitti lamiinxi hordofeeyye mariteexxi duuchchixxi yaane Yessuusi insa'ne'ni kulemmashsha kaddee'naa affeexxi sa'atika hirbaata ookko qixxeesite. <verse eid="LUK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Hirbaata itatixxi yannanna geltee wodda, Yessuussi ifixxe ergameeyyen welti itate ofo'le. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Isinna insa'ne'aa hiyyee qici, «Rakko adhdhebe'no edi darre ha'noonn welti konnee sa'atika hirbaata itonaa lumooshsha yore'eennan. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ha'noo'ni kulo konne hirbaatixxi buqo yaane Mageniinxe moottuma'ni ifake kadda qico'ni ta'aan edi'aa langaxxa konnee sa'atika hirbaata haranga itabe'non.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuussi buuda adhee galatefata'n hiyyee qici, «Tenne yawwee qoqoodemme. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ha'no kulo, Mageniinxe moottuma dagga qico'ni ta'anaa'n safennexxi tennee woyinnexxe gummaka bulbulo ha'wabe'non.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />So'iinxa kebbonna aadhe galateefate kukute insa'ne uwwa'n «Ha'nooxxe uwwemaak ank maali konneten; isoonna anxe qalli'a assedhdhe» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Iitaani hirbaat uduma buuda eettene adhdheexxi hiyyee qici, «Tinni buuda ha'nooxxe dunendaaxxe anxe mundenni kaddeexxe haaroxxe kakon. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Yaane kinn anee sa'ise uwwaake manjichixxi anga kunse anxe anganni qore giddo hexxeen. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Manjinki Beltiqa isi'a murendema qico'ni reyaan yaane kinni Manjinka Belti sa'isse uwwaake ookkone manjichi'aa isi'aa aane'e!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Insa'nenna, no'o giddii'n tenne yaane assa dande'aak ayyete? Hita'n weli'aan weli qorre.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchiingenaa'n Sa'aak Ayyete?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Iittanna Hordofeeyetinna no'oo duuchchiingenaa'n sa'aak ayyete hita'ni weli moromate'n kexxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat. 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luq. 9:46</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'aa hiyyee qici: «Gosa gosake ardik moyanjuwwi arda ifike'n moyaan; insa'nek galchaluwwinna ardake'e eloxxa assaakera hiyyemaan. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Yaane kinn ha'noo iitta kadinoqqe'e; tenne irra ha'noo giddii'ni lumok kadeek shiixxokishsha kadowwaal, sooresa kadeekinna ergatemammakishsha kadowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ofo'leexxi itaakenaa'ninna yookaan ergataakenaa'n hoonte lumok? Ookkone ofole itaakebataa? Ani kinni oddo ha'nooxxe'n ookkene ergatemaamakishshaten. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ha'noo rakko anxe duuchcha'ni ti'ni hitinee aninni welti turtine'een. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Tennexxee anik anni anee baalonseemmashsha aninna ha'noo moottuma anxe'ni baalonsanon. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Ha'noo anxe moottumma giddo anxe qorenaa'n ittinaa'n ha'witina'n; mootette'ni ofoldineexxi ookkonee tommenna lame Isira'eelike gosati minke arda'n murtino'aa ha'noo baalonsanon.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat. 19:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pheexiroos Yessuus Waakataaxxa Ediseenni Kulendeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Lebeexxi Yessuusi hiyyee qici: «Simi'ooni!, koo Simi'ooni! Kunse Seexan dinnetishsha ha'noo soro'aa haase'een. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Yaane kinn amana atixxi baxxabaasha ani atixxee soodatenne; atinna illee iima higgato wodda dayyuwwa atika jabees.»<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Phexxiroosinna, «Anke Gootta usuremateenna kadi reyotee atinni welt me'atee qixxefate'eennen» hiyyeexxi hise haasoe'e.<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yessuussinna iso'n, «Koo Pheexiroosi ate'n kulo! Lukichchi baroodeba edi darre techcho isoo ege'nebe'non hita'n sasele anee waakataton» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuussi insa'nee'e, «Maalaqiinka subbaa, qalqalloo, kophee abixxitinebaang ha'noo ergenne wodda meya ha'no'aa xe'yeechchi hedhemaa?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Insa'nenna, «Xe'emangeelchi hedhemabaan» hineexxi hiisine haasonne.<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yessuusinna insa'nen hiyyee qici, «Ta'a kinn maalaqiika suba afe'eek iyyedhowwaal, wolaantichcha afebaak seema ifixxa gurgureexxi hidhowwaal. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Tennee ha'noo'ni kulaaneni, ‹Fuggoxxa hujamakeeruwwinni welti laako'emeen› hiyyende borreesendeemashshanni tinni anxee borreesendemmaxxi yaane dhugaaten kada hassissaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Hordofeeyyetinna, «Gootta, kunse lami wolaantichchi hedhdheeni» hiteexxi hiisite haasotte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Isinna insa'ne, «Geyaan» hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yessuussinna edi woddishanni qachchi giddii'n fuleexxi Dabire Zayiitixxe koobaba'aa me'e; hordofeeyye isixxinna isixxa duuka me'ite. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ookkona geyeexxi insa'ne'e, «Hega uushote'n ibbinabaasha soodate» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Insa'nenaa'n kinji darbemeexxi geyamake bayyinni qico bayate me'eexxi gulfate hiyya'n soodatee qici, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Anke annaa, fedhi atixxe kadoole tenne rakkotixxa buuda anenaa'n hanqisi; yaane kinni fedhii anxe kaddebaaki atixxe fedhiishsha kaddowwaali.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Iimik erganjinna isoo jabeeso'a dageexxi iso'n leelle. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Isinna yo'oshsha wixxirri hiyyeexxi jabeesee soodata'neemman; daffi isikinna butti'a mundetishsha coccoba'neemman.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Isinna soodataamabaa'ni ke'eexxi hordofeeyye ifixxiba'a dage; insa'nenna yaadotixxe birasa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa diinphee'naa afeexxi insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />«Mayee diiphinna? Hega uudemate'n ibbinabaashsha kexxine soodate!»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussixxa Abidensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-55">Mat. 26:47-55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesuusinna haaso'ande'n hedhenaa'n kunse heddi manni dage; Tommenna lami giddii'n mitti Yihuda hiyyemamak insa'ne edo me'a'neman. Yihudanna Yessuus sunqedho'a Yesuusba'a shiqe. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yessuusi kinni Yihuda'a, «Koo Yihuda! Yoona Manjinka Belto sunqati sa'isite uutaato?» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Yessuussini welti hedhemakiir kadda'neexxa yaane aneexxi «Goottaa, wolaantichchiki insa'nee lolloo?» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Insa'ne giddii'ni mitti qeesetike sooresike erganjixxa middixxa mansha wolaantichchik woxe.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Yessuusi kinni, «Tinni langaxxa kaddoqqe'e» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e; ookkone manjichchixxa manshanna qaqqabeexxi fayyise.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi isoo abido'aa dageeka qeesetika sooresuwwa, woyyichchi galmiinke heqqanjuwwiika ajajalluwwanna, ardiinxa geedhe hiyyee qici, «Anee shittiinsha abidino'a wolaantichchanna borja adhitine dagginee? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Woyyichchi galmi giddo bara barranni ha'noon welt hedhenna wodda anee abidineemabaan; tinni kinni ha'nooxxenna dukanatike baaloomixxe yannan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luq. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pheexiroosi Yessuussi'i Waakateexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusii'i abinde aa'ne me'ineexxi ookkone qeesetike sooreesike mine'n iyyemmarre. Pheexiroosinna bayyate'e isoo hordofa'neman. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Manni baxxetike dalla'i giddo giira ha'isheexxi mitteba offoleenaa'a Pheexiroosi dageexxi insa'ne giddo offo'le. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Isinna giira ifama darre'ni ofo'le'naa mitte dubarcho erganjo hubate uudexxi isoo, «Kunniqqaa isinni hedheman» hite.<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Pheexiroosi kinni, «Tee manjichcho ani isoo ege'nebe'non» hiyyeexxi waakate.<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Shiixxoxxe yannani uduma welkinna isoo afeexxi, «Ati insa'nenaa'ni mitteken» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Pheexiroosi kinni iso'n, «Koo manjichcho antebaan» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Mitte saate qico tureexxi weli manji mami belo isoo, «Kunni manjichchi Geliilake manjo kadeemmaxxee'e isinni hedhemake kadeexxa kokaken» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Pheexiroosi kinni, «Koo manjichcho ati mayiinxe yaanexxee haasotaatexxa ani ege'nebo'non» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e. Eetene yanna isi haaso'ande'ni hedhee'naa lukkichchi baroode. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Goottikinna wirri hiyye Pheexiroosi'i uude. Pheexiroosinna, «Telcho lukkichchi baroodebaang sasele anee waakataton,» hiyyemaka Goottiinkla hiyyichcho qalli hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Pheexiroosinna gadhi'aa fuuleexxi hiiqise oodhe.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loliink Manni Yessuusi'ni Gacifate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Ookkone wodda Yessuusi heqqa'nemaki mann iso'ni gacifata'n isoo ganne'nemani. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Insa'nenna alba isika bunqe ganna'ni isoo, «Amoo mee raaga haaso'i ayyetee atee ganeeki?» hi'na'ni qorra'neman. <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Insa'nenna wele heddo yowwichchuwwanna isoo yowwina'neman.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuus Ayihudiinxe Songo'n Shiqeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Bogi soode wodda ardinxe geedhenna, qeesetiki sooresuwwinna Muusseke seerik barachchiisalluwwi mitteba bukki hiyye; Yessuusinna songote'n aa'ne iyyemarre <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Insonna hinee qici, «Amo no'o'n kul Kiristoosi atete?» hine. Yessuusinna kinni insa'ne'n hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'ee qici, «Ha'noo'ni kulonoleenna anee amandinabaan. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Ha'noo qorrenlenna hiissichcho ani'a harnga uutinabaan. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Yaane kinni tenne yannanaa'n safeexxi Manjiink Belt lumoke Magenke midda'ni offo'laan.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Insa'ne duuchchiingi isoo, «Yoona atita Mageniinke beltontaa?» hine qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Yessuussinna, «Eeti, ha'noo hitineeshanden» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ookkonneechchi uduma insa'ne «Yoona maa dhuga kula hassiissa kunse no'o umo no'ngenninni isi ifike afo'inni haaso'aa'naa lanqeennen» hine.<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi'i Philaaxxoosi Edonna Heerodoos Edo Shiqeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ookko bukkiyeemak duuchchiing mitteba ke'eexxi Yessuussi'i iyyemareexxi Philaaxoosi edo shiqinsheexxi <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />hina'ninna iso kulnete'n ke'nee qici, «Kunn manjichchi arda no'oka dedhisanna Qeesaari'aanna irro uwwendabaashsha hoyya'naa anfene; iittanna ‹Ani moyanjo Kiristoosite'n› hiyya'n haaso'aan» hine.<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Philaaxoosinna Yessuusii'i «Ati Ayihudiinke moyanjoo?» hiyyexxi qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yessuusinna, «Ati hitetenshanden» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ookkonneechchini uduma Philaaxoosi qeesetike sooresuwwi'aanna ardakee, «Miitte ballesanna midde konne manjichcho'n ani afebe'no» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Insa'ne kinni, «Kunn manjichchi Geliilaa'n kaba'i qico'n Yihudake bogi giddo duuchcha'n barachchiisa'n arda weekenshate ke'issaan!» hine.<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Philaaxoosinna, «Galiila» hiyyemaamaka hiyyichcho laqe wodda «Isi kunni Geliilake manjotaa?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Yessuusi dageek Galilike galchanaa'nite kadeexxa Philaaxoos e'gene wodda iso'o Hordisibaa erge; Heeroodisinna ookkone wodda Iyyerusaalemi hedheman. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Heeroodisinna Yessuusii'i afee wodda lumoosha gamade. Yessuusixxa odo laqeemmaxxe iso'o uudo'a heddolle yora'eman; iittanni Yessuusi mambe'a assaana'a uudo'a halcha'eman. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Heerodisinna Yessuusi'i heddo qortuma qore; Yessuusi kinni mitte hissichonna isi'a hisebaan. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Qeesetiki sooresuwwinna Muusseke seerxxi barachchiisano ookko uurineexxi isoo jaba qico ku'linaamman. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Heeroodisinna isike loliinki manninni welti Yessuusi'i tuffante iso'n gacifate; danchite seemmanna iso'n oddeeseenxi Philaaxoosibaa isoo ille iima hige me'aashsha asse. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Eetenne barra'n Heeroodisinna Philaaxoosi welti jaalomme; konneechchi edo insa'nexxe oddo'ni kajjo hexxemani.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi'ni Reyotixxa Murte Murndeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoh. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Philaaxoosi qeesetika sooreesuwwa, galchalluwwanna arda mitteba ye'eexxi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />insa'ne'ni hiyyee qici: «Isi ‹Arda fuggoxxe ke'issaan› hitineexxi konne manjichcho anibaa iyyedagineen. Aninna kunse isoo ha'noo edo qore qo'nisenexxi ha'noo isoo ku'ltineexxa ku'la duuchcha konne manjichcho'n mitte balleesanna afeebo'non. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Iitanni Heeroodisinna iso'n mitte balleesanna afa gopheemmaxxe'e isoo no'oobaa illee iima erge'een. Yoona kunni manjichcho isoo reyote geesisaaxxa mitte balleesanna asse'ebaan. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Tennexxee ani isoo jadhafenexxi wocci assaaneni.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />(Ayyaanaa ayyaana'ni mitti usuremeek manji insa'ne'aa tikemaashsha hasisaammaxxeten.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Konne laakkosik yaadi edike mirqisanjo maxaafuwwa'n afemabaan</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ardi duuchchi mittebaa «Konnee manjichcho fugguse; Berbaanii'i no'o'aa tiki!» hiyya'n hogise. <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baribaaninna qachchi giddo weekensha ke'issat manjo shiyeexxi usurinke mine'ni usuremeemmake manjomana.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Philaaxoosi Yessuusii'i tiko'aa haseexxi langaxxa ardake'n haaso'e. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Yaane kinni ardi, «Isoo fannsi! Fannsi!» hiyya'ni hogise.<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Philaaxxoosi sakaaxxa yanna arda hiyyee qici «Kunn manjichchi hujeexxi balleesa maachcho? Ani iso'o reyote geesisaaxxa balleesa afa gopheennaxxee'e jadhafisenexxi wocci asanoni.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Yaane kinni insa'ne, «Fannisi!» hinaa'ni hoginse. Hogi insa'neknna haranga bira sa'eeke kade. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Tennexxee insa'ne hansemashshani Philaaxoosi Yessuussi'n murte mure. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Lola ke'isseexxi manjo shiye usurememaka Baribaani'i insa'neke hasitishshani tikeexxi Yessuusi'i kinni eenneshsha asino'aa insa'ne'aa sa'isseexxi uwwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussixxa Fannote'ni Fannseensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Tennexxe Yessuusi'i aa'nexxi abinde me'inaa'naa Simi'ooni hiyyemeeka Qereenake bogi manji haddi giddi'ni qachchiinbaa dagaa'naa anfe. Isoonna abindeexxi Yessuusixxa fanno dukinseexxi Yessuusi udumi'ni me'aashsha assine.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Heddi ardinna Yessuusi'i horidofa'nemaani. Insa'ne giddini lumoo qico yaada'ni laphphe ga'nitaa'ni ooxxaamaxxi melaalle hexxemani. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yessuusi knn melaalletibaa wirri hiyyeexxi, «Ha'noo Iyyerusaalemixxi melaalle ha'no'aanna ha'nooxxe oose'aa oodhdhe malee'e ani'aa ooxxinoqqe'e! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kunnise, ‹Ilde egendebaaxxi, oosse afebaaxxinna unuunsite egendebaaxi melaale eebisendexxi› hiyyendaaxxe barra dagaani. <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Eetene yanna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">« ‹Manni koobuwwa, «No'o'ni hana ibbee!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">tullichwwakanna «No'oo sho'wee!» hiyyate'ni ke'aani.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Wal. 6:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tinni yaane duuchcha manji shamooxxe haqqee'ni iitta assa'neexxe kaddoole bagoxxi haqqee'n fa'ii hitata assinu?» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Iitaani fuggoxxa asseeka wele lame manna Yessuussini welti shino'a adhdhine me'ine. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />«Qeraanyyote uminke qoonjo» hinna bonchcho genne wodda ooko'o Yessuussi'i fannote'ni fannise. Iittani lamiinxa dabbaleeyyenna Yessuussike midda'ninna bitta'a'ni fannse. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yessuussinna «Anke anna kunn mann huja'nexxa ege'na gophphemaxxe'e insa'ne gattowaali hiyy!» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Far. 22:18</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Mannikinna Yessuusixxe seemma'ni hixxa ibilseexxi qoodemme. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Ardikinna uurexxi uuda'nemman. Akeekisano Yihudiinxi Yessuusi'i «Wele manna fayyiseemaani; yoona isi Magenokenaa'ni fileme'eke Kiristoosite kaddole ta'a umo ifika fayyilsowaali!» hiyya'ni isoo gacifaamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Far. 22:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Iittani loliinki manninna iso'n gacifata'n isibaa shiqeexxi qararitaaxxa ha'waa isi'a uuwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Far. 69:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />«Ati Ayihudiinke moyanjo kadetexxenni amoo umo atika anjir!» hina'nemman. <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Isike umi iimi darre «Kunn Ayihudiinke moyanjoni» hitaaxxi borro Yessuusike umi iimi darre fannote'n uggineemman.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yessuusinni welti fanniseendeexxe dabaaleeyyeenaa'ni mitti Yessuusii'i, «Ati Kiristoosindebaa? Amo mee umoo atikanna no'oo anjiri!» hiyya'ni isoo yowwaammani. <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Yaane kinni langaki balleesanji Yessuusi'i yowwamaka manjichcho, «No'oo kaba tenne fakkaattaaxxe murte giddo he'nee'naa ati tennee hitato wodda Mageno midde soddataboxxo? Hiyye xixe. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />No'o hunjeneexxe balleesa'aa murrite adhdhiyyo no'oxxi dhugaandeni; kunn manjichchi kinn balleesechchi hedhebaani.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ookkonneechchi uduma iikki manjichchi Yessuusii'i «Moottuma atixxe'ni dagato wodda anee kassi hiyyi!» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yessuusinna isoo, «Dhugaate ati'aa hiyyaanen telchonni aninni welti Gannatette'ni hexxatoni» hiyye.<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Tinni kadde'ek barrixxe Jaane saate woddaman; eettene yannanaa'ni safee sallane saate qico'ni bogi duuchchi dukkane. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Arishshotinna dukkande; Woyyichchi Galmiinke seematik golinna haqqi hiyye oddo dareme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Fula. 26:31-33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yessuusinna hafuura gikki asseexxi, «Anke anna lubbo anixxa atixxe anga'ni magane uwwaneni» hiyye; tennenna hiyyeechchi uduma hafuur isik fule.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Far. 31:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ookkoo hedhemak dhibba loliinka manniki sooresi tenne kaddeexxa yaane uude wodda, «Kunn manjichchi dhugaandinni qulchakemaani!» hiyye Mageno ulfeese.<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Tenne kaddeexxa yaane uudatee ookkoo bukki hiyyemaaki ardi duuchchi kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha uude wodda yaado lumoxxenni qoma ifixxa ga'na'ni ifi ifike minibaa hige. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Yaane kinn Yessuusii'i addaa ege'neemak manni duuchchi Geliilaa'n kexxe isoo hordofaammaxxi melaalna tenne kadda'nexxa yaane uuda'ni hanqonni uuriteemaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luq. 8:2-3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Moogensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Yoona elokinna qullichchi manji Yihudenxe songoxxe geedhexxe gamo kade'ek Yooseefi hiyyemaak manjichchi hedheman; <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />kaddo malee'e isi Ayihudiinxe mari'eninna huje insa'nexxe'ni welti guddemabaani. Isinna Armatiyaasi hiyyemaake Ayihudink qachcha'ni hedhe'e Mageniinxe moottumaxxa dago heqqedhaaman. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Isinna Philaaxoosiba mareexxi Yessuusika rensha isi'aa uwwo'a kadhate.<verse eid="LUK 23:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ookkonneechchi uduma isi renshakanna butti'a dirriseexxi layinotixxe seemmani mirqe. Huuni manjinna moogemebak kinjo qonte giisinek hirreesi giddo mooge. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Tenneenna assek Edi Sanbatixxe qophpheefachchotixxe yannaxxe safa'nittemman.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Yessuusi'i hordofeexxi Geliilaa'n daggeemaxxi melaale Yoosefini welti marte'e moogi boochonna rensha hitta massineexxa uude. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ookkonneechchi uduma insa'ne ifike minibaa hingeexxi eloka foole affe'exxa shittonna qimame qophpheesine. Yaane kinni seerinshanni Edike Sanbatixxa barra hafuura adhdhine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Fula. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:14">Lew. 5:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Moogokenaa'ni Ke'aa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Eetten torbatixxe sirtixxe barra'ni iitti melaale qophpheesiteemmaxxa shitto abixite hara bariisa mooginbaa marte. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Insa'nennaa moogiinxe bale'ni cunfeemaki kinji goggo'me'naa anfe. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Yaane kinni insa'nenna giddi'aa e'yinee wodda Gootta Yessuusika rensha anfebaan. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Insa'nenna tenne yaane mambe'aa hena'neege'ni calalqa'neexxa seemma oddo'wee'eki lami mann insa'ne bira uurre. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Iitti melaaletinna yo'oshsha sodaatexxi butti'a heeshshi hiteeba manni, «Mayee'e hedhotike kabeeka reyeeke mannixxe oddo'ni hassinna'ne? Insa'ne'e hine. <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Isi kaba hedhebaani; isi ke'e'eeni. Isi Geliila hedhema wodda ha'noo'ni kulemaxxa kassi hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‹Manjiinki Belti cubballeeyetixxe anga'ni sa'isseme uwwemo'aana fannote'ni fannsemo'a sakka baronna ke'a isixxi gattabaaxxen› insa'ne hiyye'eman.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat. 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar. 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luq. 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ookkonneechchi uduma iitti melaalna Yessuusika hiyyichcho kassi hite. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Insa'nenna mooginbaa'ni hingeexxi tenne duuchcha tommenna mittingeenna wele gateke duuchchi'a kulle. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Tenneenna ergameeyyete'n kuldeexxi Megidelixxi Maaraminna, Yohaana, Ya'iqoobixxi ama Maaraminna insa'nenni welti hexxemaaxxe wele melaalle. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Yaane kinn kunni hiyyichchi insa'ne'ni curruuqate labbe. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Yaane kinn Pheexiroosi qophphi hiyye ke'eexxi moogememabaa gonge; ookkonna heeshi hiyye bale uuda wodda layinotixxa seema calla afe; isinna tenne yaanexxe'e mambe'aa hiyya'ni ifike minibaa me'e.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Lame Hordofeeye'ni Leelexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Eetene barra'ni Yessuusixxe hordofeeye giddi'ni lame Iyyerusaalemi'ni tommenna mitte kiillo metire qico'ni bayyateke Ema'uusi hiyyemaake olla'ibaa me'inamaani. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Insa'nenna tenne kaddeexxe yaane duuchchi'a weli'aan weli haasona'nemaani. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Tenne yaane weli'aan weli haasona'ninna mari'anta'nege'ni Yessuusi umi isinginini insa'ne biri'aa shiqeexxi insa'nenni welti me'a'nemaani. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Yaane kinni insa'ne isoo illet uunda'n ayyete kadeexxa egenena dandenebaan.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Isinna insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Ora me'itinaa'ni weli'aan weli mordina'n haasotina'neexxi tinni yaanuwwa maachcho?» hiyyexxi insa'ne qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Insa'nenna yaanda'ni qexerri hine uurine.<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Insa'ne giddi'ni mitti Qeleyoophpha hinaaki hiyyee qici, «Ati Iyyerusaalemi giddo keesumate kadde hexxeetek atenni calla hiyyotebaata? Eetene barruwwa'ni ookko'o kaddeexxa yaane egendeboxxo hiyyotebaata?» hiyyexxi qore.<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />«Tinni kaddeexxi yaane maachchosi?» hiyyexxi Yessuusi insa'ne qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">«Naazireetike Yessuusi'n kaddeexxe yaanexxeten!» hine iso'ni hiisine qici «Isi Mageni edonna manji duuchchi edo hujetinna haaso'ik jabake wabeekamman. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Isoona qeesetixxi akeekisanuwwanna ja'laabuwwi reyotitte murte'a isoo sa'issine uuneexxi fannote'ni fanniseeni. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />No'o kinn Isira'eeli'i wodaak isoten hinee iso'ni adde asse'neenan. Kaddo malee'e tinn yaane kaddeexxeni telchi sakkaaxxe barraani. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />No'o giddi'ni mooginbaa mariteexxi mitte mitte malaale kinn no'oo manmbe'a assite'een. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Yaane kinn insa'nen isika rensha gonphee wodda hedhotike kade'eeni hitaaxxa eriganna waleelati uundenben hita'ni higge daggeemman. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Ookkonneechchi uduma no'oo giddii'ni mitti mitti mooginbaa marrek manni melaalle haasotemashshanni kaddee'naa anfe. Kaddo malee'e iso'o Yessuusi anfebaan.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'ni hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo qalbeefatinabaakinna wabeeko haasoteexxa duuchcha qalbe ha'nooxxi rakkine amandabaake! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Kiristoosi tenne rakko adhdhiyyo ulifnibaa e'yiyyo isi'a hasisangebaata?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Muusenaa'ninna wabeeko duuchchinaa'n safeexxi isixxe'e maxaafuwwa duuchcha'ni borreesendeexxa insa'ne'aa tike.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Insa'nenna me'inamake olla'ibaa shinqe wodda Yessuusi bayya me'a'neechcho insa'ne'ni labbe. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Yaane kinni insa'nenna «Bogi galigalo'ee'eeni; arishsho e'yito'aaten; tennexxee no'onba gali malee'e me'itooxxe!» hineexxi jabeesine iso kadhante. Isinna insa'neniba insa'nen galo'a gore. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Isinna insa'neni welti ofo'lee wodda so'iinxa kebbo aadhdhe galatefateechini udumi'a shahshateexxi insa'ne'a uwwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ookkonneechi uduma ille insa'nexxi banendee'naa isote kadeexxa egeene. Isinna ille insa'nexxi edii'ni miliqe. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Insa'ne weli'aani weli hinee qici, «Isi orake'ni no'o haasoosa'ni maxaafake'ni borreesendeexxa farri asseexxi kula wodda qalibe no'oxxi giiratishsha gubataamaba?» hine.<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Insa'nenna eettene yanna'ni ke'neexxi Iyyerusaalemi'a hinge me'ine; ookkonna tommenna mittiinga welti hedhemakeerinni mitteba bukki hinee'na afe. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Insa'nenna «Gootti Yessuusi dhugandinni ke'e'eeni! Simi'oo'ninna leelleen! Hina'nemman.»<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ookkonneechchi uduma orake'ni kaddeexxanna so'iinxa kebbo shashshate wodda hitta insa'ne'n egenemeeexxa insa'ne'ni kulle.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuussi Ifixxe Hordofeeyye'n Leellexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Erga. Huj. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Insa'ne tenne haasona'nege'ni Yessuusi umi isingeninni oddo insa'nexxe'ni uureexxi, «Nage'i ha'no'aa kadowwaal!» insa'ne hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Yaane kinn insa'ne geela uundeechcho labbe'naa alane sodaante. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Isinna insa'nee «Mayee sodaatina'ne? Mayee'e qalbe ha'nooxxi manda? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Ante kadeennexxa anga anxanna lekka anxa uude! Ane'ni uudinesha hafuuri maalakanna micco afa gopheemmaxxe'e anee qaqqabine uude» insa'ne hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Isinna tenne'e hiyyexxi angatanna lekka ifixxa insa'ne'ni leelishe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Insa'ne gammashshotena'ni kexxeexxa isoo amana gonpheemmaxxe'e mambe'a hiyyande'ni he'nee'naa isi insa'nee «Indaachcho affine'e?» hiyye qoro. <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Insa'nenna dudhinsheexxe qulixxu'meka kutemaalcho mittenna aa'nexxi uune. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Isinna aadhdhexxi insa'ne edo ite.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Yessuusi insa'ne'n, «Ani ha'nonni welti hedhee'na Muuseke seera'n, wabeekoletike'ni, faarotik maxaafa'ninna anxe'e borreesendemaaxxi yaane duuchchi muuxema hasisaan hiyye'e ha'noo'ni kuleenek hiyyichcha konneten» hiyye. <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Woyyichcha maxaafuwwa qaabantaashsha sammo insa'nexxa bane. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Isinna insa'nee, «Kiristoosi rakko adhdhaani sakka baro reyotenaa'ni ke'aaxxa ediseen borreesende'en. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Isike summini aade aagatixxenna cubbotixxe gattowali'a Iyyerusaalemi'ni kexxe'e gosa gosake ardi'a lallabendaan. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Tenne yaanuwwaa ha'noo dhuga kula ha'noten. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Yoonaa! Ani anni aniki uwweexxa addachchiisa ha'no'aa erganoni; ha'noo kinni iimi'ni hunna seematishsha oddo'witina qico'ni Iyyerusalemik qachcha'ni turre.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Erga. Huj. 1:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Iimi'a me'eexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Erga. Huj. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi hordofeeye ifixxa Iyyerusaalemike qachchanaa'ni fulcheexxi Biitaaniya qico'ni adhdhe me'e; ookkonna anga ifixxa ke'isseexxi insa'ne eebisse. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Isinna insa'nee eebisa'ni insa'nenaa'n garigariti higee iimi'aanna me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Erga. Huj. 1:9-11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Insa'nenna isi'a sagandeexxi lumoke gammadinni Iyyerusaalemi'aa illee iima hinge. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Insa'nenna duuchchin wodda Mageno galtenfa'nita'n Woyyichchi Galmi giddi'n qoona'emaba'a.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>